export const warCardGameTranslationsByLocale = Object.freeze({"am":{"War Card Game":"የጦርነት ካርድ ጨዋታ","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"የጦርነት ካርድ ጨዋታ በመስመር ላይ — ክላሲክ የካርድ ፍልሚያውን ይጫወቱ","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"የሚታወቀውን የጦርነት ካርድ ጨዋታ ከሁለት እስከ አራት ተጫዋቾች ጋር በአገር ውስጥ ይጫወቱ። ካርዶችን ገልብጥ፣ በግንባር ቀደም እና ፊት ለፊት በሚታዩ ካርዶች ግንኙነቶችን ፍታ፣ እና እያንዳንዱን ካርድ በዚህ መሳሪያ ላይ አቆይ።","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"ከላይ ያለውን ካርድ ከእያንዳንዱ ተጫዋች ክምር ገልብጡት። ከፍተኛው ካርድ ጦርነቱን ያሸንፋል; እኩል ደረጃዎች ጦርነት ይጀምራሉ.","A quick example":"ፈጣን ምሳሌ","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"A 10 ምንም ይሁን ምን 6 ይመታል። ከፍተኛ ካርዶች ከተጣመሩ በጦርነቱ ውስጥ ያለው እያንዳንዱ ተጫዋች አንድ ካርድ ወደ ታች እና አንድ ፊት ወደ ላይ ያስቀምጣል; ከፍተኛው አዲስ ካርድ ክምርን ይወስዳል.","How to play":"እንዴት መጫወት እንደሚቻል","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"ይህ ስሪት በኖርስኬ kortspill ላይ የተረጋገጠውን የኖርዌይ ክሪግ ህግን ይከተላል። ከሁለት እስከ አራት ተጫዋቾች አንድ መደበኛ 52-ካርድ ንጣፍ ያለ ቀልዶች ይጋራሉ። ካርዶች በተቻለ መጠን በእኩል መጠን ወደ ታች ይቀመጣሉ; በሶስት ተጫዋቾች አንድ ካርድ በማይታይ ሁኔታ ተቀምጧል. ሁሉም ሰው የላይኛውን ካርድ አንድ ላይ ያገላብጣል። ከፍተኛው ደረጃ በጠረጴዛው ላይ ያሉትን ሁሉንም ካርዶች ያሸንፋል; ሻንጣዎች ምንም አይደሉም. Ace ከፍተኛ ነው እና 2 ዝቅተኛ ነው. ከፍተኛዎቹ ካርዶች ከተጣመሩ፣ ጦርነቱን የተቀላቀለ እያንዳንዱ ተጫዋች አንድ ካርድ ወደ ታች እና ከዚያም አንዱን ወደ ላይ ያደርገዋል። ከፍተኛው አዲስ የፊት አፕ ካርድ ሙሉውን ክምር ይወስዳል። ተጨማሪ ማሰሪያ ተመሳሳይ እርምጃ ይደግማል. ሁለቱንም የጦር ካርዶች ማቅረብ የማይችል ተጫዋች ይሸነፋል; ቀሪ ካርዶቻቸው ወደ ጦርነቱ ክምር ይቀላቀላሉ. ካርድ ያለው የመጨረሻው ተጫዋች ያሸንፋል። ጨዋታው በእድል ላይ የተመሰረተ ነው፣ ረጅም ጊዜ ሊወስድ ይችላል፣ እና ይህ እትም ሁሉንም ሊሆኑ የሚችሉ ተደጋጋሚ ቅደም ተከተሎችን ለመከላከል አይናገርም።","Frequently asked questions":"በተደጋጋሚ የሚጠየቁ ጥያቄዎች","How many players can play?":"ምን ያህል ተጫዋቾች መጫወት ይችላሉ?","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"ሁለት፣ ሶስት ወይም አራት ተጫዋቾችን ይምረጡ። ሁሉም ሰው አንድ መደበኛ 52-ካርድ ንጣፍ ይጠቀማል።","Which card is highest?":"የትኛው ካርድ ከፍተኛ ነው?","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"Ace ከፍተኛ ነው, ከዚያም ንጉሥ, ንግሥት, ጃክ እና 10 ወደ 2. ልብሶች ምንም ደረጃ የላቸውም.","What happens on a tie?":"በእኩል ጊዜ ምን ይሆናል?","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"በጦርነቱ ውስጥ ያለ እያንዳንዱ ተጫዋች አንዱን ካርድ ወደ ታች እና አንድ ፊት ወደ ላይ ያደርገዋል። ከፍ ያለ አዲስ የፊት አፕ ካርድ ሁሉንም ካርዶች በጠረጴዛው ላይ ያሸንፋል።","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"ለጦርነት በቂ ካርዶች ከሌለኝስ?","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"የፊት ወደ ታች እና ፊት ለፊት የተጋጠሙትን ጥንድ ማጠናቀቅ የማይችል ተጫዋች ተሸንፏል። የቀሩት ካርዶቻቸው በጦርነቱ ክምር ውስጥ ይቆያሉ.","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"ይህ ጨዋታ መለያ ይፈልጋል ወይ ካርዶቼን ይስቀሉ?","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"ቁ. ጨዋታው እና አማራጭ ቆጣቢው በዚህ መሣሪያ ላይ በዚህ አሳሽ ውስጥ ይቆያሉ።","Rules and limitations":"ህጎች እና ገደቦች","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"ጦርነት በአብዛኛው ዕድል ነው እና ለረጅም ጊዜ ሊቆይ ይችላል; አንዳንድ የካርድ ትዕዛዞች ሊደገሙ ይችላሉ። ይህ እትም በጦርነት ጊዜ በተጫዋች አንድ የፊት ወደ ታች ካርድ ይጠቀማል፣ እያንዳንዱን ተጫዋች ከታሰረበት ጦርነት ያካትታል፣ እና ወደታች እና ላይ ያሉትን ጥንድ ማጠናቀቅ የማይችልን ተጫዋች ያስወግዳል። የአካባቢ ሲፒዩ ተጫዋቾች በቀላሉ ካርዶችን ይገለበጣሉ። ምንም የመስመር ላይ ባለብዙ ተጫዋች፣ መለያ ወይም የተሰቀለ የጨዋታ ውሂብ የለም።","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"ለመጫወት ነፃ። ካርዶች፣ ግጥሚያ ሁኔታ እና አማራጭ ቁጠባ በዚህ መሣሪያ ላይ መቆየት; ምንም አልተሰቀለም.","Play War":"የጨዋታ ጦርነት","Related tools":"ተዛማጅ መሳሪያዎች","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ነጻ · በአሳሽዎ ውስጥ ይሰራል","Language":"ቋንቋ","UsefulVerse":"ጠቃሚ ቁጥር","All tools":"ሁሉም መሳሪያዎች","Total players":"ጠቅላላ ተጫዋቾች","New game":"አዲስ ጨዋታ","Resume saved game":"የተቀመጠውን ጨዋታ ከቆመበት ቀጥል","Delete saved game":"የተቀመጠ ጨዋታ ሰርዝ","Export results":"የመላክ ውጤቶች","Eliminated":"ተወግዷል","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"ጨዋታ ይጀምሩ ወይም በዚህ መሣሪያ ላይ የተቀመጠውን ይቀጥሉ።","Flip cards":"ካርዶችን ይግለጡ","Continue the war":"ጦርነቱን ይቀጥሉ","Auto-play":"ራስ-አጫውት።","Stop auto-play":"ራስ-ጨዋታን አቁም","Auto-play paused.":"በራስ-መጫወት ባለበት ቆሟል።","Auto-play speed":"የራስ-አጫውት ፍጥነት","Slow":"ቀርፋፋ","Normal":"መደበኛ","Fast":"ፈጣን","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"ይህ ትክክለኛ የካርድ ዝግጅት ስለተደጋገመ በራስ-ጨዋታ ቆሟል። አሸናፊ አልተገለጸም; በእጅ ይቀጥሉ ወይም እንደገና በራስ-መጫወት ይጀምሩ።","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"ይህን ገጽ ምላሽ ሰጪ ለማድረግ ከ500 ድርጊቶች በኋላ በራስ-ጨዋታ ቆሟል። ጨዋታው ሊቀጥል ይችላል; በእጅ ይጫወቱ ወይም እንደገና በራስ-መጫወት ይጀምሩ።","Your pile":"የእርስዎ ክምር","Cards on the table":"ካርዶች በጠረጴዛው ላይ","Face down":"ወደ ታች ፊት ለፊት","No cards have been flipped yet.":"እስካሁን ምንም ካርዶች አልተገለበጡም።","Player":"ተጫዋች","Computer {number}":"ኮምፒውተር {number}","You":"አንተ","Cards":"ካርዶች","Flips":"መገልበጥ","Wars":"ጦርነቶች","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"ጨዋታው ተጀመረ። ከፍተኛውን ካርድ ከእያንዳንዱ ተጫዋች ክምር ገልብጡት።","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} ጦርነቱን አሸንፎ የ {count} ካርዶችን ሰበሰበ.","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"ጦርነት! ከፍተኛው ካርዶች ታስረዋል. በጦርነቱ ውስጥ ላለው እያንዳንዱ ተጫዋች አንድ ካርድ ወደ ታች እና አንድ ወደ ላይ ማሳየቱን ይቀጥሉ።","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} ሁሉንም ካርዶች ሰብስቦ ጨዋታውን አሸንፏል!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"ጦርነቱን ማጠናቀቅ የሚችል ተጫዋች የለም። ጨዋታው በአቻ ውጤት ነው።","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"ሁለት ካርድ የሌለው ተጫዋች ጦርነቱን መጨረስ አልቻለም እና ተሸንፏል።","Game saved on this device.":"ጨዋታ በዚህ መሳሪያ ላይ ተቀምጧል።","Saved game resumed.":"የዳነ ጨዋታ ቀጠለ።","Saved game deleted.":"የተቀመጠ ጨዋታ ተሰርዟል።","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"አካባቢያዊ ቁጠባ አይገኝም። ይህ ጨዋታ ገጹን እስክትወጣ ድረስ ክፍት ሆኖ ይቆያል።","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"የተቀመጠ ጨዋታ ሊነበብ አልቻለም። አዲስ ጨዋታ ይጀምሩ ወይም የተበላሸውን ቆጣቢ ይሰርዙ።","There is no saved game on this device.":"በዚህ መሳሪያ ላይ ምንም የተቀመጠ ጨዋታ የለም።","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"አንድ 52-ካርድ ወለል፣ ቀልዶች የሉም። በ 2–4 ተጫዋቾች መካከል እኩል ይስሩ; አንድ ካርድ ለሶስት ተጫዋቾች ያስቀምጡ. ከፍተኛው ካርድ እያንዳንዱን ማዞር ያሸንፋል; ሻንጣዎች ምንም አይደሉም. Ace ከፍተኛ፣ 2 ዝቅተኛ። በእኩል ፣ በጦርነቱ ውስጥ ያለው እያንዳንዱ ተጫዋች አንድ ካርድ ወደታች እና አንዱን ወደ ላይ ያደርገዋል። ከፍተኛው የፊት አፕ ካርድ ሁሉንም ይወስዳል። ጦርነትን ማጠናቀቅ ካልቻላችሁ ይሸነፋሉ። ጨዋታው ረጅም ሊሆን ይችላል እና በአብዛኛው ዕድል ነው.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"የኖርዌይ ህጎች 16 ጥቅምት 2026 ታይቷል","Norske kortspill · Krig":"Norske kortspill · Krig"},"ar":{"War Card Game":"لعبة ورق الحرب","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"لعبة War Card عبر الإنترنت — العب معركة البطاقات الكلاسيكية","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"العب لعبة ورق الحرب الكلاسيكية محليًا مع لاعبين إلى أربعة لاعبين. اقلب البطاقات، وحل الارتباطات بالبطاقات المقلوبة والمقلوبة، واحتفظ بكل بطاقة على هذا الجهاز.","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"اقلب البطاقة العلوية من كومة كل لاعب. أعلى بطاقة تفوز بالمعركة؛ صفوف متساوية تبدأ الحرب.","A quick example":"مثال سريع","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"A 10 يتفوق على 6 بغض النظر عن النوع. إذا تعادلت البطاقات العلوية، يضع كل لاعب في المعركة بطاقة واحدة مقلوبة وواحدة مقلوبة للأعلى؛ البطاقة الجديدة الأعلى تأخذ الكومة.","How to play":"كيفية اللعب","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"يتبع هذا الإصدار قواعد Krig النرويجية التي تم التحقق منها ضد Norske kortspill. يتشارك اثنان إلى أربعة لاعبين في مجموعة بطاقات 52 القياسية بدون مزاح. يتم توزيع البطاقات مقلوبة بالتساوي قدر الإمكان؛ مع ثلاثة لاعبين، يتم وضع بطاقة واحدة جانبًا غير مرئية. الجميع يقلب البطاقة العلوية معًا. أعلى رتبة يفوز بجميع البطاقات على الطاولة؛ الدعاوى لا يهم. الآس هو الأعلى و2 هو الأدنى. إذا تعادلت أعلى البطاقات، فإن كل لاعب انضم إلى تلك المعركة يضع بطاقة واحدة مقلوبة ثم واحدة مقلوبة للأعلى. أعلى بطاقة جديدة مكشوفة تأخذ الكومة بأكملها. ربطة عنق أخرى تكرر نفس الخطوة. اللاعب الذي لا يستطيع توفير كلتا ورقتي الحرب يخسر؛ تنضم بطاقاتهم المتبقية إلى كومة المعركة. آخر لاعب لديه بطاقات يفوز. تعتمد اللعبة على الحظ، وقد تستغرق وقتًا طويلاً، ولا يدعي هذا الإصدار أنه يمنع كل تسلسل متكرر محتمل.","Frequently asked questions":"الأسئلة المتداولة","How many players can play?":"كم عدد اللاعبين الذين يمكنهم اللعب؟","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"اختر لاعبين أو ثلاثة أو أربعة لاعبين. يستخدم الجميع مجموعة بطاقات 52 قياسية واحدة.","Which card is highest?":"أي بطاقة هي الأعلى؟","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"الآس هو الأعلى، يليه الملك والملكة والجاك و10 وصولاً إلى 2. الدعاوى ليس لها رتبة.","What happens on a tie?":"ماذا يحدث لربطة العنق؟","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"يضع كل لاعب في المعركة بطاقة واحدة مقلوبة وواحدة مقلوبة للأعلى. البطاقة المكشوفة الجديدة الأعلى تفوز بجميع البطاقات الموجودة على الطاولة.","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"ماذا لو لم يكن لدي بطاقات كافية للحرب؟","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"اللاعب الذي لا يستطيع إكمال الزوج المقلوب والوجه لأعلى يخسر. تبقى بطاقاتهم المتبقية في كومة المعركة.","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"هل تتطلب هذه اللعبة حسابًا أو تحميل بطاقاتي؟","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"رقم. تبقى اللعبة والحفظ الاختياري في هذا المتصفح على هذا الجهاز.","Rules and limitations":"القواعد والقيود","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"الحرب هي في الغالب صدفة ويمكن أن تستمر لفترة طويلة؛ قد تتكرر بعض طلبات البطاقة. يستخدم هذا الإصدار بطاقة واحدة مقلوبة لكل لاعب أثناء الحرب، ويتضمن كل لاعب من المعركة المتعادلة، ويزيل اللاعب الذي لا يمكنه إكمال الزوج المقلوب. يقوم لاعبو وحدة المعالجة المركزية المحلية ببساطة بقلب البطاقات. لا توجد بيانات متعددة اللاعبين أو حساب أو لعبة تم تحميلها عبر الإنترنت.","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"لعب مجاني. تبقى البطاقات وحالة المطابقة والحفظ الاختياري على هذا الجهاز؛ لم يتم تحميل أي شيء.","Play War":"العب الحرب","Related tools":"أدوات ذات صلة","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"مجاني · يعمل في متصفحك","Language":"اللغة","UsefulVerse":"آية مفيدة","All tools":"جميع الأدوات","Total players":"إجمالي اللاعبين","New game":"لعبة جديدة","Resume saved game":"استئناف اللعبة المحفوظة","Delete saved game":"حذف اللعبة المحفوظة","Export results":"تصدير النتائج","Eliminated":"تم الحذف","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"ابدأ لعبة أو استأنف اللعبة المحفوظة على هذا الجهاز.","Flip cards":"بطاقات الوجه","Continue the war":"واصل الحرب","Auto-play":"التشغيل التلقائي","Stop auto-play":"إيقاف التشغيل التلقائي","Auto-play paused.":"تم إيقاف التشغيل التلقائي مؤقتًا.","Auto-play speed":"سرعة التشغيل التلقائي","Slow":"بطيء","Normal":"عادي","Fast":"سريع","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"توقف التشغيل التلقائي بسبب تكرار ترتيب البطاقة الدقيق هذا. لم يتم الإعلان عن فائز. تابع يدويًا أو ابدأ التشغيل التلقائي مرة أخرى.","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"توقف التشغيل التلقائي بعد إجراءات 500 للحفاظ على استجابة هذه الصفحة. قد تستمر اللعبة. العب يدويًا أو ابدأ التشغيل التلقائي مرة أخرى.","Your pile":"كومتك","Cards on the table":"بطاقات على الطاولة","Face down":"الوجه للأسفل","No cards have been flipped yet.":"لم يتم قلب أي بطاقات حتى الآن.","Player":"لاعب","Computer {number}":"الكمبيوتر {number}","You":"أنت","Cards":"بطاقات","Flips":"تقلب","Wars":"الحروب","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"بدأت اللعبة. اقلب البطاقة العلوية من كومة كل لاعب.","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"فاز {player} بالمعركة وجمع بطاقات {count}.","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"حرب! أعلى البطاقات مرتبطة. استمر في الكشف عن بطاقة واحدة لأسفل وواحدة لأعلى لكل لاعب في المعركة.","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} جمعت كل البطاقات وفازت باللعبة!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"لا يمكن لأي لاعب إكمال الحرب. اللعبة هي التعادل.","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"اللاعب الذي لا يملك ورقتين لا يستطيع إنهاء الحرب ويخسر.","Game saved on this device.":"اللعبة محفوظة على هذا الجهاز","Saved game resumed.":"تم استئناف اللعبة المحفوظة.","Saved game deleted.":"تم حذف اللعبة المحفوظة.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"الحفظ المحلي غير متاح؛ ستبقى هذه اللعبة مفتوحة حتى تغادر الصفحة.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"تعذرت قراءة اللعبة المحفوظة. ابدأ لعبة جديدة أو احذف الحفظ التالف.","There is no saved game on this device.":"لا توجد لعبة محفوظة على هذا الجهاز.","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"مجموعة بطاقات 52 واحدة، بدون مزاح. تعامل بالتساوي بين لاعبي 2–4؛ ضع بطاقة واحدة جانبًا لثلاثة لاعبين. أعلى بطاقة تفوز بكل رمية؛ الدعاوى لا يهم. الآس مرتفع، 2 منخفض. في حالة التعادل، يضع كل لاعب في المعركة بطاقة واحدة للأسفل وأخرى للأعلى. أعلى بطاقة مكشوفة تأخذ كل شيء. إذا لم تتمكن من إكمال الحرب، فستخسر. يمكن أن تكون اللعبة طويلة وهي في الغالب حظ.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"تم فحص القواعد النرويجية 16 أكتوبر 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"نورسكي كورتسبيل · كريج"},"bg":{"War Card Game":"Военна игра на карти","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"Военна игра с карти онлайн — Играйте класическа битка с карти","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"Играйте класическата игра на карти War локално с двама до четирима играчи. Обърнете картите, разрешете връзки с карти с лице надолу и лице нагоре и запазете всяка карта на това устройство.","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"Обърнете горната карта от купчината на всеки играч. Най-високата карта печели битката; равни редици започват война.","A quick example":"Бърз пример","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"10 побеждава 6 независимо от боята. Ако горните карти се изравнят, всеки играч в битката поставя една карта с лицето надолу и една с лицето нагоре; по-високата нова карта взема купчината.","How to play":"Как се играе","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"Тази версия следва правилата на норвежкия криг, проверени спрямо Norske kortspill. Двама до четирима играчи споделят едно стандартно тесте карти 52 без джокери. Картите се раздават с лицето надолу възможно най-равномерно; с трима играчи една карта се оставя настрана невидима. Всички заедно обръщат горната карта. Най-високият ранг печели всички карти на масата; костюмите нямат значение. Асото е най-високото, а 2 е най-ниското. Ако най-високите карти се изравнят, всеки играч, който се е присъединил към тази битка, поставя една карта с лицето надолу и след това една с лицето нагоре. Най-високата нова обърната карта заема цялата купчина. Следващо равенство повтаря същата стъпка. Играч, който не може да предостави и двете военни карти, губи; останалите им карти се присъединяват към бойната купчина. Последният играч с карти печели. Играта се ръководи от късмет, може да отнеме много време и тази версия не претендира, че предотвратява всяка възможна повтаряща се последователност.","Frequently asked questions":"Често задавани въпроси","How many players can play?":"Колко играчи могат да играят?","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"Изберете двама, трима или четирима играчи. Всеки използва едно стандартно тесте карти 52.","Which card is highest?":"Коя карта е най-високата?","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"Асо е най-високото, последвано от поп, дама, вале и 10 до 2. Костюмите нямат ранг.","What happens on a tie?":"Какво се случва при равенство?","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"Всеки играч в битката поставя една карта с лицето надолу и една с лицето нагоре. По-високата нова обърната карта печели всички карти на масата.","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"Ами ако нямам достатъчно карти за война?","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"Играч, който не може да завърши двойката с лицето надолу и лицето нагоре, губи. Останалите им карти остават в бойната купчина.","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"Тази игра изисква ли акаунт или качване на моите карти?","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"Бр. Играта и незадължителното запазване остават в този браузър на това устройство.","Rules and limitations":"Правила и ограничения","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"Войната е предимно случайна и може да продължи дълго време; някои поръчки на карти може да се повтарят. Тази версия използва една карта с лице надолу на играч по време на война, включва всеки играч от равенството битка и премахва играч, който не може да завърши двойката надолу и нагоре. Локалните CPU играчи просто обръщат картите. Няма онлайн мултиплейър, акаунт или данни за качени игри.","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Безплатна игра. Карти, състояние на съвпадение и незадължително запазване остават на това устройство; нищо не е качено.","Play War":"Играйте война","Related tools":"Свързани инструменти","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"БЕЗПЛАТНО · ПУСКА ВЪВ ВАШИЯ БРАУЗЪР","Language":"Език","UsefulVerse":"Полезен стих","All tools":"Всички инструменти","Total players":"Общо играчи","New game":"Нова игра","Resume saved game":"Възобновяване на запазена игра","Delete saved game":"Изтриване на запазена игра","Export results":"Експортиране на резултати","Eliminated":"Елиминиран","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Стартирайте игра или продължете тази, записана на това устройство.","Flip cards":"Обръщане на карти","Continue the war":"Продължете войната","Auto-play":"Автоматично пускане","Stop auto-play":"Спрете автоматичното възпроизвеждане","Auto-play paused.":"Автоматичното възпроизвеждане е на пауза.","Auto-play speed":"Скорост на автоматично възпроизвеждане","Slow":"Бавно","Normal":"Нормално","Fast":"Бързо","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"Автоматичното възпроизвеждане е спряно, защото се повтаря точно тази подредба на картите. Не беше обявен победител; продължете ръчно или стартирайте автоматичното възпроизвеждане отново.","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"Автоматичното възпроизвеждане спря след 500 действия, за да поддържа тази страница отзивчива. Играта може да продължи; пуснете ръчно или стартирайте автоматично пускане отново.","Your pile":"Вашата купчина","Cards on the table":"Карти на масата","Face down":"С лицето надолу","No cards have been flipped yet.":"Все още няма обърнати карти.","Player":"Играч","Computer {number}":"Компютър {number}","You":"Вие","Cards":"Карти","Flips":"Обръща се","Wars":"Войни","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"Играта започна. Обърнете горната карта от купчината на всеки играч.","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} спечели битката и събра {count} карти.","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"Война! Най-високите карти са равни. Продължете да разкривате една карта надолу и една нагоре за всеки играч в битката.","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} събра всички карти и спечели играта!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"Никой играч не може да завърши войната. Играта е равенство.","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"Играч без две карти не може да завърши войната и губи.","Game saved on this device.":"Играта е запазена на това устройство.","Saved game resumed.":"Запазената игра е възобновена.","Saved game deleted.":"Запазената игра е изтрита.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Локалното запазване не е налично; тази игра ще остане отворена, докато не напуснете страницата.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Запазената игра не може да бъде прочетена. Започнете нова игра или изтрийте повреденото запазване.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Няма запазена игра на това устройство.","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"Едно тесте карти 52, без джокери. Разпределете равномерно между 2–4 играчи; заделете една карта за трима играчи. Най-високата карта печели всяко обръщане; костюмите нямат значение. Асо високо, 2 ниско. При равенство всеки играч в битката поставя една карта надолу и една нагоре. Най-високата обърната карта взема всичко. Ако не можете да завършите война, губите. Играта може да бъде дълга и е предимно на късмет.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Норвежките правила са проверени 16 октомври 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"Norske kortspill · Криг"},"bn":{"War Card Game":"ওয়ার কার্ড গেম","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"ওয়ার কার্ড গেম অনলাইন — ক্লাসিক কার্ড ব্যাটেল খেলুন","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"দুই থেকে চারজন খেলোয়াড়ের সাথে স্থানীয়ভাবে ক্লাসিক ওয়ার কার্ড গেম খেলুন। কার্ডগুলি ফ্লিপ করুন, ফেস-ডাউন এবং ফেস-আপ কার্ডগুলির সাথে সম্পর্কগুলি সমাধান করুন এবং এই ডিভাইসে প্রতিটি কার্ড রাখুন৷","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"প্রতিটি খেলোয়াড়ের গাদা থেকে শীর্ষ কার্ডটি ফ্লিপ করুন। সর্বোচ্চ কার্ড যুদ্ধ জয়; সমান র‌্যাঙ্ক একটি যুদ্ধ শুরু করে।","A quick example":"একটি দ্রুত উদাহরণ","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"A 10 একটি 6 কে পরাজিত করে, স্যুট নির্বিশেষে। যদি শীর্ষ কার্ড টাই হয়, যুদ্ধের প্রতিটি খেলোয়াড় একটি কার্ড মুখ নিচে এবং একটি মুখ উপরে রাখে; উচ্চতর নতুন কার্ড গাদা লাগে.","How to play":"কিভাবে খেলতে হয়","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"এই সংস্করণটি নরস্কে কর্টসপিলের বিরুদ্ধে পরীক্ষা করা নরওয়েজিয়ান ক্রিগ নিয়ম অনুসরণ করে। দুই থেকে চারজন খেলোয়াড় জোকার ছাড়াই একটি স্ট্যান্ডার্ড 52-কার্ড ডেক শেয়ার করে। কার্ডগুলি যতটা সম্ভব সমানভাবে মোকাবেলা করা হয়; তিন খেলোয়াড়ের সাথে, একটি কার্ড অদেখা সরাইয়া রাখা হয়। সবাই একসাথে উপরের কার্ডটি ফ্লিপ করে। সর্বোচ্চ র্যাঙ্ক টেবিলের সমস্ত কার্ড জিতেছে; স্যুট কোন ব্যাপার না. Ace সর্বোচ্চ এবং 2 সর্বনিম্ন। যদি সর্বোচ্চ কার্ড টাই হয়, সেই যুদ্ধে যোগদানকারী প্রত্যেক খেলোয়াড় একটি কার্ড মুখ নিচে এবং তারপর একটি মুখ উপরে রাখে। সর্বোচ্চ নতুন ফেস-আপ কার্ড পুরো গাদা লাগে। আরও একটি টাই একই ধাপের পুনরাবৃত্তি করে। যে খেলোয়াড় উভয় যুদ্ধ কার্ড সরবরাহ করতে পারে না সে হেরে যায়; তাদের অবশিষ্ট কার্ড যুদ্ধের স্তূপে যোগদান করে। কার্ড সহ শেষ খেলোয়াড় জিতেছে। গেমটি ভাগ্য-চালিত, দীর্ঘ সময় লাগতে পারে এবং এই সংস্করণটি প্রতিটি সম্ভাব্য পুনরাবৃত্তি ক্রম প্রতিরোধ করার দাবি করে না।","Frequently asked questions":"প্রায়শই জিজ্ঞাসিত প্রশ্ন","How many players can play?":"কতজন খেলোয়াড় খেলতে পারে?","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"দুই, তিন বা চারজন খেলোয়াড় বেছে নিন। প্রত্যেকে একটি স্ট্যান্ডার্ড 52-কার্ড ডেক ব্যবহার করে।","Which card is highest?":"কোন কার্ডটি সর্বোচ্চ?","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"Ace সর্বোচ্চ, তারপরে রাজা, রানী, জ্যাক এবং 10 2 পর্যন্ত। স্যুট কোন পদমর্যাদা আছে.","What happens on a tie?":"টাই হলে কি হয়?","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"যুদ্ধে প্রতিটি খেলোয়াড় একটি কার্ড মুখ নিচে এবং একটি মুখ উপরে রাখে। উচ্চতর নতুন ফেস-আপ কার্ড টেবিলের সমস্ত কার্ড জিতে নেয়।","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"যুদ্ধের জন্য আমার কাছে পর্যাপ্ত কার্ড না থাকলে কী হবে?","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"একজন খেলোয়াড় যে ফেস-ডাউন এবং ফেস-আপ জুটি সম্পূর্ণ করতে পারে না। তাদের অবশিষ্ট কার্ডগুলি যুদ্ধের স্তূপে থাকে।","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"এই গেমটির জন্য কি একটি অ্যাকাউন্ট প্রয়োজন বা আমার কার্ডগুলি আপলোড করতে হবে?","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"না। গেম এবং ঐচ্ছিক সংরক্ষণ এই ডিভাইসে এই ব্রাউজারে থাকে।","Rules and limitations":"নিয়ম এবং সীমাবদ্ধতা","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"যুদ্ধ বেশিরভাগই সুযোগ এবং দীর্ঘ সময় স্থায়ী হতে পারে; কিছু কার্ড অর্ডার পুনরাবৃত্তি হতে পারে. এই সংস্করণটি যুদ্ধের সময় প্রতি খেলোয়াড়ের জন্য একটি ফেস-ডাউন কার্ড ব্যবহার করে, বাঁধা যুদ্ধের প্রতিটি খেলোয়াড়কে অন্তর্ভুক্ত করে এবং এমন একজন খেলোয়াড়কে সরিয়ে দেয় যে ডাউন-আপ জুটি সম্পূর্ণ করতে পারে না। স্থানীয় CPU প্লেয়াররা সহজভাবে কার্ড ফ্লিপ করে। কোন অনলাইন মাল্টিপ্লেয়ার, অ্যাকাউন্ট, বা আপলোড করা গেম ডেটা নেই।","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"খেলতে বিনামূল্যে। কার্ড, ম্যাচ স্টেট এবং ঐচ্ছিক সেভ এই ডিভাইসে থাকে; কিছুই আপলোড করা হয় না।","Play War":"প্লে ওয়ার","Related tools":"সম্পর্কিত টুলস","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ফ্রি · আপনার ব্রাউজারে চলে","Language":"ভাষা","UsefulVerse":"উপযোগী পদ্য","All tools":"সমস্ত টুলস","Total players":"মোট খেলোয়াড়","New game":"নতুন গেম","Resume saved game":"সংরক্ষিত খেলা পুনরায় শুরু করুন","Delete saved game":"সংরক্ষিত গেম মুছুন","Export results":"রপ্তানি ফলাফল","Eliminated":"বাদ দেওয়া হয়েছে","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"একটি গেম শুরু করুন বা এই ডিভাইসে সংরক্ষিত একটি পুনরায় শুরু করুন৷","Flip cards":"ফ্লিপ কার্ড","Continue the war":"যুদ্ধ চালিয়ে যান","Auto-play":"অটো-প্লে","Stop auto-play":"অটো-প্লে বন্ধ করুন","Auto-play paused.":"অটো-প্লে পজ করা হয়েছে।","Auto-play speed":"অটো-প্লে গতি","Slow":"ধীরে","Normal":"সাধারণ","Fast":"দ্রুত","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"অটো-প্লে বন্ধ হয়ে গেছে কারণ এই সঠিক কার্ড ব্যবস্থার পুনরাবৃত্তি হয়েছে। কোন বিজয়ী ঘোষণা করা হয়নি; ম্যানুয়ালি চালিয়ে যান বা আবার অটো-প্লে শুরু করুন।","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"এই পৃষ্ঠাটিকে প্রতিক্রিয়াশীল রাখতে 500 অ্যাকশনের পরে অটো-প্লে বন্ধ হয়ে গেছে। খেলা চলতে পারে; ম্যানুয়ালি খেলুন বা আবার অটো-প্লে শুরু করুন।","Your pile":"আপনার গাদা","Cards on the table":"টেবিলে কার্ড","Face down":"মুখ নিচে","No cards have been flipped yet.":"এখনো কোনো কার্ড ফ্লিপ করা হয়নি।","Player":"প্লেয়ার","Computer {number}":"কম্পিউটার {number}","You":"আপনি","Cards":"কার্ড","Flips":"উল্টে যায়","Wars":"যুদ্ধসমূহ","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"খেলা শুরু হল। প্রতিটি খেলোয়াড়ের গাদা থেকে শীর্ষ কার্ডটি উল্টান।","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} যুদ্ধ জিতেছে এবং {count} কার্ড সংগ্রহ করেছে।","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"যুদ্ধের ! সর্বোচ্চ কার্ড বাঁধা হয়। যুদ্ধে প্রতিটি খেলোয়াড়ের জন্য একটি কার্ড নিচে এবং একটি উপরে প্রকাশ করা চালিয়ে যান।","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} সমস্ত কার্ড সংগ্রহ করেছে এবং গেমটি জিতেছে!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"কোনো খেলোয়াড়ই যুদ্ধ শেষ করতে পারেনি। খেলা ড্র হয়।","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"দুই কার্ড ছাড়া একজন খেলোয়াড় যুদ্ধ শেষ করতে পারেনি এবং হেরে যায়।","Game saved on this device.":"গেমটি এই ডিভাইসে সংরক্ষিত।","Saved game resumed.":"সংরক্ষিত খেলা আবার শুরু হয়েছে৷","Saved game deleted.":"সংরক্ষিত খেলা মুছে ফেলা হয়েছে।","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"স্থানীয় সঞ্চয় অনুপলব্ধ; আপনি পৃষ্ঠাটি ছেড়ে না যাওয়া পর্যন্ত এই গেমটি খোলা থাকবে।","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"সংরক্ষিত গেম পড়া যাবে না। একটি নতুন গেম শুরু করুন বা ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত সেভ মুছে দিন।","There is no saved game on this device.":"এই ডিভাইসে কোনো সংরক্ষিত গেম নেই।","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"একটি 52-কার্ড ডেক, জোকার নেই৷ 2–4 খেলোয়াড়দের মধ্যে সমানভাবে ডিল করুন; তিনজন খেলোয়াড়ের জন্য একটি কার্ড আলাদা করে রাখুন। সর্বোচ্চ কার্ড প্রতিটি ফ্লিপ জিতেছে; স্যুট কোন ব্যাপার না. Ace উচ্চ, 2 কম। টাই হলে, যুদ্ধের প্রতিটি খেলোয়াড় একটি কার্ড নিচে এবং একটি উপরে রাখে। সর্বোচ্চ ফেস আপ কার্ড সব লাগে. আপনি যদি একটি যুদ্ধ সম্পূর্ণ করতে না পারেন তবে আপনি হেরে যাবেন। গেমটি দীর্ঘ হতে পারে এবং বেশিরভাগই ভাগ্য।","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"নরওয়েজিয়ান নিয়ম চেক করা হয়েছে 16 অক্টোবর 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"নরস্ক কর্টস্পিল · ক্রিগ"},"ca":{"War Card Game":"Joc de cartes de guerra","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"Joc de cartes de guerra en línia — Juga a la batalla de cartes clàssica","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"Juga al clàssic joc de cartes War localment amb dos o quatre jugadors. Gira les cartes, resol els llaços amb cartes boca avall i cap amunt i guarda totes les cartes en aquest dispositiu.","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"Gira la carta superior de la pila de cada jugador. La carta més alta guanya la batalla; rangs iguals inicien una guerra.","A quick example":"Un exemple ràpid","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"Un 10 supera un 6 independentment del vestit. Si les cartes superiors empaten, cada jugador de la batalla col·loca una carta boca avall i una altra cara amunt; la nova carta més alta agafa la pila.","How to play":"Com jugar","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"Aquesta versió segueix les regles del Krig noruec comparades amb Norske kortspill. De dos a quatre jugadors comparteixen una baralla de cartes estàndard 52 sense bromes. Les cartes es reparteixen boca avall de la manera més uniforme possible; amb tres jugadors, una carta es deixa de banda sense veure's. Tothom gira la carta superior junts. El rang més alt guanya totes les cartes de la taula; els vestits no importen. L'as és més alt i 2 és el més baix. Si les cartes més altes empaten, cada jugador que es va unir a aquella batalla col·loca una carta boca avall i després una cap amunt. La nova carta cara amunt més alta ocupa tota la pila. Un altre empat repeteix el mateix pas. Un jugador que no pot subministrar les dues cartes de guerra perd; les seves cartes restants s'uneixen a la pila de batalla. Guanya l'últim jugador amb cartes. El joc es basa en la sort, pot trigar molt de temps i aquesta versió no pretén evitar totes les seqüències que es repeteixin.","Frequently asked questions":"Preguntes més freqüents","How many players can play?":"Quants jugadors poden jugar?","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"Tria dos, tres o quatre jugadors. Tothom utilitza un paquet de targetes 52 estàndard.","Which card is highest?":"Quina targeta és més alta?","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"L'as és el més alt, seguit del rei, la dama, el jack i 10 fins a 2. Els vestits no tenen rang.","What happens on a tie?":"Què passa amb una corbata?","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"Cada jugador de la batalla posa una carta boca avall i una cap amunt. La nova carta cara amunt més alta guanya totes les cartes de la taula.","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"Què passa si no tinc prou targetes per a una guerra?","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"Un jugador que no pot completar la parella boca avall i cara amunt perd. Les seves cartes restants romanen a la pila de batalla.","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"Aquest joc requereix un compte o carregueu les meves targetes?","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"Núm. El joc i el desat opcional es mantenen en aquest navegador en aquest dispositiu.","Rules and limitations":"Normes i limitacions","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"La guerra és majoritàriament atzar i pot durar molt de temps; algunes comandes de targetes poden repetir-se. Aquesta versió utilitza una carta boca avall per jugador durant una guerra, inclou tots els jugadors de la batalla empatada i elimina un jugador que no pot completar la parella avall i amunt. Els jugadors locals de CPU simplement giren cartes. No hi ha dades multijugador en línia, comptes o jocs penjats.","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Jugar gratuït. Les targetes, l'estat del partit i el desat opcional es mantenen en aquest dispositiu; no es carrega res.","Play War":"Play War","Related tools":"Eines relacionades","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATUÏT · EXECUCIÓ AL TEU NAVEGADOR","Language":"Idioma","UsefulVerse":"Vers útil","All tools":"Totes les eines","Total players":"Jugadors totals","New game":"Joc nou","Resume saved game":"Reprèn la partida desada","Delete saved game":"Suprimeix la partida desada","Export results":"Exporta els resultats","Eliminated":"Eliminat","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Comença un joc o reprèn el desat en aquest dispositiu.","Flip cards":"Flip cards","Continue the war":"Continuar la guerra","Auto-play":"Reproducció automàtica","Stop auto-play":"Atura la reproducció automàtica","Auto-play paused.":"Reproducció automàtica en pausa.","Auto-play speed":"Velocitat de reproducció automàtica","Slow":"Lent","Normal":"Normal","Fast":"Ràpid","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"La reproducció automàtica s'ha aturat perquè s'ha repetit aquesta disposició exacta de targetes. No es va declarar cap guanyador; continua manualment o torna a iniciar la reproducció automàtica.","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"La reproducció automàtica es va aturar després de les accions de 500 per mantenir aquesta pàgina sensible. El joc pot continuar; reprodueix manualment o torna a iniciar la reproducció automàtica.","Your pile":"La teva pila","Cards on the table":"Cartes a la taula","Face down":"Cara avall","No cards have been flipped yet.":"Encara no s'ha girat cap targeta.","Player":"Jugador","Computer {number}":"Ordinador {number}","You":"tu","Cards":"Targetes","Flips":"Voltes","Wars":"Guerres","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"El joc va començar. Gira la carta superior de la pila de cada jugador.","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} va guanyar la batalla i va recollir cartes {count}.","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"Guerra! Les cartes més altes estan empatades. Continua revelant una carta cap avall i una cap amunt per a cada jugador de la batalla.","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} va recollir totes les cartes i va guanyar el joc!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"Cap jugador podria acabar la guerra. El joc és un empat.","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"Un jugador sense dues cartes no podria acabar la guerra i perd.","Game saved on this device.":"El joc s'ha desat en aquest dispositiu.","Saved game resumed.":"S'ha reprès la partida desada.","Saved game deleted.":"S'ha suprimit el joc desat.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"L'emmagatzematge local no està disponible; aquest joc romandrà obert fins que abandonis la pàgina.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"No s'ha pogut llegir el joc desat. Comença un joc nou o suprimeix el desat danyat.","There is no saved game on this device.":"No hi ha cap joc desat en aquest dispositiu.","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"Una baralla de cartes 52, sense bromes. Repartiu de manera uniforme entre els jugadors de 2–4; reserva una carta per a tres jugadors. La carta més alta guanya cada volta; els vestits no importen. As alt, 2 baix. En empat, cada jugador de la batalla posa una carta cap avall i una cap amunt. La carta cara amunt més alta s'emporta tot. Si no pots completar una guerra, perds. El joc pot ser llarg i és sobretot sort.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Regles noruegues verificades 16 Octubre 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"Norske kortspill · Krig"},"de":{"War Card Game":"Kriegskartenspiel","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"War Card Game Online – Spielen Sie den klassischen Kartenkampf","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"Spielen Sie das klassische Kriegskartenspiel lokal mit zwei bis vier Spielern. Drehen Sie Karten um, lösen Sie Gleichstände mit verdeckten und aufgedeckten Karten und behalten Sie jede Karte auf diesem Gerät.","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"Drehen Sie die oberste Karte vom Stapel jedes Spielers um. Die höchste Karte gewinnt den Kampf; Gleiche Ränge beginnen einen Krieg.","A quick example":"Ein kurzes Beispiel","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"Ein 10 schlägt einen 6 unabhängig von der Farbe. Bei Gleichstand der obersten Karten legt jeder Spieler im Kampf eine verdeckte und eine offene Karte ab; die höhere neue Karte nimmt den Stapel.","How to play":"Wie man spielt","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"Diese Version folgt den norwegischen Krig-Regeln, verglichen mit Norske kortspill. Zwei bis vier Spieler teilen sich ein Standard-52-Kartendeck ohne Joker. Die Karten werden möglichst gleichmäßig verdeckt ausgeteilt; Bei drei Spielern wird eine Karte verdeckt beiseite gelegt. Alle drehen gemeinsam die oberste Karte um. Der Spieler mit dem höchsten Rang gewinnt alle Karten auf dem Tisch; Anzüge spielen keine Rolle. Ace ist am höchsten und 2 am niedrigsten. Wenn die höchsten Karten gleich sind, legt jeder Spieler, der sich diesem Kampf angeschlossen hat, eine verdeckte und dann eine offene Karte ab. Die höchste neue offene Karte nimmt den gesamten Stapel ein. Bei einem weiteren Gleichstand wird derselbe Schritt wiederholt. Ein Spieler, der nicht beide Kriegskarten liefern kann, verliert; ihre restlichen Karten kommen auf den Kampfstapel. Der letzte Spieler mit Karten gewinnt. Das Spiel ist glücksgesteuert, kann lange dauern und diese Version erhebt nicht den Anspruch, jede mögliche Wiederholungssequenz zu verhindern.","Frequently asked questions":"Häufig gestellte Fragen","How many players can play?":"Wie viele Spieler können spielen?","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"Wählen Sie zwei, drei oder vier Spieler. Jeder nutzt ein Standard-52-Kartendeck.","Which card is highest?":"Welche Karte ist am höchsten?","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"Ass ist am höchsten, gefolgt von König, Dame, Bube und 10 bis hin zu 2. Anzüge haben keinen Rang.","What happens on a tie?":"Was passiert bei einem Unentschieden?","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"Jeder Spieler im Kampf legt eine verdeckte und eine offene Karte ab. Die höhere neue offene Karte gewinnt alle Karten auf dem Tisch.","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"Was passiert, wenn ich nicht genügend Karten für einen Krieg habe?","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"Ein Spieler, der das verdeckte und offene Paar nicht vervollständigen kann, verliert. Die restlichen Karten bleiben im Kampfstapel.","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"Benötigt dieses Spiel ein Konto oder ist das Hochladen meiner Karten erforderlich?","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"Nr. Das Spiel und der optionale Speicher bleiben in diesem Browser auf diesem Gerät.","Rules and limitations":"Regeln und Einschränkungen","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"Krieg ist größtenteils Zufall und kann lange dauern; Einige Kartenbestellungen können wiederholt werden. Diese Version verwendet während eines Krieges eine verdeckte Karte pro Spieler, schließt jeden Spieler aus der unentschiedenen Schlacht ein und entfernt einen Spieler, der das Down-and-Up-Paar nicht vervollständigen kann. Lokale CPU-Spieler drehen einfach Karten um. Es gibt keinen Online-Multiplayer, kein Konto oder keine hochgeladenen Spieldaten.","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Kostenlos spielbar. Karten, Spielstatus und optionales Speichern bleiben auf diesem Gerät; Es wird nichts hochgeladen.","Play War":"Krieg spielen","Related tools":"Verwandte Tools","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"KOSTENLOS · LÄUFT IN IHREM BROWSER","Language":"Sprache","UsefulVerse":"UsefulVerse","All tools":"Alle Werkzeuge","Total players":"Gesamtzahl der Spieler","New game":"Neues Spiel","Resume saved game":"Gespeichertes Spiel fortsetzen","Delete saved game":"Gespeichertes Spiel löschen","Export results":"Ergebnisse exportieren","Eliminated":"Eliminiert","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Starten Sie ein Spiel oder setzen Sie das auf diesem Gerät gespeicherte Spiel fort.","Flip cards":"Umdrehkarten","Continue the war":"Setzen Sie den Krieg fort","Auto-play":"Automatische Wiedergabe","Stop auto-play":"Automatische Wiedergabe stoppen","Auto-play paused.":"Automatische Wiedergabe angehalten.","Auto-play speed":"Auto-Play-Geschwindigkeit","Slow":"Langsam","Normal":"Normal","Fast":"Schnell","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"Die automatische Wiedergabe wurde gestoppt, weil genau diese Kartenanordnung wiederholt wurde. Es wurde kein Gewinner bekannt gegeben; manuell fortfahren oder die automatische Wiedergabe erneut starten.","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"Die automatische Wiedergabe wurde nach 500-Aktionen gestoppt, damit diese Seite weiterhin reagiert. Das Spiel kann weitergehen; manuell abspielen oder die automatische Wiedergabe erneut starten.","Your pile":"Dein Stapel","Cards on the table":"Karten auf dem Tisch","Face down":"Mit dem Gesicht nach unten","No cards have been flipped yet.":"Es wurden noch keine Karten umgedreht.","Player":"Spieler","Computer {number}":"Computer {number}","You":"Du","Cards":"Karten","Flips":"Flips","Wars":"Kriege","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"Das Spiel hat begonnen. Drehen Sie die oberste Karte vom Stapel jedes Spielers um.","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} hat den Kampf gewonnen und {count} Karten gesammelt.","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"Krieg! Die höchsten Karten sind unentschieden. Decken Sie weiterhin für jeden Spieler im Kampf eine offene und eine offene Karte auf.","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} hat alle Karten gesammelt und das Spiel gewonnen!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"Kein Spieler konnte den Krieg beenden. Das Spiel ist unentschieden.","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"Ein Spieler ohne zwei Karten könnte den Krieg nicht beenden und verliert.","Game saved on this device.":"Spiel auf diesem Gerät gespeichert.","Saved game resumed.":"Das gespeicherte Spiel wird fortgesetzt.","Saved game deleted.":"Gespeichertes Spiel gelöscht.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Lokales Speichern ist nicht verfügbar; Dieses Spiel bleibt geöffnet, bis Sie die Seite verlassen.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Gespeichertes Spiel konnte nicht gelesen werden. Starten Sie ein neues Spiel oder löschen Sie den beschädigten Speicher.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Auf diesem Gerät ist kein gespeichertes Spiel vorhanden.","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"Ein 52-Kartendeck, keine Joker. Gleichmäßige Verteilung unter den Spielern 2–4; Legen Sie eine Karte für drei Spieler beiseite. Bei jedem Wurf gewinnt die höchste Karte; Anzüge spielen keine Rolle. Ass hoch, 2 niedrig. Bei einem Unentschieden legt jeder Spieler im Kampf eine Karte ab und eine auf. Die höchste aufgedeckte Karte nimmt alle. Wenn Sie einen Krieg nicht beenden können, verlieren Sie. Das Spiel kann lang sein und besteht hauptsächlich aus Glück.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Norwegische Regeln überprüft 16 Oktober 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"Norske kortspill · Krig"},"el":{"War Card Game":"Παιχνίδι με κάρτες πολέμου","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"Παιχνίδι με κάρτες War Online — Παίξτε το Classic Card Battle","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"Παίξτε το κλασικό παιχνίδι καρτών War τοπικά με δύο έως τέσσερις παίκτες. Γυρίστε κάρτες, επιλύστε τους δεσμούς με κλειστές και κλειστές κάρτες και κρατήστε κάθε κάρτα σε αυτήν τη συσκευή.","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"Γυρίστε το επάνω φύλλο από το σωρό κάθε παίκτη. Το υψηλότερο φύλλο κερδίζει τη μάχη. ισάξιοι αρχίζουν πόλεμο.","A quick example":"Ένα γρήγορο παράδειγμα","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"Ένα 10 κερδίζει ένα 6 ανεξάρτητα από το χρώμα. Εάν τα κορυφαία φύλλα ισοδυναμούν, κάθε παίκτης στη μάχη τοποθετεί ένα φύλλο κλειστό και ένα ανοιχτό. το υψηλότερο νέο φύλλο παίρνει το σωρό.","How to play":"Πώς να παίξετε","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"Αυτή η έκδοση ακολουθεί τους νορβηγικούς κανόνες Krig που έχουν ελεγχθεί έναντι του Norske kortspill. Δύο έως τέσσερις παίκτες μοιράζονται μια τυπική τράπουλα 52 χωρίς τζόκερ. Τα φύλλα μοιράζονται κλειστά όσο το δυνατόν πιο ομοιόμορφα. με τρεις παίκτες, ένα φύλλο παραμερίζεται αόρατο. Όλοι γυρίζουν το επάνω φύλλο μαζί. Η υψηλότερη κατάταξη κερδίζει όλα τα φύλλα στο τραπέζι. τα κοστούμια δεν έχουν σημασία. Ο άσος είναι ο υψηλότερος και ο 2 είναι ο χαμηλότερος. Εάν τα υψηλότερα φύλλα ισοδυναμούν, κάθε παίκτης που συμμετείχε σε αυτή τη μάχη τοποθετεί ένα κλειστό φύλλο και μετά ένα ανοιχτό. Το υψηλότερο νέο ανοιχτό φύλλο καταλαμβάνει ολόκληρο το σωρό. Μια περαιτέρω ισοπαλία επαναλαμβάνει το ίδιο βήμα. Ένας παίκτης που δεν μπορεί να δώσει και τα δύο φύλλα πολέμου χάνει. Οι υπόλοιπες κάρτες τους εντάσσονται στο σωρό μάχης. Ο τελευταίος παίκτης με κάρτες κερδίζει. Το παιχνίδι βασίζεται στην τύχη, μπορεί να διαρκέσει πολύ και αυτή η έκδοση δεν ισχυρίζεται ότι αποτρέπει κάθε πιθανή επαναλαμβανόμενη ακολουθία.","Frequently asked questions":"Συχνές ερωτήσεις","How many players can play?":"Πόσοι παίκτες μπορούν να παίξουν;","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"Επιλέξτε δύο, τρεις ή τέσσερις παίκτες. Όλοι χρησιμοποιούν μια τυπική τράπουλα κάρτας 52.","Which card is highest?":"Ποιο φύλλο είναι το υψηλότερο;\nΟ","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"Ο άσος είναι ο υψηλότερος, ακολουθούμενος από king, queen, jack και 10 μέχρι 2. Τα κοστούμια δεν έχουν βαθμό.","What happens on a tie?":"Τι συμβαίνει σε μια ισοπαλία;","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"Κάθε παίκτης στη μάχη βάζει ένα φύλλο κλειστό και ένα ανοιχτό. Το υψηλότερο νέο ανοιχτό φύλλο κερδίζει όλα τα φύλλα στο τραπέζι.","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"Τι γίνεται αν δεν έχω αρκετά φύλλα για πόλεμο;","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"Ένας παίκτης που δεν μπορεί να ολοκληρώσει το ζεύγος με το πρόσωπο προς τα κάτω και το πρόσωπο προς τα πάνω χάνει. Τα υπόλοιπα φύλλα τους μένουν στο σωρό μάχης.","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"Αυτό το παιχνίδι απαιτεί λογαριασμό ή ανεβάζει τις κάρτες μου;","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"Αρ. Το παιχνίδι και η προαιρετική αποθήκευση παραμένουν σε αυτό το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης σε αυτήν τη συσκευή.","Rules and limitations":"Κανόνες και περιορισμοί","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"Ο πόλεμος είναι κυρίως τυχαίος και μπορεί να διαρκέσει πολύ. ορισμένες παραγγελίες καρτών μπορεί να επαναληφθούν. Αυτή η έκδοση χρησιμοποιεί ένα κλειστό φύλλο ανά παίκτη κατά τη διάρκεια ενός πολέμου, περιλαμβάνει κάθε παίκτη από την ισοπαλία μάχη και αφαιρεί έναν παίκτη που δεν μπορεί να ολοκληρώσει το ζεύγος κάτω και πάνω. Οι τοπικοί παίκτες CPU απλώς γυρίζουν κάρτες. Δεν υπάρχουν δεδομένα για πολλούς παίκτες στο διαδίκτυο, λογαριασμός ή μεταφορτωμένα δεδομένα παιχνιδιού.","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Δωρεάν παιχνίδι. Κάρτες, κατάσταση αντιστοίχισης και προαιρετική αποθήκευση σε αυτήν τη συσκευή. τίποτα δεν έχει ανέβει.","Play War":"Παίξτε War","Related tools":"Σχετικά εργαλεία","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ΔΩΡΕΑΝ · ΕΚΤΕΛΕΙΤΑΙ ΣΤΟ BROWSER ΣΑΣ","Language":"Γλώσσα","UsefulVerse":"UsefulVerse","All tools":"Όλα τα εργαλεία","Total players":"Σύνολο παικτών","New game":"Νέο παιχνίδι","Resume saved game":"Συνέχιση αποθηκευμένου παιχνιδιού","Delete saved game":"Διαγραφή αποθηκευμένου παιχνιδιού","Export results":"Εξαγωγή αποτελεσμάτων","Eliminated":"Εξαιρείται","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Ξεκινήστε ένα παιχνίδι ή συνεχίστε αυτό που είναι αποθηκευμένο σε αυτήν τη συσκευή.","Flip cards":"Περάστε κάρτες","Continue the war":"Συνεχίστε τον πόλεμο","Auto-play":"Αυτόματη αναπαραγωγή","Stop auto-play":"Διακοπή αυτόματης αναπαραγωγής","Auto-play paused.":"Η αυτόματη αναπαραγωγή τέθηκε σε παύση.","Auto-play speed":"Ταχύτητα αυτόματης αναπαραγωγής","Slow":"Αργό","Normal":"Κανονικό","Fast":"Γρήγορο","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"Η αυτόματη αναπαραγωγή σταμάτησε επειδή επαναλήφθηκε αυτή ακριβώς η διάταξη καρτών. Δεν ανακηρύχθηκε νικητής. συνεχίστε χειροκίνητα ή ξεκινήστε ξανά την αυτόματη αναπαραγωγή.","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"Η αυτόματη αναπαραγωγή σταμάτησε μετά από ενέργειες 500 για να διατηρήσει αυτή τη σελίδα αποκριτική. Το παιχνίδι μπορεί να συνεχιστεί. παίξτε χειροκίνητα ή ξεκινήστε ξανά την αυτόματη αναπαραγωγή.","Your pile":"Το σωρό σας","Cards on the table":"Κάρτες στο τραπέζι","Face down":"Μπρούμυτα προς τα κάτω","No cards have been flipped yet.":"Δεν έχουν ανατραπεί ακόμη κάρτες.","Player":"Παίχτης","Computer {number}":"Υπολογιστής {number}","You":"Εσείς","Cards":"Καρτέλλες","Flips":"Αναποδογυρίσματα","Wars":"Πόλεμοι","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"Το παιχνίδι ξεκίνησε. Γυρίστε το επάνω φύλλο από το σωρό κάθε παίκτη.","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"Ο {player} κέρδισε τη μάχη και συγκέντρωσε κάρτες {count}.","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"Πόλεμος! Τα υψηλότερα φύλλα είναι δεμένα. Συνεχίστε να αποκαλύπτετε ένα φύλλο κάτω και ένα πάνω για κάθε παίκτη στη μάχη.","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"Το {player} συγκέντρωσε όλα τα φύλλα και κέρδισε το παιχνίδι!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"Κανένας παίκτης δεν μπορούσε να ολοκληρώσει τον πόλεμο. Το παιχνίδι είναι ισοπαλία.","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"Ένας παίκτης χωρίς δύο φύλλα δεν μπορούσε να τελειώσει τον πόλεμο και χάνει.","Game saved on this device.":"Το παιχνίδι αποθηκεύτηκε σε αυτήν τη συσκευή.","Saved game resumed.":"Το αποθηκευμένο παιχνίδι συνεχίστηκε.","Saved game deleted.":"Το αποθηκευμένο παιχνίδι διαγράφηκε.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Η τοπική αποθήκευση δεν είναι διαθέσιμη. αυτό το παιχνίδι θα παραμείνει ανοιχτό μέχρι να φύγετε από τη σελίδα.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Δεν ήταν δυνατή η ανάγνωση του αποθηκευμένου παιχνιδιού. Ξεκινήστε ένα νέο παιχνίδι ή διαγράψτε την κατεστραμμένη αποθήκευση.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Δεν υπάρχει αποθηκευμένο παιχνίδι σε αυτήν τη συσκευή.","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"Μια τράπουλα 52, χωρίς τζόκερ. Συμφωνήστε ομοιόμορφα μεταξύ των παικτών 2–4. βάλτε ένα φύλλο στην άκρη για τρεις παίκτες. Το υψηλότερο φύλλο κερδίζει κάθε χτύπημα. τα κοστούμια δεν έχουν σημασία. Άσος υψηλός, 2 χαμηλός. Σε ισοπαλία, κάθε παίκτης στη μάχη βάζει ένα φύλλο κάτω και ένα πάνω. Το υψηλότερο ανοιχτό φύλλο τα παίρνει όλα. Αν δεν μπορείς να ολοκληρώσεις έναν πόλεμο, χάνεις. Το παιχνίδι μπορεί να είναι μακρύ και είναι κυρίως τύχη.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Οι νορβηγικοί κανόνες έχουν ελεγχθεί 16 Οκτώβριος 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"Norske kortspill · Krig"},"es":{"War Card Game":"Juego de cartas de guerra","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"Juego de cartas de guerra en línea: juega la batalla de cartas clásica","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"Juega localmente al clásico juego de cartas War con dos o cuatro jugadores. Voltee cartas, resuelva empates con cartas boca abajo y boca arriba y conserve todas las cartas en este dispositivo.","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"Da la vuelta a la carta superior de la pila de cada jugador. La carta más alta gana la batalla; rangos iguales comienzan una guerra.","A quick example":"Un ejemplo rápido","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"A 10 vence a 6 independientemente del palo. Si las cartas superiores empatan, cada jugador en la batalla coloca una carta boca abajo y otra boca arriba; la nueva carta más alta se lleva la pila.","How to play":"Cómo jugar","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"Esta versión sigue las reglas noruegas de Krig comparadas con Norske kortspill. De dos a cuatro jugadores comparten una baraja de cartas estándar 52 sin comodines. Las cartas se reparten boca abajo de la forma más pareja posible; con tres jugadores, una carta se deja a un lado sin ser vista. Todos juntos voltean la carta superior. El rango más alto gana todas las cartas sobre la mesa; Los trajes no importan. Ace es el más alto y 2 es el más bajo. Si las cartas más altas empatan, cada jugador que se unió a esa batalla coloca una carta boca abajo y luego otra boca arriba. La nueva carta boca arriba más alta ocupa toda la pila. Un empate adicional repite el mismo paso. Un jugador que no puede suministrar ambas cartas de guerra pierde; sus cartas restantes se unen a la pila de batalla. Gana el último jugador con cartas. El juego se basa en la suerte, puede llevar mucho tiempo y esta versión no pretende evitar todas las secuencias repetitivas posibles.","Frequently asked questions":"Preguntas frecuentes","How many players can play?":"¿Cuántos jugadores pueden jugar?","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"Elige dos, tres o cuatro jugadores. Todo el mundo utiliza una baraja de cartas estándar 52.","Which card is highest?":"¿Qué tarjeta es la más alta?","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"El as es el más alto, seguido por el rey, la reina, la sota y desde 10 hasta 2. Los trajes no tienen rango.","What happens on a tie?":"¿Qué pasa en un empate?","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"Cada jugador en la batalla pone una carta boca abajo y otra boca arriba. La nueva carta boca arriba más alta gana todas las cartas de la mesa.","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"¿Qué pasa si no tengo suficientes cartas para una guerra?","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"El jugador que no pueda completar la pareja boca abajo y boca arriba pierde. Las cartas restantes permanecen en la pila de batalla.","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"¿Este juego requiere una cuenta o subir mis cartas?","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"No. El juego y el guardado opcional permanecen en este navegador en este dispositivo.","Rules and limitations":"Reglas y limitaciones","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"La guerra es principalmente casualidad y puede durar mucho tiempo; algunos pedidos de tarjetas pueden repetirse. Esta versión usa una carta boca abajo por jugador durante una guerra, incluye a todos los jugadores de la batalla empatada y elimina a un jugador que no puede completar el par de abajo y arriba. Los jugadores de la CPU local simplemente voltean las cartas. No hay multijugador en línea, cuenta ni datos de juegos cargados.","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Gratis para jugar. Las tarjetas, el estado del partido y el guardado opcional permanecen en este dispositivo; no se sube nada.","Play War":"Jugar a la guerra","Related tools":"Herramientas relacionadas","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATIS · SE EJECUTA EN TU NAVEGADOR","Language":"Idioma","UsefulVerse":"Verso útil","All tools":"Todas las herramientas","Total players":"Total de jugadores","New game":"Nuevo juego","Resume saved game":"Reanudar partida guardada","Delete saved game":"Eliminar partida guardada","Export results":"Exportar resultados","Eliminated":"Eliminado","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Iniciar un juego o reanudar el guardado en este dispositivo.","Flip cards":"Tarjetas invertidas","Continue the war":"Continuar la guerra","Auto-play":"Reproducción automática","Stop auto-play":"Detener la reproducción automática","Auto-play paused.":"Reproducción automática en pausa.","Auto-play speed":"Velocidad de reproducción automática","Slow":"Lento","Normal":"Normal","Fast":"Rápido","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"La reproducción automática se detuvo porque se repitió exactamente esta disposición de cartas. No se declaró ningún ganador; continúa manualmente o inicia la reproducción automática nuevamente.","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"La reproducción automática se detuvo después de las acciones de 500 para mantener esta página receptiva. El juego puede continuar; jugar manualmente o iniciar la reproducción automática nuevamente.","Your pile":"Tu pila","Cards on the table":"Tarjetas sobre la mesa","Face down":"boca abajo","No cards have been flipped yet.":"Aún no se han volteado ninguna carta.","Player":"Jugador","Computer {number}":"Computadora {number}","You":"Tú","Cards":"Tarjetas","Flips":"voltea","Wars":"Guerras","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"El juego comenzó. Da la vuelta a la carta superior de la pila de cada jugador.","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} ganó la batalla y recogió cartas {count}.","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"¡Guerra! Las cartas más altas están empatadas. Continúe revelando una carta abajo y una arriba para cada jugador en la batalla.","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"¡{player} recogió todas las cartas y ganó el juego!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"Ningún jugador pudo completar la guerra. El juego es un empate.","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"Un jugador sin dos cartas no puede terminar la guerra y pierde.","Game saved on this device.":"Juego guardado en este dispositivo.","Saved game resumed.":"Se reanudó la partida guardada.","Saved game deleted.":"Juego guardado eliminado.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"El guardado local no está disponible; este juego permanecerá abierto hasta que abandones la página.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"No se pudo leer el juego guardado. Comienza un nuevo juego o elimina el guardado dañado.","There is no saved game on this device.":"No hay ninguna partida guardada en este dispositivo.","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"Una baraja de cartas 52, sin comodines. Repartir de manera equitativa entre los jugadores 2–4; reserve una carta para tres jugadores. La carta más alta gana cada lanzamiento; Los trajes no importan. As alto, 2 bajo. En caso de empate, cada jugador en la batalla pone una carta abajo y otra arriba. La carta boca arriba más alta se lo lleva todo. Si no puedes completar una guerra, pierdes. El juego puede ser largo y depende principalmente de la suerte.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Reglas noruegas comprobadas 16 Octubre 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"Norske kortspill · Krig"},"fa":{"War Card Game":"بازی ورق جنگ","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"بازی آنلاین ورق جنگ — نبرد با ورق کلاسیک را بازی کنید","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"بازی کلاسیک ورق جنگ را به صورت محلی با دو تا چهار بازیکن انجام دهید. کارت‌ها را برگردانید، پیوندها را با کارت‌های رو به پایین و رو به بالا حل کنید و هر کارت را در این دستگاه نگه دارید.","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"کارت بالایی را از انبوه هر بازیکن برگردانید. بالاترین کارت برنده نبرد است. درجات مساوی جنگ را آغاز می کنند.","A quick example":"یک مثال سریع","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"یک 10 یک 6 را بدون توجه به کت و شلوار شکست می دهد. اگر کارت‌های برتر مساوی باشند، هر بازیکن در نبرد یک کارت رو به پایین و یک کارت رو به بالا قرار می‌دهد. کارت جدید بالاتر شمع را می گیرد.","How to play":"نحوه بازی","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"این نسخه از قوانین Krig نروژی پیروی می کند که در برابر Norske kortspill بررسی شده است. دو تا چهار بازیکن یک دسته کارت استاندارد 52 را بدون جوکر به اشتراک می گذارند. کارت ها به صورت یکنواخت تا حد امکان به صورت رو به پایین پخش می شوند. با سه بازیکن، یک کارت پنهان کنار گذاشته می شود. همه کارت بالایی را با هم برمی گردانند. بالاترین رتبه برنده تمام کارت های روی میز است. کت و شلوار مهم نیست آس بالاترین و 2 کمترین است. اگر بالاترین کارت ها مساوی باشد، هر بازیکنی که به آن نبرد ملحق شده است، یک کارت را رو به پایین و سپس یک کارت رو به بالا قرار می دهد. بالاترین کارت رو به بالا جدید کل توده را می گیرد. یک کراوات دیگر همان مرحله را تکرار می کند. بازیکنی که نتواند هر دو کارت جنگ را تهیه کند بازنده است. کارت های باقی مانده آنها به شمع نبرد می پیوندند. آخرین بازیکن با کارت برنده می شود. بازی شانس محور است، ممکن است زمان زیادی طول بکشد و این نسخه ادعا نمی کند که از هر سکانس تکراری ممکن جلوگیری کند.","Frequently asked questions":"سوالات متداول","How many players can play?":"چند بازیکن می توانند بازی کنند؟","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"دو، سه یا چهار بازیکن را انتخاب کنید. همه از یک دسته کارت استاندارد 52 استفاده می کنند.","Which card is highest?":"کدام کارت بالاترین است؟","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"آس بالاترین است و پس از آن کینگ، ملکه، جک و 10 تا 2 قرار دارند. کت و شلوارها رتبه ندارند.","What happens on a tie?":"در کراوات چه اتفاقی می افتد؟","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"هر بازیکن در نبرد یک کارت رو به پایین و یک کارت رو به بالا قرار می دهد. کارت رو به بالا جدید تمام کارت های روی میز را برنده می شود.","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"اگر کارت های کافی برای جنگ نداشته باشم چه می شود؟","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"بازیکنی که نتواند جفت رو به پایین و رو به بالا را کامل کند بازنده است. کارت های باقی مانده آنها در انبوه نبرد باقی می ماند.","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"آیا این بازی به حساب کاربری نیاز دارد یا کارت های من را آپلود می کند؟","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"شماره. بازی و ذخیره اختیاری در این مرورگر در این دستگاه باقی می ماند.","Rules and limitations":"قوانین و محدودیت ها","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"جنگ بیشتر شانسی است و می تواند مدت زیادی طول بکشد. برخی از سفارشات کارت ممکن است تکرار شوند. این نسخه از یک کارت رو به پایین برای هر بازیکن در طول جنگ استفاده می‌کند، شامل هر بازیکنی از نبرد مساوی می‌شود و بازیکنی را که نمی‌تواند جفت پایین و بالا را کامل کند حذف می‌کند. بازیکنان CPU محلی به سادگی کارت ها را برمی گردانند. هیچ داده بازی چند نفره آنلاین، حساب کاربری یا آپلود شده ای وجود ندارد.","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"بازی رایگان. کارت‌ها، وضعیت مطابقت و ذخیره اختیاری در این دستگاه. چیزی آپلود نمی شود","Play War":"بازی جنگ","Related tools":"ابزارهای مرتبط","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"رایگان · در مرورگر شما اجرا می شود","Language":"زبان","UsefulVerse":"UsefulVerse","All tools":"کلیه ابزار","Total players":"کل بازیکن","New game":"بازی جدید","Resume saved game":"بازی ذخیره شده را از سر بگیرید","Delete saved game":"حذف بازی ذخیره شده","Export results":"صادرات نتایج","Eliminated":"حذف شده","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"بازی را شروع کنید یا بازی ذخیره شده در این دستگاه را از سر بگیرید.","Flip cards":"برگرداندن کارت","Continue the war":"به جنگ ادامه دهید","Auto-play":"پخش خودکار","Stop auto-play":"توقف پخش خودکار","Auto-play paused.":"پخش خودکار متوقف شد.","Auto-play speed":"سرعت پخش خودکار","Slow":"آهسته","Normal":"معمولی","Fast":"سریع","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"بازی خودکار متوقف شد زیرا دقیقاً ترتیب کارت تکرار شد. هیچ برنده ای اعلام نشد. به صورت دستی ادامه دهید یا دوباره پخش خودکار را شروع کنید.","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"بازی خودکار پس از اقدامات 500 متوقف شد تا این صفحه پاسخگو بماند. ممکن است بازی ادامه پیدا کند. به صورت دستی بازی کنید یا دوباره پخش خودکار را شروع کنید.","Your pile":"شمع شما","Cards on the table":"کارت های روی میز","Face down":"رو به پایین","No cards have been flipped yet.":"هنوز هیچ کارتی برگردانده نشده است.","Player":"بازیکن","Computer {number}":"کامپیوتر {number}","You":"شما","Cards":"کارت ها","Flips":"تلنگر","Wars":"جنگ ها","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"بازی شروع شد کارت بالایی را از انبوه هر بازیکن برگردانید.","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} در نبرد پیروز شد و کارت های {count} را جمع آوری کرد.","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"جنگ! بالاترین کارت ها گره خورده است. به نمایش یک کارت پایین و یک کارت برای هر بازیکن در نبرد ادامه دهید.","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} همه کارت ها را جمع کرد و برنده بازی شد!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"هیچ بازیکنی نتوانست جنگ را کامل کند. بازی مساوی است.","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"بازیکن بدون دو کارت نتوانست جنگ را تمام کند و می بازد.","Game saved on this device.":"بازی در این دستگاه ذخیره شده است.","Saved game resumed.":"بازی ذخیره شده از سر گرفته شد.","Saved game deleted.":"بازی ذخیره شده حذف شد.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"ذخیره محلی در دسترس نیست. این بازی تا زمانی که صفحه را ترک نکنید باز خواهد ماند.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"بازی ذخیره شده قابل خواندن نیست. یک بازی جدید شروع کنید یا ذخیره آسیب دیده را حذف کنید.","There is no saved game on this device.":"هیچ بازی ذخیره شده ای در این دستگاه وجود ندارد.","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"یک عرشه کارتی 52، بدون جوکر. به طور مساوی بین بازیکنان 2–4 معامله کنید. یک کارت را برای سه بازیکن کنار بگذارید. بالاترین کارت برنده هر تلنگر. کت و شلوار مهم نیست آس بالا، 2 کم. در یک تساوی، هر بازیکن در نبرد یک کارت پایین و یک کارت بالا می گذارد. بالاترین کارت رو به بالا همه چیز را می گیرد. اگر نتوانید یک جنگ را کامل کنید، بازنده اید. بازی می تواند طولانی باشد و بیشتر شانس است.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"قوانین نروژی بررسی شد 16 اکتبر 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"Norske kortspill · Krig"},"fr":{"War Card Game":"Jeu de cartes de guerre","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"Jeu de cartes de guerre en ligne — Jouez à la bataille de cartes classique","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"Jouez localement au jeu de cartes de guerre classique avec deux à quatre joueurs. Retournez les cartes, résolvez les égalités avec des cartes face cachée et face visible et conservez chaque carte sur cet appareil.","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"Retournez la carte du dessus de la pile de chaque joueur. La carte la plus haute remporte la bataille ; des rangs égaux déclenchent une guerre.","A quick example":"Un exemple rapide","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"Un 10 bat un 6 quelle que soit la couleur. Si les cartes du dessus sont à égalité, chaque joueur de la bataille place une carte face cachée et une face visible ; la nouvelle carte la plus haute prend la pile.","How to play":"Comment jouer","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"Cette version suit les règles norvégiennes du Krig comparées au Norske kortspill. Deux à quatre joueurs partagent un jeu de cartes 52 standard sans jokers. Les cartes sont distribuées face cachée aussi équitablement que possible ; à trois joueurs, une carte est mise de côté sans être vue. Tout le monde retourne la carte du dessus ensemble. Le rang le plus élevé remporte toutes les cartes sur la table ; les costumes n'ont pas d'importance. Ace est le plus élevé et 2 est le plus bas. Si les cartes les plus élevées sont à égalité, chaque joueur ayant rejoint cette bataille place une carte face cachée puis une face visible. La nouvelle carte face visible la plus haute prend toute la pile. Une autre égalité répète la même étape. Un joueur qui ne peut pas fournir les deux cartes de guerre perd ; leurs cartes restantes rejoignent la pile de bataille. Le dernier joueur avec des cartes gagne. Le jeu est axé sur la chance, peut prendre beaucoup de temps et cette version ne prétend pas empêcher toutes les séquences répétitives possibles.","Frequently asked questions":"Questions fréquemment posées","How many players can play?":"Combien de joueurs peuvent jouer ?","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"Choisissez deux, trois ou quatre joueurs. Tout le monde utilise un jeu de cartes 52 standard.","Which card is highest?":"Quelle carte est la plus élevée ?","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"As est le plus élevé, suivi du roi, de la reine, du valet et de 10 jusqu'à 2. Les costumes n'ont pas de rang.","What happens on a tie?":"Que se passe-t-il en cas d'égalité ?","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"Chaque joueur participant à la bataille pose une carte face cachée et une face visible. La nouvelle carte face visible la plus élevée remporte toutes les cartes sur la table.","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"Que faire si je n'ai pas assez de cartes pour une guerre ?","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"Un joueur qui ne peut pas compléter la paire face cachée et face visible perd. Les cartes restantes restent dans la pile de bataille.","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"Ce jeu nécessite-t-il un compte ou doit-il télécharger mes cartes ?","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"Non. Le jeu et la sauvegarde facultative restent dans ce navigateur sur cet appareil.","Rules and limitations":"Règles et limitations","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"La guerre est principalement le fruit du hasard et peut durer longtemps ; certaines commandes de cartes peuvent se répéter. Cette version utilise une carte face cachée par joueur pendant une guerre, inclut tous les joueurs de la bataille à égalité et supprime un joueur qui ne peut pas compléter la paire face cachée. Les joueurs CPU locaux retournent simplement les cartes. Il n'y a pas de multijoueur en ligne, de compte ou de données de jeu téléchargées.","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Jeu gratuit. Les cartes, l'état de correspondance et la sauvegarde facultative restent sur cet appareil ; rien n'est téléchargé.","Play War":"Jouer à la guerre","Related tools":"Outils associés","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATUIT · FONCTIONNE DANS VOTRE NAVIGATEUR","Language":"Langue","UsefulVerse":"Verse utile","All tools":"Tous les outils","Total players":"Joueurs totaux","New game":"Nouveau jeu","Resume saved game":"Reprendre la partie sauvegardée","Delete saved game":"Supprimer la partie sauvegardée","Export results":"Exporter les résultats","Eliminated":"Éliminé","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Démarrez une partie ou reprenez celle enregistrée sur cet appareil.","Flip cards":"Cartes à rabat","Continue the war":"Continuer la guerre","Auto-play":"Lecture automatique","Stop auto-play":"Arrêter la lecture automatique","Auto-play paused.":"Lecture automatique interrompue.","Auto-play speed":"Vitesse de lecture automatique","Slow":"Lent","Normal":"Normal","Fast":"Rapide","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"La lecture automatique s'est arrêtée car cette disposition exacte des cartes s'est répétée. Aucun gagnant n'a été déclaré ; continuez manuellement ou relancez la lecture automatique.","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"La lecture automatique s'est arrêtée après les actions 500 pour que cette page reste réactive. Le jeu peut continuer ; jouez manuellement ou relancez la lecture automatique.","Your pile":"Votre pile","Cards on the table":"Cartes sur la table","Face down":"Face cachée","No cards have been flipped yet.":"Aucune carte n'a encore été retournée.","Player":"Joueur","Computer {number}":"Ordinateur {number}","You":"Toi","Cards":"Cartes","Flips":"Flips","Wars":"Guerres","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"Le jeu a commencé. Retournez la carte du dessus de la pile de chaque joueur.","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} a remporté la bataille et collecté les cartes {count}.","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"Guerre! Les cartes les plus hautes sont à égalité. Continuez à révéler une carte cachée et une carte visible pour chaque joueur participant à la bataille.","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} a récupéré toutes les cartes et a gagné la partie !","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"Aucun joueur n'a pu terminer la guerre. Le jeu est un match nul.","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"Un joueur sans deux cartes ne peut pas terminer la guerre et perd.","Game saved on this device.":"Jeu enregistré sur cet appareil.","Saved game resumed.":"La partie sauvegardée a repris.","Saved game deleted.":"Jeu sauvegardé supprimé.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"L'enregistrement local n'est pas disponible ; ce jeu restera ouvert jusqu'à ce que vous quittiez la page.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"La partie enregistrée n'a pas pu être lue. Démarrez une nouvelle partie ou supprimez la sauvegarde endommagée.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Il n'y a aucune partie sauvegardée sur cet appareil.","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"Un jeu de cartes 52, sans joker. Répartir équitablement entre les joueurs 2 – 4 ; réservez une carte pour trois joueurs. La carte la plus haute gagne à chaque lancer ; les costumes n'ont pas d'importance. Ace haut, 2 bas. En cas d'égalité, chaque joueur participant à la bataille pose une carte et une carte visible. La plus haute carte face visible remporte tout. Si vous ne pouvez pas terminer une guerre, vous perdez. Le jeu peut être long et relève surtout de la chance.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Règles norvégiennes vérifiées 16 octobre 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"Norske kortspill · Krig"},"gu":{"War Card Game":"વોર કાર્ડ ગેમ","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"વોર કાર્ડ ગેમ ઓનલાઇન — ક્લાસિક કાર્ડ બેટલ રમો","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"બે થી ચાર ખેલાડીઓ સાથે સ્થાનિક રીતે ક્લાસિક વોર કાર્ડ ગેમ રમો. કાર્ડ ફ્લિપ કરો, ફેસ-ડાઉન અને ફેસ-અપ કાર્ડ્સ સાથે સંબંધો ઉકેલો અને દરેક કાર્ડને આ ઉપકરણ પર રાખો.","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"દરેક ખેલાડીના થાંભલામાંથી ટોચનું કાર્ડ ફ્લિપ કરો. સૌથી વધુ કાર્ડ યુદ્ધ જીતે છે; સમાન રેન્ક યુદ્ધ શરૂ કરે છે.","A quick example":"એક ઝડપી ઉદાહરણ","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"A 10 એ 6 ને ગમે તે હોય. જો ટોચના કાર્ડ્સ ટાઇ થાય છે, તો યુદ્ધમાં દરેક ખેલાડી એક કાર્ડ નીચેની તરફ અને એક ચહેરો ઉપર રાખે છે; ઉચ્ચ નવું કાર્ડ ખૂંટો લે છે.","How to play":"કેવી રીતે રમવું","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"આ સંસ્કરણ નોર્સ્કે કોર્ટસ્પિલ સામે તપાસવામાં આવેલ નોર્વેજીયન ક્રીગ નિયમોને અનુસરે છે. બેથી ચાર ખેલાડીઓ જોકર્સ વિના એક પ્રમાણભૂત 52-કાર્ડ ડેક શેર કરે છે. કાર્ડને શક્ય તેટલી સમાનરૂપે નીચેની તરફ વ્યવહાર કરવામાં આવે છે; ત્રણ ખેલાડીઓ સાથે, એક કાર્ડ અદ્રશ્ય કોરે સુયોજિત થયેલ છે. દરેક વ્યક્તિ સાથે મળીને ટોચનું કાર્ડ ફ્લિપ કરે છે. સર્વોચ્ચ ક્રમાંક ટેબલ પરના તમામ કાર્ડ જીતે છે; પોશાકો વાંધો નથી. Ace સૌથી વધુ છે અને 2 સૌથી નીચો છે. જો સૌથી વધુ કાર્ડ ટાઈ થાય, તો તે યુદ્ધમાં જોડાતા દરેક ખેલાડી એક કાર્ડ નીચેની તરફ અને પછી એક મોં ઉપર મૂકે છે. સૌથી વધુ નવું ફેસ-અપ કાર્ડ સમગ્ર ખૂંટો લે છે. વધુ ટાઈ એ જ પગલાનું પુનરાવર્તન કરે છે. એક ખેલાડી જે બંને યુદ્ધ કાર્ડ સપ્લાય કરી શકતો નથી તે હારી જાય છે; તેમના બાકીના કાર્ડ યુદ્ધના ખૂંટોમાં જોડાય છે. કાર્ડ સાથેનો છેલ્લો ખેલાડી જીતે છે. રમત નસીબ-સંચાલિત છે, લાંબો સમય લાગી શકે છે, અને આ સંસ્કરણ દરેક સંભવિત પુનરાવર્તિત ક્રમને અટકાવવાનો દાવો કરતું નથી.","Frequently asked questions":"વારંવાર પૂછાતા પ્રશ્નો","How many players can play?":"કેટલા ખેલાડીઓ રમી શકે છે?","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"બે, ત્રણ કે ચાર ખેલાડીઓ પસંદ કરો. દરેક વ્યક્તિ એક પ્રમાણભૂત 52-કાર્ડ ડેકનો ઉપયોગ કરે છે.","Which card is highest?":"કયું કાર્ડ સૌથી વધુ છે?","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"Ace સૌથી વધુ છે, ત્યારબાદ રાજા, રાણી, જેક અને 10 નીચે 2 છે. સૂટનો કોઈ ક્રમ નથી.","What happens on a tie?":"ટાઈ પર શું થાય છે?","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"યુદ્ધમાં દરેક ખેલાડી એક કાર્ડ મોઢું નીચે અને એક ચહેરો ઉપર રાખે છે. ઉચ્ચ નવું ફેસ-અપ કાર્ડ ટેબલ પરના તમામ કાર્ડ જીતે છે.","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"જો મારી પાસે યુદ્ધ માટે પૂરતા કાર્ડ ન હોય તો શું?","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"એક ખેલાડી જે ફેસ-ડાઉન અને ફેસ-અપ જોડીને પૂર્ણ કરી શકતો નથી તે હારી જાય છે. તેમના બાકીના કાર્ડ યુદ્ધના ખૂંટોમાં રહે છે.","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"શું આ રમત માટે એકાઉન્ટની જરૂર છે અથવા મારા કાર્ડ્સ અપલોડ કરો?","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"નં. ગેમ અને વૈકલ્પિક સેવ આ ઉપકરણ પર આ બ્રાઉઝરમાં રહે છે.","Rules and limitations":"નિયમો અને મર્યાદાઓ","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"યુદ્ધ મોટે ભાગે તક છે અને લાંબો સમય ટકી શકે છે; કેટલાક કાર્ડ ઓર્ડર પુનરાવર્તિત થઈ શકે છે. આ સંસ્કરણ યુદ્ધ દરમિયાન ખેલાડી દીઠ એક ફેસ-ડાઉન કાર્ડનો ઉપયોગ કરે છે, જેમાં બંધાયેલા યુદ્ધમાંથી દરેક ખેલાડીનો સમાવેશ થાય છે, અને એવા ખેલાડીને દૂર કરે છે જે ડાઉન-અને-અપ જોડીને પૂર્ણ કરી શકતા નથી. સ્થાનિક CPU પ્લેયર્સ ખાલી કાર્ડ ફ્લિપ કરે છે. ત્યાં કોઈ ઑનલાઇન મલ્ટિપ્લેયર, એકાઉન્ટ અથવા અપલોડ કરેલ ગેમ ડેટા નથી.","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"રમવા માટે મફત. કાર્ડ્સ, મેચ સ્ટેટ અને વૈકલ્પિક સેવ આ ઉપકરણ પર રહે છે; કંઈપણ અપલોડ નથી.","Play War":"પ્લે વોર","Related tools":"સંબંધિત સાધનો","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"મફત · તમારા બ્રાઉઝરમાં ચાલે છે","Language":"ભાષા","UsefulVerse":"ઉપયોગી પદ્ય","All tools":"તમામ સાધનો","Total players":"કુલ ખેલાડીઓ","New game":"નવી રમત","Resume saved game":"સેવ કરેલી રમત ફરી શરૂ કરો","Delete saved game":"સેવ કરેલી રમત કાઢી નાખો","Export results":"નિકાસ પરિણામો","Eliminated":"નાબૂદ","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"એક રમત શરૂ કરો અથવા આ ઉપકરણ પર સાચવેલ રમત ફરી શરૂ કરો.","Flip cards":"ફ્લિપ કાર્ડ્સ","Continue the war":"યુદ્ધ ચાલુ રાખો","Auto-play":"ઓટો-પ્લે","Stop auto-play":"ઓટો-પ્લે બંધ કરો","Auto-play paused.":"ઓટો-પ્લે થોભાવ્યું.","Auto-play speed":"ઓટો-પ્લે સ્પીડ","Slow":"ધીમી","Normal":"સામાન્ય","Fast":"ઝડપી","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"ઓટો-પ્લે બંધ થઈ ગયું કારણ કે આ ચોક્કસ કાર્ડ ગોઠવણીનું પુનરાવર્તન થયું. કોઈ વિજેતા જાહેર કરવામાં આવ્યું ન હતું; મેન્યુઅલી ચાલુ રાખો અથવા ફરીથી ઑટો-પ્લે શરૂ કરો.","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"આ પૃષ્ઠને પ્રતિભાવશીલ રાખવા માટે 500 ક્રિયાઓ પછી ઓટો-પ્લે બંધ થઈ ગયું. રમત ચાલુ રાખી શકે છે; મેન્યુઅલી ચલાવો અથવા ફરીથી ઑટો-પ્લે શરૂ કરો.","Your pile":"તમારો ખૂંટો","Cards on the table":"ટેબલ પર કાર્ડ્સ","Face down":"ચહેરો નીચે","No cards have been flipped yet.":"હજુ સુધી કોઈ કાર્ડ ફ્લિપ કરવામાં આવ્યા નથી.","Player":"પ્લેયર","Computer {number}":"કમ્પ્યુટર {number}","You":"તમે","Cards":"કાર્ડ્સ","Flips":"ફ્લિપ્સ","Wars":"યુદ્ધો","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"રમત શરૂ થઈ. દરેક ખેલાડીના થાંભલામાંથી ટોચનું કાર્ડ ફ્લિપ કરો.","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} એ યુદ્ધ જીત્યું અને {count} કાર્ડ્સ એકત્રિત કર્યા.","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"યુદ્ધ! સૌથી વધુ કાર્ડ બંધાયેલ છે. યુદ્ધમાં દરેક ખેલાડી માટે એક કાર્ડ ડાઉન અને એક અપ જાહેર કરવાનું ચાલુ રાખો.","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} એ બધા કાર્ડ એકત્ર કર્યા અને ગેમ જીતી!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"કોઈપણ ખેલાડી યુદ્ધ પૂર્ણ કરી શક્યો નહીં. આ રમત ડ્રો છે.","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"બે કાર્ડ વિનાનો ખેલાડી યુદ્ધ સમાપ્ત કરી શક્યો નહીં અને હારી ગયો.","Game saved on this device.":"ગેમ આ ઉપકરણ પર સાચવવામાં આવી છે.","Saved game resumed.":"સાચવેલી રમત ફરી શરૂ થઈ.","Saved game deleted.":"સાચવેલી રમત કાઢી નાખી.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"સ્થાનિક બચત અનુપલબ્ધ છે; જ્યાં સુધી તમે પૃષ્ઠ છોડશો નહીં ત્યાં સુધી આ રમત ખુલ્લી રહેશે.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"સાચવેલી રમત વાંચી શકાતી નથી. નવી રમત શરૂ કરો અથવા ક્ષતિગ્રસ્ત સેવ કાઢી નાખો.","There is no saved game on this device.":"આ ઉપકરણ પર કોઈ સાચવેલ રમત નથી.","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"એક 52- કાર્ડ ડેક, કોઈ જોકર્સ નહીં. 2–4 ખેલાડીઓ વચ્ચે સમાનરૂપે વ્યવહાર કરો; ત્રણ ખેલાડીઓ માટે એક કાર્ડ અલગ રાખો. સર્વોચ્ચ કાર્ડ દરેક ફ્લિપ જીતે છે; પોશાકો વાંધો નથી. Ace ઉચ્ચ, 2 નીચું. ટાઇ પર, યુદ્ધમાં દરેક ખેલાડી એક કાર્ડ નીચે અને એક ઉપર મૂકે છે. સૌથી વધુ ફેસ-અપ કાર્ડ બધા લે છે. જો તમે યુદ્ધ પૂર્ણ કરી શકતા નથી, તો તમે હારી જાઓ છો. રમત લાંબી હોઈ શકે છે અને મોટે ભાગે નસીબ છે.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"નોર્વેજીયન નિયમો 16 ઓક્ટોબર 2026 ચકાસાયેલ","Norske kortspill · Krig":"નોર્સ્કે કોર્ટસ્પિલ · ક્રિગ"},"ha":{"War Card Game":"Wasan Katin Yaki","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"Wasan Katin Yaƙi akan layi - Kunna Yaƙin Katin Classic","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"Kunna wasan katin yaƙi na gargajiya a cikin gida tare da 'yan wasa biyu zuwa huɗu. Juya katunan, warware alaƙa tare da katunan fuska da fuska, kuma ajiye kowane kati akan wannan na'urar.","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"Juya babban katin daga tarin kowane ɗan wasa. Katin mafi girma ya lashe yaƙin; daidai sahu fara yaƙi.","A quick example":"Misali mai sauri","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"10 ya doke 6 ba tare da la'akari da kwat da wando ba. Idan manyan katunan sun yi kunnen doki, kowane ɗan wasa a cikin yaƙin yana sanya kati ɗaya a ƙasa da fuska ɗaya sama; mafi girma sabon katin daukan tari.","How to play":"Yadda ake wasa","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"Wannan sigar ta bi ka'idodin Krig na Norwegian da aka bincika akan Norske kortspill. 'Yan wasa biyu zuwa hudu suna raba ma'aunin katin 52 guda ɗaya ba tare da masu wasa ba. Ana kashe katunan fuska a ko'ina kamar yadda zai yiwu; tare da 'yan wasa uku, an ajiye kati ɗaya a gefe ba a gani ba. Kowa yana jujjuya babban katin tare. Matsayi mafi girma ya lashe duk katunan akan tebur; kara ba komai. Ace shine mafi girma kuma 2 shine mafi ƙasƙanci. Idan manyan katunan sun yi kunnen doki, kowane ɗan wasan da ya shiga wannan yaƙin yana sanya kati ɗaya ƙasa sannan ɗaya fuskance sama. Sabon katin fuska mafi girma yana ɗaukar duka tari. Wani ƙulle ya sake maimaita mataki ɗaya. Dan wasan da ba zai iya ba da katunan yakin biyu ba ya yi hasara; ragowar katunan su sun shiga cikin yakin. Dan wasa na karshe da katunan yayi nasara. Wasan yana da sa'a, yana iya ɗaukar lokaci mai tsawo, kuma wannan sigar baya da'awar hana kowane jerin maimaitawa.","Frequently asked questions":"Tambayoyin da ake yawan yi","How many players can play?":"'Yan wasa nawa ne za su iya taka leda?","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"Zaɓi 'yan wasa biyu, uku ko huɗu. Kowa yana amfani da bene na katin 52 guda ɗaya.","Which card is highest?":"Wanne kati ne mafi girma?","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"Ace shine mafi girma, biye da sarki, sarauniya, jack da 10 zuwa 2. Suits ba su da daraja.","What happens on a tie?":"Me ke faruwa akan kunnen doki?","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"Kowane ɗan wasa a cikin yaƙin yana sanya kati ɗaya ƙasa da fuska ɗaya sama. Sabon katin fuska mafi girma yana lashe duk katunan akan tebur.","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"Idan bani da isassun katunan yaƙi fa?","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"Dan wasan da ba zai iya kammala fuska-kasa da fuska biyu ya yi hasara ba. Katunan da suka rage suna tsayawa a cikin tarin yaƙi.","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"Shin wannan wasan yana buƙatar asusu ko loda katunana?","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"No. Wasan da tanadin zaɓi na zama a cikin wannan mazuruftan akan wannan na'urar.","Rules and limitations":"Dokoki da iyakancewa","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"Yaki galibi dama ce kuma yana iya ɗaukar lokaci mai tsawo; wasu odar kati na iya maimaitawa. Wannan sigar tana amfani da kati guda ɗaya na fuskar ƙasa kowane ɗan wasa yayin yaƙi, ya haɗa da kowane ɗan wasa daga yaƙin da aka ɗaure, kuma yana cire ɗan wasan da ba zai iya kammala nau'ikan ƙasa da sama ba. Yan wasan CPU na gida suna juye katunan kawai. Babu mahaɗan kan layi, lissafi, ko bayanan wasan da aka ɗora.","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Yin wasa kyauta. Katuna, yanayin daidaitawa da tsayawa na zaɓi na zaɓi akan wannan na'urar; babu abin da aka ɗora.","Play War":"Yakin Wasa","Related tools":"Kayan aiki masu alaƙa","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"KYAUTA · Yana Gudu A CIKIN browsing","Language":"Harshe","UsefulVerse":"Verse Mai Amfani","All tools":"Duk kayan aikin","Total players":"Jimlar 'yan wasa","New game":"Sabon wasa","Resume saved game":"Ci gaba da wasan da aka ajiye","Delete saved game":"Share wasan da aka ajiye","Export results":"Sakamakon fitarwa","Eliminated":"An cire","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Fara wasa ko ci gaba da wanda aka ajiye akan wannan na'urar.","Flip cards":"Katunan Juya","Continue the war":"Ci gaba da yaƙin","Auto-play":"Yin wasa ta atomatik","Stop auto-play":"Dakatar da wasa ta atomatik","Auto-play paused.":"An dakatad da kunna kai tsaye.","Auto-play speed":"Gudun wasa ta atomatik","Slow":"Sannu a hankali","Normal":"Na al'ada","Fast":"Mai sauri","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"wasa kai tsaye ya tsaya saboda an maimaita wannan tsari na katin. Ba a bayyana wanda ya yi nasara ba; ci gaba da hannu ko kuma fara wasa ta atomatik.","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"An dakatar da wasa ta atomatik bayan ayyukan 500 don kiyaye wannan shafin yana mai da martani. Wasan na iya ci gaba; kunna da hannu ko kuma fara wasa ta atomatik.","Your pile":"Tarin ku","Cards on the table":"Katuna akan tebur","Face down":"Fuska a kasa","No cards have been flipped yet.":"Ba a jujjuya katunan ba tukuna.","Player":"Mai kunnawa","Computer {number}":"Kwamfuta {number}","You":"Kai","Cards":"Katuna","Flips":"Juyawa","Wars":"Yaƙe-yaƙe","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"An fara wasan. Juya babban katin daga kowane tarin ɗan wasa.","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} ya lashe yakin kuma ya tattara katunan {count}.","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"Yaki! An ɗaure katunan mafi girma. Ci gaba da bayyana kati ɗaya ƙasa da ɗaya sama ga kowane ɗan wasa a cikin yaƙin.","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} ya tattara duk katunan kuma ya ci wasan!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"Babu dan wasa da zai iya kammala yakin. Wasan zane ne.","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"Dan wasan da ba shi da katunan biyu ba zai iya gama yakin ba kuma ya yi rashin nasara.","Game saved on this device.":"An ajiye wasan akan wannan na'urar.","Saved game resumed.":"An ci gaba da wasan da aka ajiye.","Saved game deleted.":"An share wasan da aka ajiye.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Babu ajiyar gida; wannan wasan zai kasance a bude har sai kun bar shafin.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Wasan da aka ajiye ba a iya karantawa ba. Fara sabon wasa ko share lalacewa da aka lalace.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Babu ajiyan wasa akan wannan na'urar.","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"Tsarin katin 52 ɗaya, babu masu wasa. Yi daidai tsakanin 'yan wasan 2–4; ware kati daya ga 'yan wasa uku. Katin mafi girma yana cin nasara kowane juzu'i; kara ba komai. Ace babba, 2 ƙananan. A kunnen doki, kowane ɗan wasa a cikin yaƙin yana sanya kati ɗaya ƙasa da ɗaya sama. Katin fuska mafi girma yana ɗaukar duka. Idan ba za ku iya kammala yaƙi ba, kun yi hasara. Wasan na iya zama tsayi kuma yawanci sa'a ne.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Dokokin Norwegian sun duba 16 Oktoba 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"Norske kortspill · Krig"},"hi":{"War Card Game":"वॉर कार्ड गेम","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"वॉर कार्ड गेम ऑनलाइन — क्लासिक कार्ड बैटल खेलें","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"दो से चार खिलाड़ियों के साथ स्थानीय स्तर पर क्लासिक वॉर कार्ड गेम खेलें। कार्ड पलटें, फेस-डाउन और फेस-अप कार्ड के साथ संबंधों को सुलझाएं और प्रत्येक कार्ड को इस डिवाइस पर रखें।","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"प्रत्येक खिलाड़ी के ढेर से शीर्ष कार्ड पलटें। उच्चतम कार्ड लड़ाई जीतता है; समान रैंक वाले युद्ध शुरू करते हैं।","A quick example":"एक त्वरित उदाहरण","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"A 10 सूट की परवाह किए बिना 6 को मात देता है। यदि शीर्ष कार्ड टाई हो जाते हैं, तो लड़ाई में प्रत्येक खिलाड़ी एक कार्ड को नीचे की ओर और एक को ऊपर की ओर रखता है; जितना ऊँचा नया कार्ड ढेर लेता है।","How to play":"कैसे खेलें","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"यह संस्करण नॉर्स्के कॉर्टस्पिल के विरुद्ध जांचे गए नॉर्वेजियन क्रिग नियमों का पालन करता है। दो से चार खिलाड़ी जोकर के बिना एक मानक 52-कार्ड डेक साझा करते हैं। कार्ड यथासंभव समान रूप से नीचे की ओर बांटे जाते हैं; तीन खिलाड़ियों के साथ, एक कार्ड बिना देखे अलग रख दिया जाता है। हर कोई एक साथ शीर्ष कार्ड को पलटता है। सर्वोच्च रैंक टेबल पर सभी कार्ड जीतता है; सूट कोई मायने नहीं रखता. ऐस उच्चतम है और 2 सबसे निचला है। यदि उच्चतम कार्ड टाई हो जाते हैं, तो उस लड़ाई में शामिल होने वाला प्रत्येक खिलाड़ी एक कार्ड नीचे की ओर रखता है और फिर एक कार्ड ऊपर की ओर रखता है। उच्चतम नया फेस-अप कार्ड पूरे ढेर को ले लेता है। एक और टाई उसी चरण को दोहराती है। एक खिलाड़ी जो दोनों युद्ध कार्ड प्रदान नहीं कर सकता वह हार जाता है; उनके बचे हुए कार्ड लड़ाई के ढेर में शामिल हो जाते हैं। कार्ड वाला अंतिम खिलाड़ी जीतता है। खेल भाग्य से प्रेरित है, इसमें लंबा समय लग सकता है, और यह संस्करण हर संभव दोहराए जाने वाले अनुक्रम को रोकने का दावा नहीं करता है।","Frequently asked questions":"अक्सर पूछे जाने वाले प्रश्न","How many players can play?":"कितने खिलाड़ी खेल सकते हैं?","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"दो, तीन या चार खिलाड़ी चुनें। हर कोई एक मानक 52-कार्ड डेक का उपयोग करता है।","Which card is highest?":"कौन सा कार्ड सबसे अधिक है?","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"ऐस सर्वोच्च है, उसके बाद किंग, क्वीन, जैक और 10 नीचे 2 तक हैं। सूट की कोई रैंक नहीं होती.","What happens on a tie?":"टाई पर क्या होता है?","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"युद्ध में प्रत्येक खिलाड़ी एक कार्ड को नीचे की ओर और एक को ऊपर की ओर रखता है। उच्चतर नया फेस-अप कार्ड टेबल पर सभी कार्ड जीतता है।","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"यदि मेरे पास युद्ध के लिए पर्याप्त कार्ड न हों तो क्या होगा?","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"एक खिलाड़ी जो फेस-डाउन और फेस-अप जोड़ी को पूरा नहीं कर पाता वह हार जाता है। उनके शेष कार्ड लड़ाई के ढेर में रहते हैं।","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"क्या इस गेम के लिए किसी खाते की आवश्यकता है या मेरे कार्ड अपलोड करने की आवश्यकता है?","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"नहीं। गेम और वैकल्पिक सेव इस डिवाइस पर इस ब्राउज़र में रहते हैं।","Rules and limitations":"नियम और सीमाएँ","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"युद्ध अधिकतर आकस्मिक होता है और लंबे समय तक चल सकता है; कुछ कार्ड ऑर्डर दोहराए जा सकते हैं. यह संस्करण युद्ध के दौरान प्रति खिलाड़ी एक फेस-डाउन कार्ड का उपयोग करता है, इसमें बंधे हुए युद्ध के प्रत्येक खिलाड़ी को शामिल किया जाता है, और उस खिलाड़ी को हटा दिया जाता है जो डाउन-एंड-अप जोड़ी को पूरा नहीं कर सकता है। स्थानीय सीपीयू खिलाड़ी बस कार्ड पलटते हैं। कोई ऑनलाइन मल्टीप्लेयर, खाता या अपलोड किया गया गेम डेटा नहीं है।","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"खेलने के लिए निःशुल्क। कार्ड, मिलान स्थिति और वैकल्पिक सेव इस डिवाइस पर बने रहेंगे; कुछ भी अपलोड नहीं किया गया है.","Play War":"युद्ध खेलें","Related tools":"संबंधित उपकरण","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"मुफ़्त · आपके ब्राउज़र में चलता है","Language":"भाषा","UsefulVerse":"उपयोगी श्लोक","All tools":"सभी उपकरण","Total players":"कुल खिलाड़ी","New game":"नया गेम","Resume saved game":"सहेजा गया गेम फिर से शुरू करें","Delete saved game":"सहेजा गया गेम हटाएं","Export results":"निर्यात परिणाम","Eliminated":"समाप्त","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"एक गेम प्रारंभ करें या इस डिवाइस पर सहेजे गए गेम को फिर से शुरू करें।","Flip cards":"फ्लिप कार्ड","Continue the war":"युद्ध जारी रखें","Auto-play":"ऑटो-प्ले","Stop auto-play":"ऑटो-प्ले बंद करें","Auto-play paused.":"ऑटो-प्ले रोका गया।","Auto-play speed":"ऑटो-प्ले स्पीड","Slow":"धीमा","Normal":"सामान्य","Fast":"तेज","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"ऑटो-प्ले बंद हो गया क्योंकि यह सटीक कार्ड व्यवस्था दोहराई गई। कोई विजेता घोषित नहीं किया गया; मैन्युअल रूप से जारी रखें या ऑटो-प्ले फिर से शुरू करें।","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"इस पेज को प्रतिक्रियाशील बनाए रखने के लिए 500 क्रियाओं के बाद ऑटो-प्ले बंद हो गया। खेल जारी रह सकता है; मैन्युअल रूप से चलाएं या ऑटो-प्ले फिर से प्रारंभ करें।","Your pile":"आपका ढेर","Cards on the table":"मेज पर कार्ड","Face down":"चेहरा झुकना","No cards have been flipped yet.":"अभी तक कोई कार्ड फ़्लिप नहीं किया गया है.","Player":"खिलाड़ी","Computer {number}":"कंप्यूटर {number}","You":"आप","Cards":"कार्ड","Flips":"फ़्लिप","Wars":"युद्धों","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"खेल शुरू हुआ. प्रत्येक खिलाड़ी के ढेर से शीर्ष कार्ड पलटें।","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} ने लड़ाई जीत ली और {count} कार्ड एकत्र कर लिये।","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"युद्ध! उच्चतम कार्ड बंधे हुए हैं। लड़ाई में प्रत्येक खिलाड़ी के लिए एक कार्ड नीचे और एक ऊपर प्रकट करना जारी रखें।","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} ने सभी कार्ड एकत्र किए और गेम जीत लिया!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"कोई भी खिलाड़ी युद्ध पूरा नहीं कर सका. गेम ड्रा है.","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"दो कार्डों के बिना एक खिलाड़ी युद्ध समाप्त नहीं कर सका और हार गया।","Game saved on this device.":"गेम इस डिवाइस पर सहेजा गया.","Saved game resumed.":"सहेजा गया गेम फिर से शुरू हुआ.","Saved game deleted.":"सहेजा गया गेम हटा दिया गया।","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"स्थानीय बचत अनुपलब्ध है; यह गेम तब तक खुला रहेगा जब तक आप पेज नहीं छोड़ देते।","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"सहेजा गया गेम पढ़ा नहीं जा सका। एक नया गेम शुरू करें या क्षतिग्रस्त सेव को हटा दें।","There is no saved game on this device.":"इस डिवाइस पर कोई सहेजा गया गेम नहीं है।","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"एक 52-कार्ड डेक, कोई जोकर नहीं। 2–4 खिलाड़ियों के बीच समान रूप से डील करें; तीन खिलाड़ियों के लिए एक कार्ड अलग रखें। उच्चतम कार्ड प्रत्येक फ्लिप जीतता है; सूट कोई मायने नहीं रखता. ऐस ऊँचा, 2 निचला। टाई होने पर, लड़ाई में प्रत्येक खिलाड़ी एक कार्ड नीचे और एक ऊपर रखता है। उच्चतम फेस-अप कार्ड सभी लेता है। यदि आप युद्ध पूरा नहीं कर पाते, तो आप हार जाते हैं। खेल लंबा हो सकता है और इसमें अधिकतर भाग्य का हाथ होता है।","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"नार्वेजियन नियमों की जाँच की गई 16 अक्टूबर 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"नॉर्स्के कॉर्टस्पिल · क्रिग"},"id":{"War Card Game":"Permainan Kartu Perang","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"Game Kartu Perang Online — Mainkan Pertarungan Kartu Klasik","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"Mainkan permainan kartu Perang klasik secara lokal dengan dua hingga empat pemain. Balik kartu, selesaikan ikatan dengan kartu menghadap ke bawah dan menghadap ke atas, dan simpan setiap kartu di perangkat ini.","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"Balikkan kartu teratas dari tumpukan masing-masing pemain. Kartu tertinggi memenangkan pertarungan; peringkat yang sama memulai perang.","A quick example":"Contoh singkat","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"10 mengalahkan 6 apa pun jenisnya. Jika kartu teratas seri, setiap pemain dalam pertarungan menempatkan satu kartu menghadap ke bawah dan satu menghadap ke atas; semakin tinggi kartu baru yang diambil tumpukannya.","How to play":"Cara bermain","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"Versi ini mengikuti aturan Krig Norwegia yang diperiksa terhadap Norske kortspill. Dua hingga empat pemain berbagi satu setumpuk kartu 52 standar tanpa pelawak. Kartu dibagikan menghadap ke bawah secara merata; dengan tiga pemain, satu kartu disisihkan tanpa terlihat. Semua orang membalik kartu teratas bersama-sama. Peringkat tertinggi memenangkan semua kartu di meja; jas tidak masalah. Ace tertinggi dan 2 terendah. Jika kartu tertinggi seri, setiap pemain yang bergabung dalam pertarungan itu menempatkan satu kartu menghadap ke bawah dan satu lagi menghadap ke atas. Kartu terbuka tertinggi yang baru menempati seluruh tumpukan. Ikatan selanjutnya mengulangi langkah yang sama. Seorang pemain yang tidak dapat memberikan kedua kartu perang kalah; sisa kartu mereka bergabung ke tumpukan pertempuran. Pemain terakhir yang memiliki kartu menang. Permainan ini didorong oleh keberuntungan, mungkin memakan waktu lama, dan versi ini tidak mengklaim dapat mencegah setiap kemungkinan pengulangan urutan.","Frequently asked questions":"Pertanyaan yang sering diajukan","How many players can play?":"Berapa banyak pemain yang bisa bermain?","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"Pilih dua, tiga atau empat pemain. Setiap orang menggunakan satu setumpuk kartu 52 standar.","Which card is highest?":"Kartu mana yang tertinggi?","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"Ace adalah yang tertinggi, diikuti oleh king, queen, jack dan 10 hingga 2. Setelan tidak memiliki peringkat.","What happens on a tie?":"Apa yang terjadi pada dasi?","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"Setiap pemain dalam pertempuran meletakkan satu kartu menghadap ke bawah dan satu menghadap ke atas. Kartu terbuka baru yang lebih tinggi memenangkan semua kartu di meja.","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"Bagaimana jika saya tidak memiliki cukup kartu untuk berperang?","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"Pemain yang tidak dapat menyelesaikan pasangan menghadap ke bawah dan menghadap ke atas kalah. Kartu mereka yang tersisa tetap berada di tumpukan pertempuran.","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"Apakah game ini memerlukan akun atau mengunggah kartu saya?","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"Tidak. Game dan penyimpanan opsional tetap ada di browser ini pada perangkat ini.","Rules and limitations":"Aturan dan batasan","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"Perang sebagian besar bersifat kebetulan dan dapat berlangsung lama; beberapa pesanan kartu mungkin berulang. Versi ini menggunakan satu kartu menghadap ke bawah per pemain selama perang, menyertakan setiap pemain dari pertarungan seri, dan mengeluarkan pemain yang tidak dapat menyelesaikan pasangan bawah dan atas. Pemain CPU lokal cukup membalik kartu. Tidak ada multipemain online, akun, atau data game yang diunggah.","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Gratis dimainkan. Kartu, status pertandingan, dan penyimpanan opsional tetap ada di perangkat ini; tidak ada yang diunggah.","Play War":"Mainkan Perang","Related tools":"Alat terkait","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATIS · BERJALAN DI BROWSER ANDA","Language":"Bahasa","UsefulVerse":"Ayat Berguna","All tools":"Semua alat","Total players":"Jumlah pemain","New game":"Permainan baru","Resume saved game":"Lanjutkan permainan yang disimpan","Delete saved game":"Hapus permainan yang disimpan","Export results":"Ekspor hasil","Eliminated":"Dihilangkan","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Memulai permainan atau melanjutkan permainan yang disimpan di perangkat ini.","Flip cards":"Balik kartu","Continue the war":"Lanjutkan perang","Auto-play":"Putar otomatis","Stop auto-play":"Hentikan putar otomatis","Auto-play paused.":"Putar otomatis dijeda.","Auto-play speed":"Kecepatan putar otomatis","Slow":"Lambat","Normal":"Biasa","Fast":"Cepat","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"Pemutaran otomatis dihentikan karena susunan kartu yang sama persis diulang. Tidak ada pemenang yang diumumkan; lanjutkan secara manual atau mulai putar otomatis lagi.","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"Putar otomatis dihentikan setelah tindakan 500 untuk menjaga halaman ini tetap responsif. Permainan mungkin berlanjut; mainkan secara manual atau mulai putar otomatis lagi.","Your pile":"Tumpukan Anda","Cards on the table":"Kartu di atas meja","Face down":"Menghadap ke bawah","No cards have been flipped yet.":"Belum ada kartu yang dibalik.","Player":"Pemain","Computer {number}":"Komputer {number}","You":"Anda","Cards":"Kartu-kartu","Flips":"Membalik","Wars":"Perang","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"Permainan dimulai. Balikkan kartu teratas dari tumpukan setiap pemain.","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} memenangkan pertempuran dan mengumpulkan kartu {count}.","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"Perang! Kartu tertinggi terikat. Terus ungkapkan satu kartu ke bawah dan satu kartu ke atas untuk setiap pemain dalam pertempuran.","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} mengumpulkan semua kartu dan memenangkan permainan!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"Tidak ada pemain yang bisa menyelesaikan perang. Pertandingan ini seri.","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"Seorang pemain tanpa dua kartu tidak dapat menyelesaikan perang dan kalah.","Game saved on this device.":"Game disimpan di perangkat ini.","Saved game resumed.":"Permainan yang disimpan dilanjutkan.","Saved game deleted.":"Game yang disimpan dihapus.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Tabungan lokal tidak tersedia; permainan ini akan tetap terbuka sampai Anda meninggalkan halaman.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Game yang disimpan tidak dapat dibaca. Mulai permainan baru atau hapus simpanan yang rusak.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Tidak ada game tersimpan di perangkat ini.","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"Satu setumpuk kartu 52, tidak ada pelawak. Menangani secara merata di antara pemain 2–4; sisihkan satu kartu untuk tiga pemain. Kartu tertinggi memenangkan setiap flip; jas tidak masalah. Ace tinggi, 2 rendah. Pada seri, setiap pemain dalam pertarungan meletakkan satu kartu ke bawah dan satu kartu ke atas. Kartu terbuka tertinggi mengambil semuanya. Jika Anda tidak dapat menyelesaikan perang, Anda kalah. Permainannya bisa memakan waktu lama dan sebagian besar adalah keberuntungan.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Peraturan Norwegia diperiksa 16 Oktober 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"Tumpahan kort Norwegia · Krig"},"it":{"War Card Game":"Gioco di carte di guerra","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"Gioco di carte Guerra online: gioca alla classica battaglia di carte","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"Gioca localmente al classico gioco di carte Guerra con da due a quattro giocatori. Gira le carte, risolvi i pareggi con carte a faccia in giù e a faccia in su e conserva tutte le carte su questo dispositivo.","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"Capovolgi la prima carta del mazzo di ogni giocatore. La carta più alta vince la battaglia; i ranghi uguali iniziano una guerra.","A quick example":"Un rapido esempio","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"A 10 batte uno 6 indipendentemente dal seme. Se le prime carte pareggiano, ogni giocatore in battaglia posiziona una carta a faccia in giù e una a faccia in su; la nuova carta più alta prende la pila.","How to play":"Come si gioca","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"Questa versione segue le regole norvegesi del Krig confrontate con Norske kortspill. Da due a quattro giocatori condividono un mazzo di carte standard 52 senza jolly. Le carte vengono distribuite coperte nel modo più uniforme possibile; con tre giocatori, una carta viene messa da parte senza essere vista. Tutti girano insieme la prima carta. Il punteggio più alto vince tutte le carte sul tavolo; i vestiti non contano. L'asso è il più alto e 2 è il più basso. Se le carte più alte pareggiano, ogni giocatore che si è unito a quella battaglia piazza una carta a faccia in giù e poi una a faccia in su. La nuova carta scoperta più alta prende l'intera pila. Un'ulteriore parità ripete lo stesso passaggio. Un giocatore che non può fornire entrambe le carte guerra perde; le carte rimanenti si uniscono al mazzo di battaglia. Vince l'ultimo giocatore con le carte. Il gioco è basato sulla fortuna, potrebbe richiedere molto tempo e questa versione non pretende di impedire ogni possibile sequenza ripetuta.","Frequently asked questions":"Domande frequenti","How many players can play?":"Quanti giocatori possono giocare?","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"Scegli due, tre o quattro giocatori. Tutti usano un mazzo di carte standard 52.","Which card is highest?":"Quale carta è la più alta?","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"L'asso è il più alto, seguito da re, regina, fante e 10 fino a 2. I semi non hanno rango.","What happens on a tie?":"Cosa succede in caso di pareggio?","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"Ogni giocatore in battaglia mette una carta coperta e una scoperta. La nuova carta scoperta più alta vince tutte le carte sul tavolo.","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"Cosa succede se non ho abbastanza carte per una guerra?","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"Un giocatore che non riesce a completare la coppia a faccia in giù e a faccia in su perde. Le carte rimanenti rimangono nella pila di battaglia.","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"Questo gioco richiede un account o carica le mie carte?","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"N. Il gioco e il salvataggio facoltativo rimangono in questo browser su questo dispositivo.","Rules and limitations":"Regole e limitazioni","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"La guerra è per lo più casuale e può durare a lungo; alcuni ordini di carte potrebbero ripetersi. Questa versione utilizza una carta coperta per giocatore durante una guerra, include tutti i giocatori della battaglia in parità e rimuove un giocatore che non può completare la coppia su e giù. I giocatori della CPU locale girano semplicemente le carte. Non sono presenti multiplayer online, account o dati di gioco caricati.","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Giocare gratuitamente. Le carte, lo stato della partita e il salvataggio opzionale rimangono su questo dispositivo; non viene caricato nulla.","Play War":"Gioca a Guerra","Related tools":"Strumenti correlati","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATUITO · FUNZIONA NEL TUO BROWSER","Language":"Lingua","UsefulVerse":"Versetto utile","All tools":"Tutti gli strumenti","Total players":"Giocatori totali","New game":"Nuovo gioco","Resume saved game":"Riprendi la partita salvata","Delete saved game":"Elimina la partita salvata","Export results":"Esporta risultati","Eliminated":"Eliminato","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Avvia un gioco o riprendi quello salvato su questo dispositivo.","Flip cards":"Carte ruotabili","Continue the war":"Continua la guerra","Auto-play":"Riproduzione automatica","Stop auto-play":"Interrompi la riproduzione automatica","Auto-play paused.":"Riproduzione automatica in pausa.","Auto-play speed":"Velocità di riproduzione automatica","Slow":"Lento","Normal":"Normale","Fast":"Veloce","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"Gioco automatico interrotto perché si ripeteva la disposizione esatta delle carte. Nessun vincitore è stato dichiarato; continuare manualmente o avviare nuovamente la riproduzione automatica.","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"Riproduzione automatica interrotta dopo le azioni 500 per mantenere questa pagina reattiva. Il gioco può continuare; riproduci manualmente o avvia nuovamente la riproduzione automatica.","Your pile":"La tua pila","Cards on the table":"Carte in tavola","Face down":"A faccia in giù","No cards have been flipped yet.":"Nessuna carta è stata ancora girata.","Player":"Giocatore","Computer {number}":"Computer {number}","You":"Voi","Cards":"Carte","Flips":"Si ribalta","Wars":"Guerre","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"Il gioco è iniziato. Gira la carta in cima alla pila di ogni giocatore.","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} ha vinto la battaglia e ha raccolto le carte {count}.","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"Guerra! Le carte più alte sono pari. Continua a rivelare una carta scoperta e una coperta per ogni giocatore in battaglia.","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} ha raccolto tutte le carte e ha vinto la partita!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"Nessun giocatore potrebbe completare la guerra. La partita è un pareggio.","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"Un giocatore senza due carte non può finire la guerra e perde.","Game saved on this device.":"Gioco salvato su questo dispositivo.","Saved game resumed.":"La partita salvata è ripresa.","Saved game deleted.":"Gioco salvato eliminato.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Il salvataggio locale non è disponibile; questo gioco rimarrà aperto finché non lascerai la pagina.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"La partita salvata non può essere letta. Inizia una nuova partita o elimina il salvataggio danneggiato.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Non sono presenti giochi salvati su questo dispositivo.","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"Un mazzo di carte 52, senza jolly. Distribuisci equamente tra i giocatori 2–4; metti da parte una carta per tre giocatori. La carta più alta vince ogni lancio; i vestiti non contano. Asso alto, 2 basso. In caso di pareggio, ogni giocatore in battaglia mette una carta sotto e una scoperta. La carta scoperta più alta prende tutto. Se non puoi completare una guerra, perdi. Il gioco può essere lungo ed è soprattutto fortuna.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Regole norvegesi controllate 16 Ottobre 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"Norske kortspill · Krig"},"ja":{"War Card Game":"戦争カード ゲーム","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"ウォー カード ゲーム オンライン — クラシック カード バトルをプレイする","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"古典的な戦争カード ゲームをローカルで 2 ～ 4 人のプレーヤーでプレイします。カードを裏返し、裏向きと表向きのカードの関係を解決し、すべてのカードをこのデバイスに保管します。","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"各プレイヤーの山から一番上のカードを裏返します。最も高いカードが戦いに勝ちます。同格の者同士が戦争を始める。","A quick example":"簡単な例","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"スーツに関係なく、10 は 6 に勝ちます。上位のカードが同点の場合、戦闘の各プレイヤーはカードを 1 枚を裏向きに置き、もう 1 枚を表向きに置きます。上位の新しいカードが山になります。","How to play":"遊び方","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"このバージョンは、Norske kortspill に対してチェックされたノルウェー クリグ ルールに従っています。 2 ～ 4 人のプレーヤーが、ジョーカーなしの 1 つの標準 52 カード デッキを共有します。カードは可能な限り均等に裏向きに配られます。プレイヤーが 3 人の場合、1 枚のカードが見えないように脇に置かれます。全員で一番上のカードをめくります。最も高いランクがテーブル上のすべてのカードを獲得します。スーツは関係ありません。 Ace が最高で、2 が最低です。最も高いカードが同点の場合、その戦闘に参加したすべてのプレイヤーは、カードを 1 枚裏向きに置き、次に 1 枚を表向きに置きます。新しい表向きの最も高いカードが山全体を占めます。さらに同点になると、同じステップが繰り返されます。両方の戦争カードを供給できないプレイヤーは負けます。残りのカードはバトルパイルに加わります。最後にカードを持っているプレイヤーが勝ちです。ゲームは運次第で時間がかかる場合があり、このバージョンでは考えられるすべての繰り返しシーケンスを防ぐとは主張していません。","Frequently asked questions":"よくある質問","How many players can play?":"何人のプレイヤーがプレイできますか?","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"2 人、3 人、または 4 人のプレイヤーを選択します。誰もが 1 つの標準 52 カード デッキを使用します。","Which card is highest?":"どのカードが最高ですか?","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"エースが最も高く、次にキング、クイーン、ジャック、そして 10 から 2 まで続きます。スーツにはランクがありません。","What happens on a tie?":"ネクタイでは何が起こるのでしょうか?","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"戦闘中の各プレイヤーは、カードを 1 枚裏向きに置き、もう 1 枚を表向きに置きます。上位の新しい表向きのカードがテーブル上のすべてのカードを獲得します。","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"戦争に必要なカードが足りない場合はどうすればよいですか?","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"裏向きと表向きのペアを完了できないプレイヤーは負けます。残りのカードはバトルパイルに残ります。","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"このゲームにはアカウントが必要ですか、それともカードをアップロードしますか?","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"いいえ。ゲームとオプションの保存は、このデバイス上のこのブラウザーに残ります。","Rules and limitations":"ルールと制限事項","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"戦争はほとんどが偶然であり、長期間続く可能性があります。一部のカード注文は繰り返される場合があります。このバージョンでは、戦争中にプレイヤーごとに 1 枚の裏向きのカードが使用され、同点の戦いのすべてのプレイヤーが含まれ、ダウンとアップのペアを完了できないプレイヤーは削除されます。ローカル CPU プレーヤーはカードを裏返すだけです。オンライン マルチプレイヤー、アカウント、アップロードされたゲーム データはありません。","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"無料でプレイできます。カード、試合状態、およびオプションの保存はこのデバイスに残ります。何もアップロードされていません。","Play War":"戦争をする","Related tools":"関連ツール","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"無料 · ブラウザで実行可能","Language":"言語","UsefulVerse":"便利な詩","All tools":"すべてのツール","Total players":"合計プレイヤー数","New game":"新しいゲーム","Resume saved game":"保存したゲームを再開","Delete saved game":"保存されたゲームを削除","Export results":"結果のエクスポート","Eliminated":"削除されました","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"ゲームを開始するか、このデバイスに保存されているゲームを再開します。","Flip cards":"カードをめくります","Continue the war":"戦争を続ける","Auto-play":"自動再生","Stop auto-play":"自動再生を停止します","Auto-play paused.":"自動再生が一時停止されました。","Auto-play speed":"自動再生速度","Slow":"遅い","Normal":"通常","Fast":"高速","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"この正確なカード配置が繰り返されたため、自動再生が停止しました。勝者は宣言されませんでした。手動で続行するか、自動再生を再度開始してください。","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"このページの応答性を維持するため、500 アクションの後に自動再生が停止しました。ゲームは続行される可能性があります。手動で再生するか、自動再生を再度開始してください。","Your pile":"あなたの山","Cards on the table":"テーブル上のカード","Face down":"顔を下に向けて","No cards have been flipped yet.":"まだ裏返されたカードはありません。","Player":"プレーヤー","Computer {number}":"コンピューター {number}","You":"あなた","Cards":"カード","Flips":"フリップ","Wars":"戦争","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"ゲームが始まりました。すべてのプレイヤーの山から一番上のカードを裏返します。","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} がバトルに勝利し、{count} カードを集めました。","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"戦争！最も高いカードは同点です。戦闘に参加しているすべてのプレイヤーに対して、1 枚ずつ下と 1 枚のカードを公開し続けます。","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} がすべてのカードを集めてゲームに勝ちました!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"どのプレイヤーも戦争を完了できませんでした。試合は引き分け。","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"カードを 2 枚持っていないプレイヤーは戦争を終えることができず、負けます。","Game saved on this device.":"ゲームはこのデバイスに保存されています。","Saved game resumed.":"保存したゲームが再開されました。","Saved game deleted.":"保存されたゲームが削除されました。","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"ローカル保存は使用できません。このゲームは、ページを離れるまで開いたままになります。","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"保存されたゲームを読み取れませんでした。新しいゲームを開始するか、破損したセーブデータを削除してください。","There is no saved game on this device.":"このデバイスには保存されたゲームがありません。","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"52 カード デッキ 1 枚、ジョーカーなし。 2 ～ 4 プレイヤー間で平等に対処します。 3 人のプレイヤーのためにカードを 1 枚取っておきます。各フリップで最も高いカードが勝ちとなります。スーツは関係ありません。エースは高い、2は低い。同点の場合、バトルに参加しているすべてのプレイヤーはカードを 1 枚下げ、1 枚を上げます。最も高い表向きのカードがすべてを受け取ります。戦争を完了できなければ負けです。試合は長引く可能性があり、ほとんどが運です。","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"ノルウェーのルールをチェック済み 16 10 月 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"ノルスケ コルツピル・クリグ"},"ko":{"War Card Game":"전쟁 카드 게임","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"온라인 전쟁 카드 게임 - 클래식 카드 배틀을 플레이하세요","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"2~4명의 플레이어와 함께 로컬에서 고전적인 전쟁 카드 게임을 플레이하세요. 카드를 뒤집고, 뒷면 및 앞면 카드로 동점을 해결하고, 모든 카드를 이 장치에 보관하세요.","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"각 플레이어의 더미에서 맨 위 카드를 뒤집습니다. 가장 높은 카드가 전투에서 승리합니다. 동등한 계급이 전쟁을 시작합니다.","A quick example":"빠른 예","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"A 10는 슈트에 관계없이 6를 능가합니다. 상위 카드가 동점인 경우 전투에 참여한 각 플레이어는 카드 한 장을 뒤집어 놓고 다른 한 장을 뒤집어 놓습니다. 더 높은 새 카드가 더미를 차지합니다.","How to play":"플레이 방법","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"이 버전은 Norske kortspill에 대해 검사된 노르웨이 Krig 규칙을 따릅니다. 2~4명의 플레이어가 조커 없이 하나의 표준 52 카드 덱을 공유합니다. 카드는 가능한 한 균등하게 뒷면이 아래로 향하도록 처리됩니다. 세 명의 플레이어가 있는 경우 카드 한 장을 보이지 않게 따로 보관합니다. 모두가 함께 위쪽 카드를 뒤집습니다. 가장 높은 순위는 테이블에 있는 모든 카드를 획득합니다. 정장은 중요하지 않습니다. Ace가 가장 높고 2가 가장 낮습니다. 가장 높은 카드가 동점인 경우 해당 전투에 참가한 모든 플레이어는 카드 한 장을 뒤집어 놓은 다음 한 장을 뒤집어 놓습니다. 가장 높은 새 앞면 카드가 전체 더미를 차지합니다. 추가 동점은 동일한 단계를 반복합니다. 두 전쟁 카드를 모두 제공할 수 없는 플레이어는 패배합니다. 남은 카드는 전투 더미에 합류합니다. 카드를 가진 마지막 플레이어가 승리합니다. 이 게임은 운에 따라 진행되며 시간이 오래 걸릴 수 있으며, 이 버전은 가능한 모든 반복 시퀀스를 방지한다고 주장하지 않습니다.","Frequently asked questions":"자주 묻는 질문","How many players can play?":"몇 명의 플레이어가 플레이할 수 있나요?","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"2명, 3명 또는 4명의 플레이어를 선택하세요. 모두가 하나의 표준 52 카드 데크를 사용합니다.","Which card is highest?":"어떤 카드가 가장 높습니까?","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"Ace가 가장 높으며 King, Queen, Jack 및 10가 2까지 이어집니다. 슈트에는 순위가 없습니다.","What happens on a tie?":"무승부는 어떻게 되나요?","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"전투에 참여한 각 플레이어는 카드 한 장을 뒤집어 놓고 다른 한 장을 뒤집어 놓습니다. 더 높은 새로운 앞면 카드가 테이블의 모든 카드를 획득합니다.","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"전쟁에 필요한 카드가 충분하지 않으면 어떻게 되나요?","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"페이스다운 및 페이스업 쌍을 완료할 수 없는 플레이어는 패배합니다. 남은 카드는 전투 더미에 남아 있습니다.","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"이 게임에는 계정이 필요합니까, 아니면 내 카드를 업로드해야 합니까?","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"아니요. 게임 및 선택적 저장은 이 장치의 이 브라우저에 유지됩니다.","Rules and limitations":"규칙 및 제한 사항","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"전쟁은 대부분 우연이며 오래 지속될 수 있습니다. 일부 카드 주문이 반복될 수 있습니다. 이 버전은 전쟁 중 플레이어당 하나의 뒷면 카드를 사용하고, 동점 전투의 모든 플레이어를 포함하며, 다운 앤 업 쌍을 완료할 수 없는 플레이어를 제거합니다. 로컬 CPU 플레이어는 단순히 카드를 뒤집습니다. 온라인 멀티플레이어, 계정, 업로드된 게임 데이터가 없습니다.","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"무료로 플레이할 수 있습니다. 카드, 일치 상태 및 선택적 저장은 이 장치에 유지됩니다. 아무것도 업로드되지 않았습니다.","Play War":"전쟁 플레이","Related tools":"관련 도구","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"무료 · 브라우저에서 실행","Language":"언어","UsefulVerse":"유용한 구절","All tools":"모든 도구","Total players":"총 플레이어 수","New game":"새 게임","Resume saved game":"저장된 게임 재개","Delete saved game":"저장된 게임 삭제","Export results":"결과 내보내기","Eliminated":"제거됨","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"게임을 시작하거나 이 장치에 저장된 게임을 재개하세요.","Flip cards":"플립 카드","Continue the war":"전쟁을 계속하라","Auto-play":"자동 재생","Stop auto-play":"자동 재생 중지","Auto-play paused.":"자동 재생이 일시중지되었습니다.","Auto-play speed":"자동 재생 속도","Slow":"느림","Normal":"일반","Fast":"빠름","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"이 정확한 카드 배열이 반복되었기 때문에 자동 재생이 중지되었습니다. 승자가 선언되지 않았습니다. 수동으로 계속하거나 자동 재생을 다시 시작하세요.","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"이 페이지의 응답성을 유지하기 위해 500 작업 후 자동 재생이 중지되었습니다. 게임은 계속될 수 있습니다. 수동으로 재생하거나 자동 재생을 다시 시작하세요.","Your pile":"당신의 더미","Cards on the table":"테이블 위의 카드","Face down":"아래로 향하게","No cards have been flipped yet.":"아직 뒤집힌 카드가 없습니다.","Player":"플레이어","Computer {number}":"컴퓨터 {number}","You":"너","Cards":"카드","Flips":"뒤집기","Wars":"전쟁","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"게임이 시작되었습니다. 모든 플레이어의 더미에서 맨 위 카드를 뒤집습니다.","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player}가 전투에서 승리하여 {count} 카드를 수집했습니다.","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"전쟁! 가장 높은 카드가 동점입니다. 전투에 참여하는 모든 플레이어에 대해 아래 카드 한 장과 위 카드 한 장을 계속해서 공개합니다.","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player}가 모든 카드를 모아 게임에서 승리했습니다!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"어떤 플레이어도 전쟁을 완료할 수 없습니다. 게임은 무승부입니다.","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"두 장의 카드가 없는 플레이어는 전쟁을 끝내지 못하고 패배합니다.","Game saved on this device.":"이 기기에 게임이 저장되었습니다.","Saved game resumed.":"저장된 게임이 재개되었습니다.","Saved game deleted.":"저장된 게임이 삭제되었습니다.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"로컬 저장을 사용할 수 없습니다. 이 게임은 귀하가 페이지를 떠날 때까지 계속 열려 있습니다.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"저장된 게임을 읽을 수 없습니다. 새 게임을 시작하거나 손상된 저장 파일을 삭제하세요.","There is no saved game on this device.":"이 장치에는 저장된 게임이 없습니다.","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"52 카드 덱 1개, 조커 없음. 2–4 플레이어 간에 균등하게 거래하십시오. 3명의 플레이어를 위해 카드 한 장을 따로 보관해 두세요. 각 뒤집기에서 가장 높은 카드가 승리합니다. 정장은 중요하지 않습니다. 에이스 하이, 2 로우. 동점인 경우, 전투에 참가한 모든 플레이어는 카드 한 장을 내려놓고 한 장씩 올려 놓습니다. 가장 높은 앞면 카드가 모든 것을 차지합니다. 전쟁을 완료할 수 없으면 패배합니다. 게임은 길 수 있으며 대부분 운이 따릅니다.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"노르웨이 규칙 확인됨 16 10월 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"노르스케 코르츠필 · Krig"},"mr":{"War Card Game":"वॉर कार्ड गेम","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"वॉर कार्ड गेम ऑनलाइन — क्लासिक कार्ड बॅटल खेळा","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"दोन ते चार खेळाडूंसह स्थानिक पातळीवर क्लासिक वॉर कार्ड गेम खेळा. कार्ड फ्लिप करा, फेस-डाउन आणि फेस-अप कार्डसह संबंध सोडवा आणि प्रत्येक कार्ड या डिव्हाइसवर ठेवा.","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"प्रत्येक खेळाडूच्या ढिगाऱ्यातून वरचे कार्ड फ्लिप करा. सर्वोच्च कार्ड लढाई जिंकते; समान रँक एक युद्ध सुरू.","A quick example":"एक द्रुत उदाहरण","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"A 10 एक 6 ला हरवते. जर शीर्ष कार्डे बांधली गेली, तर युद्धातील प्रत्येक खेळाडू एक कार्ड समोरासमोर आणि एक चेहरा वर ठेवतो; उच्च नवीन कार्ड ढीग घेते.","How to play":"कसे खेळायचे","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"ही आवृत्ती Norske kortspill विरुद्ध तपासलेल्या नॉर्वेजियन क्रिग नियमांचे पालन करते. दोन ते चार खेळाडू जोकरशिवाय एक मानक 52-कार्ड डेक शेअर करतात. कार्ड शक्य तितक्या समान रीतीने समोरासमोर हाताळले जातात; तीन खेळाडूंसह, एक कार्ड न पाहिलेले बाजूला ठेवले आहे. प्रत्येकजण शीर्ष कार्ड एकत्र फ्लिप करतो. सर्वोच्च रँक टेबलवरील सर्व कार्डे जिंकतो; सूट काही फरक पडत नाही. Ace सर्वोच्च आहे आणि 2 सर्वात कमी आहे. जर सर्वात जास्त कार्डे टाय झाली, तर त्या लढाईत सामील झालेला प्रत्येक खेळाडू एक कार्ड समोरासमोर ठेवतो आणि नंतर एक चेहरा वर करतो. सर्वोच्च नवीन फेस-अप कार्ड संपूर्ण ढीग घेते. आणखी एक टाय त्याच चरणाची पुनरावृत्ती करतो. जो खेळाडू दोन्ही युद्ध कार्ड देऊ शकत नाही तो हरतो; त्यांची उरलेली कार्डे लढाईत सामील होतात. कार्ड असलेला शेवटचा खेळाडू जिंकतो. खेळ नशीब-चालित आहे, बराच वेळ लागू शकतो, आणि ही आवृत्ती प्रत्येक संभाव्य पुनरावृत्ती क्रम रोखण्याचा दावा करत नाही.","Frequently asked questions":"वारंवार विचारले जाणारे प्रश्न","How many players can play?":"किती खेळाडू खेळू शकतात?","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"दोन, तीन किंवा चार खेळाडू निवडा. प्रत्येकजण एक मानक 52-कार्ड डेक वापरतो.","Which card is highest?":"कोणते कार्ड सर्वात जास्त आहे?","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"Ace सर्वोच्च आहे, त्यानंतर राजा, राणी, जॅक आणि 10 खाली 2 आहे. सूटला रँक नाही.","What happens on a tie?":"टायवर काय होते?","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"युद्धातील प्रत्येक खेळाडू एक कार्ड समोरासमोर ठेवतो आणि एक चेहरा वर करतो. उच्च नवीन फेस-अप कार्ड टेबलवरील सर्व कार्ड जिंकते.","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"माझ्याकडे युद्धासाठी पुरेशी कार्डे नसल्यास काय?","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"फेस-डाउन आणि फेस-अप जोडी पूर्ण करू न शकणारा खेळाडू हरतो. त्यांची उरलेली पत्ते लढाईच्या ढिगाऱ्यातच राहतात.","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"या गेमसाठी खाते आवश्यक आहे की माझी कार्डे अपलोड करा?","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"नं. गेम आणि पर्यायी सेव्ह या डिव्हाइसवर या ब्राउझरमध्ये राहतील.","Rules and limitations":"नियम आणि मर्यादा","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"युद्ध हे बहुधा संधी असते आणि दीर्घकाळ टिकते; काही कार्ड ऑर्डरची पुनरावृत्ती होऊ शकते. ही आवृत्ती युद्धादरम्यान प्रति खेळाडू एक फेस-डाउन कार्ड वापरते, बद्ध लढाईतील प्रत्येक खेळाडूचा समावेश करते आणि डाउन-अप जोडी पूर्ण करू शकत नसलेल्या खेळाडूला काढून टाकते. स्थानिक CPU प्लेयर्स फक्त कार्ड फ्लिप करतात. ऑनलाइन मल्टीप्लेअर, खाते किंवा अपलोड केलेला गेम डेटा नाही.","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"खेळण्यासाठी विनामूल्य. कार्ड, जुळणी स्थिती आणि पर्यायी सेव्ह या डिव्हाइसवर रहा; काहीही अपलोड केलेले नाही.","Play War":"प्ले वॉर","Related tools":"संबंधित साधने","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"विनामूल्य · तुमच्या ब्राउझरमध्ये चालते","Language":"भाषा","UsefulVerse":"उपयोगी वचन","All tools":"सर्व साधने","Total players":"एकूण खेळाडू","New game":"नवीन गेम","Resume saved game":"सेव्ह केलेला गेम पुन्हा सुरू करा","Delete saved game":"सेव्ह केलेला गेम हटवा","Export results":"निर्यात परिणाम","Eliminated":"काढले","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"एक गेम सुरू करा किंवा या डिव्हाइसवर सेव्ह केलेला गेम पुन्हा सुरू करा.","Flip cards":"फ्लिप कार्ड","Continue the war":"युद्ध सुरू ठेवा","Auto-play":"ऑटो-प्ले","Stop auto-play":"ऑटो-प्ले थांबवा","Auto-play paused.":"ऑटो-प्ले थांबवले.","Auto-play speed":"ऑटो-प्ले गती","Slow":"स्लो","Normal":"सामान्य","Fast":"वेगवान","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"ऑटो-प्ले थांबले कारण ही अचूक कार्ड व्यवस्था पुनरावृत्ती झाली. एकही विजेता घोषित झाला नाही; व्यक्तिचलितपणे सुरू ठेवा किंवा पुन्हा ऑटो-प्ले सुरू करा.","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"हे पृष्ठ प्रतिसादात्मक ठेवण्यासाठी 500 क्रियांनंतर ऑटो-प्ले थांबले. खेळ चालू राहू शकतो; मॅन्युअली प्ले करा किंवा पुन्हा ऑटो-प्ले सुरू करा.","Your pile":"तुमचा ढीग","Cards on the table":"टेबलावरील कार्ड","Face down":"तोंड खाली","No cards have been flipped yet.":"अद्याप कोणतेही कार्ड फ्लिप केलेले नाहीत.","Player":"खेळाडू","Computer {number}":"संगणक {number}","You":"आपण","Cards":"कार्ड्स","Flips":"फ्लिप","Wars":"युद्धे","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"खेळ सुरू झाला. प्रत्येक खेळाडूच्या ढीगातून शीर्ष कार्ड फ्लिप करा.","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} ने लढाई जिंकली आणि {count} कार्डे गोळा केली.","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"युद्ध! सर्वोच्च कार्डे बांधली जातात. युद्धातील प्रत्येक खेळाडूसाठी एक कार्ड खाली आणि एक वर उघड करणे सुरू ठेवा.","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} ने सर्व कार्ड गोळा केले आणि गेम जिंकला!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"कोणत्याही खेळाडूला युद्ध पूर्ण करता आले नाही. खेळ अनिर्णित आहे.","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"दोन पत्ते नसलेला खेळाडू युद्ध संपवू शकला नाही आणि हरला.","Game saved on this device.":"गेम या डिव्हाइसवर सेव्ह केला आहे.","Saved game resumed.":"सेव्ह केलेला गेम पुन्हा सुरू झाला.","Saved game deleted.":"सेव्ह केलेला गेम हटवला.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"स्थानिक बचत अनुपलब्ध आहे; तुम्ही पेज सोडेपर्यंत हा गेम खुला राहील.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"सेव्ह केलेला गेम वाचता आला नाही. नवीन गेम सुरू करा किंवा खराब झालेले सेव्ह हटवा.","There is no saved game on this device.":"या डिव्हाइसवर कोणताही सेव्ह केलेला गेम नाही.","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"एक 52-कार्ड डेक, जोकर नाहीत. 2–4 खेळाडूंमध्ये समान रीतीने व्यवहार करा; तीन खेळाडूंसाठी एक कार्ड बाजूला ठेवा. सर्वोच्च कार्ड प्रत्येक फ्लिप जिंकतो; सूट काही फरक पडत नाही. निपुण उच्च, 2 कमी. टाय झाल्यावर, लढाईतील प्रत्येक खेळाडू एक कार्ड खाली आणि एक वर ठेवतो. सर्वोच्च फेस-अप कार्ड सर्व घेते. जर तुम्ही युद्ध पूर्ण करू शकत नसाल तर तुम्ही हराल. खेळ लांब असू शकतो आणि मुख्यतः नशीब आहे.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"नॉर्वेजियन नियम 16 ऑक्टोबर 2026 तपासले","Norske kortspill · Krig":"Norske kortspill · Krig"},"ms":{"War Card Game":"Permainan Kad Perang","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"Permainan Kad Perang Dalam Talian — Main Pertempuran Kad Klasik","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"Main permainan kad Perang klasik secara tempatan dengan dua hingga empat pemain. Selak kad, selesaikan hubungan dengan kad menghadap ke bawah dan ke atas, dan simpan setiap kad pada peranti ini.","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"Terbalikkan kad teratas daripada longgokan setiap pemain. Kad tertinggi memenangi pertempuran; pangkat yang sama memulakan peperangan.","A quick example":"Contoh pantas","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"A 10 mengalahkan 6 tanpa mengira sut. Jika kad teratas seri, setiap pemain dalam pertempuran meletakkan satu kad menghadap ke bawah dan satu menghadap ke atas; kad baharu yang lebih tinggi mengambil longgokan.","How to play":"Cara bermain","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"Versi ini mengikut peraturan Krig Norway yang disemak terhadap Norske kortspill. Dua hingga empat pemain berkongsi satu dek kad 52 standard tanpa pelawak. Kad diuruskan menghadap ke bawah serata mungkin; dengan tiga pemain, satu kad diketepikan tanpa kelihatan. Semua orang membelek kad teratas bersama-sama. Kedudukan tertinggi memenangi semua kad di atas meja; saman tidak penting. Ace adalah tertinggi dan 2 adalah terendah. Jika kad tertinggi seri, setiap pemain yang menyertai pertempuran itu meletakkan satu kad menghadap ke bawah dan kemudian satu menghadap ke atas. Kad muka baharu yang tertinggi mengambil keseluruhan longgokan. Seri seterusnya mengulangi langkah yang sama. Pemain yang tidak dapat membekalkan kedua-dua kad perang kalah; baki kad mereka menyertai longgokan pertempuran. Pemain terakhir dengan kad menang. Permainan ini didorong oleh nasib, mungkin mengambil masa yang lama, dan versi ini tidak mendakwa untuk menghalang setiap kemungkinan urutan berulang.","Frequently asked questions":"Soalan lazim","How many players can play?":"Berapa ramai pemain boleh bermain?","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"Pilih dua, tiga atau empat pemain. Semua orang menggunakan satu dek kad 52 standard.","Which card is highest?":"Kad yang manakah paling tinggi?","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"Ace adalah tertinggi, diikuti oleh raja, ratu, bicu dan 10 turun kepada 2. Sut tiada pangkat.","What happens on a tie?":"Apakah yang berlaku pada seri?","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"Setiap pemain dalam pertempuran meletakkan satu kad menghadap ke bawah dan satu menghadap ke atas. Kad muka baharu yang lebih tinggi memenangi semua kad di atas meja.","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"Bagaimana jika saya tidak mempunyai kad yang mencukupi untuk berperang?","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"Seorang pemain yang tidak dapat melengkapkan pasangan menghadap ke bawah dan menghadap ke atas kalah. Baki kad mereka kekal dalam timbunan pertempuran.","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"Adakah permainan ini memerlukan akaun atau memuat naik kad saya?","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"No. Permainan dan simpanan pilihan kekal dalam penyemak imbas ini pada peranti ini.","Rules and limitations":"Peraturan dan had","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"Perang kebanyakannya kebetulan dan boleh bertahan lama; beberapa pesanan kad mungkin berulang. Versi ini menggunakan satu kad menghadap ke bawah bagi setiap pemain semasa perang, termasuk setiap pemain daripada pertempuran seri dan mengalih keluar pemain yang tidak dapat melengkapkan pasangan bawah dan atas. Pemain CPU tempatan hanya flip kad. Tiada berbilang pemain dalam talian, akaun atau data permainan yang dimuat naik.","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Percuma untuk dimainkan. Kad, keadaan padanan dan simpanan pilihan kekal pada peranti ini; tiada apa yang dimuat naik.","Play War":"Play War","Related tools":"Alat berkaitan","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"PERCUMA · DIJALANKAN DALAM PENYIARI SEMAK ANDA","Language":"Bahasa","UsefulVerse":"Ayat Berguna","All tools":"Semua alatan","Total players":"Jumlah pemain","New game":"Permainan baharu","Resume saved game":"Sambung semula permainan yang disimpan","Delete saved game":"Padamkan permainan yang disimpan","Export results":"Eksport hasil","Eliminated":"Dihapuskan","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Mulakan permainan atau sambung semula permainan yang disimpan pada peranti ini.","Flip cards":"Kad selak","Continue the war":"Teruskan perang","Auto-play":"Automain","Stop auto-play":"Hentikan automain","Auto-play paused.":"Automain dijeda.","Auto-play speed":"Automain kelajuan","Slow":"Lambat","Normal":"Biasa","Fast":"Pantas","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"Automain berhenti kerana susunan kad yang tepat ini berulang. Tiada pemenang diumumkan; teruskan secara manual atau mulakan automain semula.","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"Automain berhenti selepas tindakan 500 untuk memastikan halaman ini responsif. Permainan boleh diteruskan; main secara manual atau mulakan auto main semula.","Your pile":"Timbunan anda","Cards on the table":"Kad di atas meja","Face down":"Menghadap ke bawah","No cards have been flipped yet.":"Belum ada kad yang diselak.","Player":"Pemain","Computer {number}":"Komputer {number}","You":"awak","Cards":"Kad","Flips":"Terbalik","Wars":"Peperangan","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"Permainan dimulakan. Balikkan kad teratas dari setiap longgokan pemain.","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} memenangi pertempuran dan mengumpul kad {count}.","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"Perang! Kad tertinggi terikat. Teruskan mendedahkan satu kad ke bawah dan satu ke atas untuk setiap pemain dalam pertempuran.","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} mengumpul semua kad dan memenangi permainan!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"Tiada pemain yang dapat menyelesaikan perang. Permainan ini adalah seri.","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"Pemain tanpa dua kad tidak dapat menamatkan peperangan dan kalah.","Game saved on this device.":"Permainan disimpan pada peranti ini.","Saved game resumed.":"Permainan yang disimpan disambung semula.","Saved game deleted.":"Permainan yang disimpan dipadamkan.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Penjimatan setempat tidak tersedia; permainan ini akan kekal terbuka sehingga anda meninggalkan halaman.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Permainan yang disimpan tidak dapat dibaca. Mulakan permainan baharu atau padamkan simpanan yang rosak.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Tiada permainan yang disimpan pada peranti ini.","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"Satu dek kad 52, tiada pelawak. Berurusan secara sama rata antara pemain 2–4; ketepikan satu kad untuk tiga pemain. Kad tertinggi memenangi setiap flip; saman tidak penting. Ace tinggi, 2 rendah. Apabila seri, setiap pemain dalam pertempuran meletakkan satu kad ke bawah dan satu ke atas. Kad muka tertinggi mengambil semua. Jika anda tidak dapat menyelesaikan peperangan, anda kalah. Permainan ini boleh menjadi panjang dan kebanyakannya adalah nasib.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Peraturan Norway disemak 16 Oktober 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"Norske kortspill · Krig"},"nb":{"War Card Game":"Krigskortspill","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"Krigskortspill online — Spill den klassiske kortkampen","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"Spill det klassiske krigskortspillet lokalt med to til fire spillere. Vend kort, løs bånd med forsiden ned og forsiden opp kort, og behold hvert kort på denne enheten.","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"Vend det øverste kortet fra hver spillers bunke. Det høyeste kortet vinner kampen; like rekker starter en krig.","A quick example":"Et raskt eksempel","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"A 10 slår en 6 uansett farge. Hvis de øverste kortene er uavgjort, legger hver spiller i kampen ett kort med forsiden ned og ett med forsiden opp; det høyere nye kortet tar bunken.","How to play":"Slik spiller du","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"Denne versjonen følger de norske Krig-reglene sjekket mot Norske kortspill. To til fire spillere deler en standard 52-kortstokk uten jokere. Kortene deles ut med forsiden ned så jevnt som mulig; med tre spillere settes ett kort til side usett. Alle snur det øverste kortet sammen. Den høyeste rangeringen vinner alle kortene på bordet; dresser spiller ingen rolle. Ess er høyest og 2 er lavest. Hvis de høyeste kortene er uavgjort, legger hver spiller som ble med i kampen ett kort med forsiden ned og deretter ett med forsiden opp. Det høyeste nye kortet med forsiden opp tar hele bunken. Et nytt slips gjentar det samme trinnet. En spiller som ikke kan levere begge krigskortene taper; deres gjenværende kort blir med i kampbunken. Den siste spilleren med kort vinner. Spillet er flaksdrevet, kan ta lang tid, og denne versjonen hevder ikke å forhindre enhver mulig gjentakende sekvens.","Frequently asked questions":"Ofte stilte spørsmål","How many players can play?":"Hvor mange spillere kan spille?","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"Velg to, tre eller fire spillere. Alle bruker en standard 52-kortstokk.","Which card is highest?":"Hvilket kort er høyest?","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"Ess er høyest, etterfulgt av konge, dame, knekt og 10 ned til 2. Drakter har ingen rangering.","What happens on a tie?":"Hva skjer på et slips?","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"Hver spiller i kampen legger ett kort med forsiden ned og ett med forsiden opp. Det høyere nye kortet med forsiden opp vinner alle kortene på bordet.","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"Hva om jeg ikke har nok kort for en krig?","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"En spiller som ikke kan fullføre paret med forsiden ned og opp med forsiden taper. De gjenværende kortene deres forblir i kamphaugen.","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"Krever dette spillet en konto eller laste opp kortene mine?","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"Nr. Spillet og valgfri lagring forblir i denne nettleseren på denne enheten.","Rules and limitations":"Regler og begrensninger","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"Krig er mest tilfeldigheter og kan vare lenge; noen kortbestillinger kan gjenta seg. Denne versjonen bruker ett kort med forsiden ned per spiller under en krig, inkluderer hver spiller fra uavgjort kamp, ​​og fjerner en spiller som ikke kan fullføre ned-og-opp-paret. Lokale CPU-spillere snur ganske enkelt kort. Det er ingen online multiplayer-, konto- eller opplastede spilldata.","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Gratis å spille. Kort, kampstatus og valgfri lagring forblir på denne enheten; ingenting er lastet opp.","Play War":"Spill krig","Related tools":"Relaterte verktøy","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATIS · KJØRER I NETTLESEREN DIN","Language":"Språk","UsefulVerse":"NyttigVerse","All tools":"Alle verktøy","Total players":"Totalt spillere","New game":"Nytt spill","Resume saved game":"Fortsett lagret spill","Delete saved game":"Slett lagret spill","Export results":"Eksporter resultater","Eliminated":"Eliminert","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Start et spill eller gjenoppta det som er lagret på denne enheten.","Flip cards":"Vend kort","Continue the war":"Fortsett krigen","Auto-play":"Autoavspilling","Stop auto-play":"Stopp autoavspilling","Auto-play paused.":"Autoavspilling satt på pause.","Auto-play speed":"Autoavspillingshastighet","Slow":"Langsomt","Normal":"Normal","Fast":"Rask","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"Auto-spillet stoppet fordi denne nøyaktige kortordningen gjentok seg. Ingen vinner ble erklært; fortsett manuelt eller start automatisk avspilling igjen.","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"Autoavspilling stoppet etter 500-handlinger for å holde denne siden responsiv. Spillet kan fortsette; spill manuelt eller start automatisk avspilling igjen.","Your pile":"Din haug","Cards on the table":"Kort på bordet","Face down":"Forsiden ned","No cards have been flipped yet.":"Ingen kort har blitt snudd ennå.","Player":"Spiller","Computer {number}":"Datamaskin {number}","You":"Du","Cards":"Kort","Flips":"Vipper","Wars":"Kriger","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"Spillet startet. Vend det øverste kortet fra hver spillers bunke.","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} vant kampen og samlet {count}-kort.","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"Krig! De høyeste kortene er uavgjort. Fortsett å avsløre ett kort ned og ett opp for hver spiller i kampen.","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} samlet alle kortene og vant spillet!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"Ingen spillere kunne fullføre krigen. Spillet er uavgjort.","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"En spiller uten to kort kunne ikke fullføre krigen og taper.","Game saved on this device.":"Spillet er lagret på denne enheten.","Saved game resumed.":"Lagret spill ble gjenopptatt.","Saved game deleted.":"Lagret spill slettet.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Lokal lagring er utilgjengelig; dette spillet vil forbli åpent til du forlater siden.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Lagret spill kunne ikke leses. Start et nytt spill eller slett den skadede lagringen.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Det er ikke noe lagret spill på denne enheten.","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"En 52-kortstokk, ingen jokere. Deal jevnt mellom 2–4 spillere; sett ett kort til side for tre spillere. Høyeste kort vinner hver flip; dresser spiller ingen rolle. Ess høy, 2 lav. På uavgjort legger hver spiller i kampen ett kort ned og ett opp. Det høyeste kortet med forsiden opp tar alt. Hvis du ikke kan fullføre en krig, taper du. Spillet kan være langt og er stort sett flaks.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Norske regler sjekket 16 oktober 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"Norske kortspill · Krig"},"nl":{"War Card Game":"Oorlogskaartspel","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"War Card Game Online — Speel het klassieke kaartgevecht","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"Speel het klassieke War-kaartspel lokaal met twee tot vier spelers. Draai kaarten om, los verbanden op met kaarten met de afbeelding naar beneden en met de afbeelding naar boven, en bewaar elke kaart op dit apparaat.","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"Draai de bovenste kaart van de stapel van elke speler om. De hoogste kaart wint het gevecht; gelijke rangen beginnen een oorlog.","A quick example":"Een snel voorbeeld","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"Een 10 verslaat een 6, ongeacht de kleur. Als de bovenste kaarten gelijk zijn, legt elke speler in het gevecht één kaart met de beeldzijde naar beneden en één met de beeldzijde naar boven; hoe hoger de nieuwe kaart op de stapel komt.","How to play":"Hoe te spelen","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"Deze versie volgt de Noorse Krig-regels, vergeleken met Norske Kortspill. Twee tot vier spelers delen één standaard 52-kaartspel zonder jokers. Kaarten worden zo gelijkmatig mogelijk met de beeldzijde naar beneden uitgedeeld; bij drie spelers wordt één kaart ongezien opzij gelegd. Iedereen draait de bovenste kaart om. De hoogste rang wint alle kaarten op tafel; pakken doen er niet toe. Aas is het hoogst en 2 is het laagst. Als de hoogste kaarten gelijk zijn, legt elke speler die aan het gevecht heeft deelgenomen één kaart met de beeldzijde naar beneden en vervolgens één met de beeldzijde naar boven. De hoogste nieuwe open kaart neemt de hele stapel. Een volgende gelijkspel herhaalt dezelfde stap. Een speler die niet beide oorlogskaarten kan leveren, verliest; hun resterende kaarten worden toegevoegd aan de gevechtsstapel. De laatste speler met kaarten wint. Het spel is gebaseerd op geluk, kan lang duren en deze versie beweert niet elke mogelijke herhalende reeks te voorkomen.","Frequently asked questions":"Veelgestelde vragen","How many players can play?":"Hoeveel spelers kunnen spelen?","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"Kies twee, drie of vier spelers. Iedereen gebruikt één standaard 52-kaartspel.","Which card is highest?":"Welke kaart is het hoogst?","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"Aas is het hoogst, gevolgd door heer, vrouw, boer en 10 tot aan 2. Pakken hebben geen rang.","What happens on a tie?":"Wat gebeurt er bij een gelijkspel?","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"Elke speler in het gevecht legt één kaart met de beeldzijde naar beneden en één kaart met de beeldzijde naar boven neer. De hogere nieuwe open kaart wint alle kaarten op tafel.","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"Wat moet ik doen als ik niet genoeg kaarten heb voor een oorlog?","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"Een speler die het gesloten en openliggende paar niet kan voltooien, verliest. Hun resterende kaarten blijven op de gevechtsstapel.","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"Heeft dit spel een account nodig of moet ik mijn kaarten uploaden?","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"Nr. Het spel en de optionele opslag blijven in deze browser op dit apparaat.","Rules and limitations":"Regels en beperkingen","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"Oorlog is meestal toeval en kan lang duren; sommige kaartbestellingen kunnen zich herhalen. Deze versie gebruikt één gesloten kaart per speler tijdens een oorlog, omvat elke speler uit het gelijkspel en verwijdert een speler die het neer-en-op-paar niet kan voltooien. Lokale CPU-spelers draaien eenvoudigweg kaarten om. Er zijn geen online multiplayer-, account- of geüploade gamegegevens.","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Gratis te spelen. Kaarten, matchstatus en optioneel opgeslagen verblijf op dit apparaat; er wordt niets geüpload.","Play War":"Speel Oorlog","Related tools":"Gerelateerde hulpmiddelen","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATIS · DRAAIT IN UW BROWSER","Language":"Taal","UsefulVerse":"Handig vers","All tools":"Alle gereedschappen","Total players":"Totaal aantal spelers","New game":"Nieuw spel","Resume saved game":"Opgeslagen spel hervatten","Delete saved game":"Opgeslagen spel verwijderen","Export results":"Resultaten exporteren","Eliminated":"Uitgeschakeld","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Start een spel of hervat het spel dat op dit apparaat is opgeslagen.","Flip cards":"Flipkaarten","Continue the war":"Ga door met de oorlog","Auto-play":"Automatisch afspelen","Stop auto-play":"Automatisch afspelen stoppen","Auto-play paused.":"Automatisch afspelen gepauzeerd.","Auto-play speed":"Automatische afspeelsnelheid","Slow":"Langzaam","Normal":"Normaal","Fast":"Snel","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"Het automatisch afspelen is gestopt omdat deze exacte kaartindeling zich herhaalde. Er werd geen winnaar uitgeroepen; ga handmatig verder of start het automatisch afspelen opnieuw.","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"Automatisch afspelen gestopt na 500-acties om deze pagina responsief te houden. Het spel kan doorgaan; speel handmatig af of start het automatisch afspelen opnieuw.","Your pile":"Jouw stapel","Cards on the table":"Kaarten op tafel","Face down":"Gezicht naar beneden","No cards have been flipped yet.":"Er zijn nog geen kaarten omgedraaid.","Player":"Speler","Computer {number}":"Computer {number}","You":"Jij","Cards":"Kaarten","Flips":"Flips","Wars":"Oorlogen","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"Spel begonnen. Draai de bovenste kaart van de stapel van elke speler om.","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} won de strijd en verzamelde {count}-kaarten.","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"Oorlog! De hoogste kaarten zijn gelijk. Ga door met het onthullen van één kaart naar beneden en één naar boven voor elke speler in het gevecht.","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} verzamelde alle kaarten en won het spel!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"Geen enkele speler kon de oorlog voltooien. Het spel is een gelijkspel.","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"Een speler zonder twee kaarten kan de oorlog niet beëindigen en verliest.","Game saved on this device.":"Game opgeslagen op dit apparaat.","Saved game resumed.":"Het opgeslagen spel is hervat.","Saved game deleted.":"Opgeslagen spel verwijderd.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Lokale besparing is niet beschikbaar; dit spel blijft open totdat je de pagina verlaat.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Opgeslagen spel kon niet worden gelezen. Start een nieuw spel of verwijder de beschadigde save.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Er is geen opgeslagen spel op dit apparaat.","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"Eén 52-kaartspel, geen jokers. Verdeel gelijkmatig onder de spelers 2–4; leg één kaart opzij voor drie spelers. De hoogste kaart wint elke beurt; pakken doen er niet toe. Aas hoog, 2 laag. Bij een gelijkspel legt elke speler in het gevecht één kaart neer en één kaart omhoog. De hoogste open kaart neemt alles. Als je een oorlog niet kunt voltooien, verlies je. Het spel kan lang duren en bestaat vooral uit geluk.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Noorse regels gecontroleerd 16 oktober 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"Norske kortspill · Krig"},"pl":{"War Card Game":"Gra karciana wojenna","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"War Card Game Online — Zagraj w klasyczną bitwę karcianą","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"Zagraj lokalnie w klasyczną grę karcianą Wojna z dwoma do czterech graczy. Odwracaj karty, rozstrzygaj remisy z kartami zakrytymi i odkrytymi i zatrzymaj każdą kartę na tym urządzeniu.","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"Odwróć wierzchnią kartę ze stosu każdego gracza. Najwyższa karta wygrywa bitwę; równe szeregi rozpoczynają wojnę.","A quick example":"Krótki przykład","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"A 10 pokonuje 6 niezależnie od koloru. Jeśli na wierzchu kart jest remis, każdy gracz biorący udział w bitwie kładzie jedną kartę zakrytą i jedną odkrytą; wyższa nowa karta bierze stos.","How to play":"Jak grać","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"Ta wersja jest zgodna z norweskimi przepisami Krig, sprawdzonymi przeciwko Norske kortspill. Od dwóch do czterech graczy korzysta z jednej standardowej talii kart 52 bez jokerów. Karty są rozdawane zakryte tak równomiernie, jak to możliwe; w przypadku trzech graczy jedna karta jest odkładana na bok, niezauważona. Wszyscy wspólnie odwracają wierzchnią kartę. Najwyższa ranga wygrywa wszystkie karty na stole; garnitury nie mają znaczenia. As jest najwyższy, a 2 najniższy. Jeśli najwyższe karty remisują, każdy gracz, który dołączył do tej bitwy, kładzie jedną kartę zakrytą, a następnie drugą odkrytą. Najwyższa nowa odkryta karta zajmuje cały stos. Kolejny remis powtarza ten sam krok. Gracz, który nie może zaopatrzyć obu kart wojny, przegrywa; pozostałe karty dołączają do stosu bitwy. Ostatni gracz z kartami wygrywa. Gra opiera się na szczęściu, może zająć dużo czasu, a ta wersja nie ma na celu zapobiegania każdej możliwej powtarzającej się sekwencji.","Frequently asked questions":"Często zadawane pytania","How many players can play?":"Ilu graczy może grać?","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"Wybierz dwóch, trzech lub czterech graczy. Każdy używa jednej standardowej talii kart 52.","Which card is highest?":"Która karta jest najwyższa?","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"As jest najwyższy, po nim następują król, dama, walet i 10 aż do 2. Garnitury nie mają rangi.","What happens on a tie?":"Co dzieje się z krawatem?","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"Każdy gracz biorący udział w bitwie kładzie jedną kartę zakrytą i jedną odkrytą. Wyższa nowa odkryta karta wygrywa wszystkie karty na stole.","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"Co się stanie, jeśli nie będę miał wystarczającej liczby kart na wojnę?","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"Gracz, który nie może ułożyć pary zakrytej i odkrytej, przegrywa. Pozostałe karty pozostają na stosie bitwy.","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"Czy ta gra wymaga konta lub przesyłania moich kart?","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"Nie. Gra i opcjonalny zapis pozostają w tej przeglądarce na tym urządzeniu.","Rules and limitations":"Zasady i ograniczenia","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"Wojna to głównie przypadek i może trwać długo; niektóre zamówienia kart mogą się powtarzać. Ta wersja używa jednej zakrytej karty na gracza podczas wojny, obejmuje każdego gracza z remisowej bitwy i usuwa gracza, który nie może ukończyć pary góra-dół. Lokalni gracze korzystający z procesora po prostu odwracają karty. Nie ma trybu wieloosobowego online, konta ani przesłanych danych gier.","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Za darmo. Karty, stan meczu i opcjonalny zapis pozostają na tym urządzeniu; nic nie jest przesyłane.","Play War":"Zagraj w Wojnę","Related tools":"Powiązane narzędzia","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"BEZPŁATNY · DZIAŁA W TWOJEJ PRZEGLĄDARCE","Language":"Język","UsefulVerse":"Przydatny werset","All tools":"Wszystkie narzędzia","Total players":"Wszystkie graczy","New game":"Nowa gra","Resume saved game":"Wznów zapisaną grę","Delete saved game":"Usuń zapisaną grę","Export results":"Eksportuj wyniki","Eliminated":"Wyeliminowany","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Rozpocznij grę lub wznów grę zapisaną na tym urządzeniu.","Flip cards":"Odwróć karty","Continue the war":"Kontynuuj wojnę","Auto-play":"Autoodtwarzanie","Stop auto-play":"Zatrzymaj automatyczne odtwarzanie","Auto-play paused.":"Autoodtwarzanie wstrzymane.","Auto-play speed":"Prędkość automatycznego odtwarzania","Slow":"Powoli","Normal":"Normalny","Fast":"Szybki","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"Automatyczna gra została zatrzymana, ponieważ powtórzył się dokładnie taki układ kart. Nie ogłoszono żadnego zwycięzcy; kontynuuj ręcznie lub ponownie rozpocznij automatyczne odtwarzanie.","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"Automatyczne odtwarzanie zatrzymane po wykonaniu 500 działań mających na celu zapewnienie responsywności tej strony. Gra może być kontynuowana; odtwarzaj ręcznie lub ponownie rozpocznij automatyczne odtwarzanie.","Your pile":"Twój stos","Cards on the table":"Karty na stole","Face down":"Ignorować","No cards have been flipped yet.":"Żadna karta nie została jeszcze odwrócona.","Player":"Odtwarzacz","Computer {number}":"Komputer {number}","You":"Ty","Cards":"Karty","Flips":"Przewraca się","Wars":"Wojny","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"Gra się rozpoczęła. Odwróć wierzchnią kartę ze stosu każdego gracza.","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} wygrał bitwę i zebrał karty {count}.","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"Wojna! Najwyższe karty są remisowane. Kontynuuj odkrywanie jednej karty w dół i jednej w górę dla każdego gracza w bitwie.","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} zebrał wszystkie karty i wygrał grę!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"Żaden gracz nie był w stanie ukończyć wojny. Mecz kończy się remisem.","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"Gracz bez dwóch kart nie może zakończyć wojny i przegrywa.","Game saved on this device.":"Gra zapisana na tym urządzeniu.","Saved game resumed.":"Zapisana gra została wznowiona.","Saved game deleted.":"Zapisana gra została usunięta.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Zapis lokalny jest niedostępny; ta gra pozostanie otwarta, dopóki nie opuścisz strony.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Nie można odczytać zapisanej gry. Rozpocznij nową grę lub usuń uszkodzony zapis.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Na tym urządzeniu nie ma zapisanej gry.","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"Jedna talia kart 52, bez jokerów. Postępuj równo między graczami 2–4; odłóż jedną kartę dla trzech graczy. Najwyższa karta wygrywa każdy rzut; garnitury nie mają znaczenia. As wysoki, 2 niski. W przypadku remisu każdy gracz biorący udział w bitwie kładzie jedną kartę w dół i jedną w górę. Najwyższa odkryta karta bierze wszystko. Jeśli nie możesz ukończyć wojny, przegrywasz. Gra może być długa i opiera się głównie na szczęściu.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Sprawdzone przepisy norweskie 16 Październik 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"Norske kortspill · Krig"},"pt":{"War Card Game":"Jogo de cartas de guerra","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"War Card Game Online – Jogue a clássica batalha de cartas","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"Jogue o clássico jogo de cartas War localmente com dois a quatro jogadores. Vire cartas, resolva empates com cartas viradas para baixo e para cima e guarde todas as cartas neste dispositivo.","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"Vire a carta do topo da pilha de cada jogador. A carta mais alta vence a batalha; fileiras iguais iniciam uma guerra.","A quick example":"Um exemplo rápido","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"Um 10 vence um 6 independentemente do naipe. Se as cartas do topo empatarem, cada jogador na batalha coloca uma carta virada para baixo e outra virada para cima; a nova carta mais alta fica com a pilha.","How to play":"Como jogar","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"Esta versão segue as regras norueguesas Krig verificadas em relação ao Norske kortspill. Dois a quatro jogadores compartilham um baralho de cartas 52 padrão sem curingas. As cartas são distribuídas viradas para baixo da forma mais uniforme possível; com três jogadores, uma carta é deixada de lado sem ser vista. Todos viram a carta do topo juntos. A classificação mais alta ganha todas as cartas da mesa; ternos não importam. Ace é o mais alto e 2 é o mais baixo. Se as cartas mais altas empatarem, cada jogador que entrou na batalha coloca uma carta virada para baixo e depois uma virada para cima. A nova carta virada para cima mais alta ocupa toda a pilha. Um novo empate repete o mesmo passo. Um jogador que não consegue fornecer ambas as cartas de guerra perde; as cartas restantes juntam-se à pilha de batalha. O último jogador com cartas vence. O jogo é movido pela sorte, pode levar muito tempo e esta versão não pretende impedir todas as sequências repetidas possíveis.","Frequently asked questions":"Perguntas frequentes","How many players can play?":"Quantos jogadores podem jogar?","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"Escolha dois, três ou quatro jogadores. Todo mundo usa um baralho de cartas 52 padrão.","Which card is highest?":"Qual placa é a mais alta?","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"Ás é o mais alto, seguido por rei, rainha, valete e 10 até 2. Os ternos não têm classificação.","What happens on a tie?":"O que acontece em uma gravata?","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"Cada jogador na batalha coloca uma carta virada para baixo e outra virada para cima. A nova carta virada para cima mais alta ganha todas as cartas da mesa.","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"E se eu não tiver cartas suficientes para uma guerra?","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"Um jogador que não consegue completar o par virado para baixo e virado para cima perde. As cartas restantes permanecem na pilha de batalha.","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"Este jogo requer uma conta ou carrega meus cartões?","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"Não. O jogo e o salvamento opcional permanecem neste navegador neste dispositivo.","Rules and limitations":"Regras e limitações","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"A guerra é principalmente um acaso e pode durar muito tempo; alguns pedidos de cartão podem ser repetidos. Esta versão usa uma carta virada para baixo por jogador durante uma guerra, inclui todos os jogadores da batalha empatada e remove um jogador que não consegue completar o par descendente e ascendente. Os jogadores locais da CPU simplesmente viram as cartas. Não há multijogador online, conta ou dados de jogo carregados.","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Grátis para jogar. Cartões, estado de correspondência e salvamento opcional permanecem neste dispositivo; nada é carregado.","Play War":"Jogar Guerra","Related tools":"Ferramentas relacionadas","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRÁTIS · FUNCIONA NO SEU NAVEGADOR","Language":"Idioma","UsefulVerse":"VersoÚtil","All tools":"Todas as ferramentas","Total players":"Total de jogadores","New game":"Novo jogo","Resume saved game":"Retomar jogo salvo","Delete saved game":"Excluir jogo salvo","Export results":"Exportar resultados","Eliminated":"Eliminado","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Inicie um jogo ou retome aquele salvo neste dispositivo.","Flip cards":"Cartões virados","Continue the war":"Continue a guerra","Auto-play":"Reprodução automática","Stop auto-play":"Parar reprodução automática","Auto-play paused.":"Reprodução automática pausada.","Auto-play speed":"Velocidade de reprodução automática","Slow":"Lento","Normal":"Normal","Fast":"Rápido","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"A reprodução automática foi interrompida porque esse arranjo exato de cartas se repetiu. Nenhum vencedor foi declarado; continue manualmente ou inicie a reprodução automática novamente.","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"A reprodução automática foi interrompida após ações de 500 para manter esta página responsiva. O jogo pode continuar; reproduza manualmente ou inicie a reprodução automática novamente.","Your pile":"Sua pilha","Cards on the table":"Cartas na mesa","Face down":"De bruços","No cards have been flipped yet.":"Nenhuma carta foi virada ainda.","Player":"Jogador","Computer {number}":"Computador {number}","You":"Você","Cards":"Cartões","Flips":"Viradas","Wars":"Guerras","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"O jogo começou. Vire a carta do topo da pilha de cada jogador.","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} venceu a batalha e coletou cartas {count}.","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"Guerra! As cartas mais altas estão empatadas. Continue a revelar uma carta aberta e uma carta aberta para cada jogador na batalha.","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} coletou todas as cartas e ganhou o jogo!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"Nenhum jogador conseguiu completar a guerra. O jogo está empatado.","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"Um jogador sem duas cartas não consegue terminar a guerra e perde.","Game saved on this device.":"Jogo salvo neste dispositivo.","Saved game resumed.":"O jogo salvo foi retomado.","Saved game deleted.":"Jogo salvo excluído.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"O salvamento local não está disponível; este jogo permanecerá aberto até você sair da página.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"O jogo salvo não pôde ser lido. Inicie um novo jogo ou exclua o salvamento danificado.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Não há jogo salvo neste dispositivo.","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"Um baralho de cartas 52, sem curingas. Negocie uniformemente entre os players 2 – 4; reserve uma carta para três jogadores. A carta mais alta ganha cada jogada; ternos não importam. Ás alto, 2 baixo. Em caso de empate, cada jogador na batalha coloca uma carta para baixo e outra para cima. A carta virada para cima mais alta leva tudo. Se você não conseguir completar uma guerra, você perde. O jogo pode ser longo e depende principalmente da sorte.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Regras norueguesas verificadas 16 outubro 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"Norske Kortspill · Krig"},"ru":{"War Card Game":"Военная карточная игра","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"Карточная онлайн-игра «Война» — сыграйте в классическую карточную битву","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"Играйте в классическую карточную игру «Война» локально с двумя-четырьмя игроками. Переворачивайте карты, разрешайте ничьи с помощью закрытых и открытых карт и храните все карты на этом устройстве.","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"Переверните верхнюю карту из стопки каждого игрока. Самая высокая карта выигрывает битву; равные ранги начинают войну.","A quick example":"Краткий пример","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"10 побеждает 6 независимо от масти. Если верхние карты равны, каждый игрок в битве кладет одну карту лицевой стороной вниз и одну карту лицевой стороной вверх; новая карта старшего размера берет стопку.","How to play":"Как играть","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"Эта версия соответствует правилам Норвежского Крига, проверенным на Norske Kortspil. От двух до четырех игроков используют одну стандартную колоду карт 52 без джокеров. Карты раздаются лицевой стороной вниз, насколько это возможно; при трех игроках одна карта откладывается невидимой. Все вместе переворачивают верхнюю карту. Самый высокий ранг выигрывает все карты на столе; костюмы не имеют значения. Туз – самый старший, а 2 – самый низкий. Если самые высокие карты равны, каждый игрок, присоединившийся к этой битве, кладет одну карту лицевой стороной вниз, а затем еще одну карту лицевой стороной вверх. Самая высокая новая открытая карта занимает всю стопку. Дальнейшая завязка повторяет тот же шаг. Игрок, который не может предоставить обе карты войны, проигрывает; их оставшиеся карты добавляются в боевую стопку. Побеждает последний игрок с картами. Игра основана на удаче, может занять много времени, и эта версия не претендует на предотвращение всех возможных повторяющихся последовательностей.","Frequently asked questions":"Часто задаваемые вопросы","How many players can play?":"Сколько игроков может играть?","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"Выберите двух, трех или четырех игроков. Каждый использует одну стандартную колоду карт 52.","Which card is highest?":"Какая карта старше?","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"Старший туз, за ​​ним следуют король, дама, валет и 10 до 2. Костюмы не имеют ранга.","What happens on a tie?":"Что происходит при галстуке?","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"Каждый игрок в битве кладет одну карту лицевой стороной вниз и одну карту лицевой стороной вверх. Более высокая новая открытая карта выигрывает все карты на столе.","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"Что делать, если мне не хватает карт для войны?","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"Игрок, который не может собрать пару лицевой стороной вниз и лицевой стороной вверх, проигрывает. Оставшиеся карты остаются в боевой стопке.","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"Для этой игры требуется учетная запись или загрузка моих карточек?","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"Нет. Игра и дополнительные сохранения остаются в этом браузере на этом устройстве.","Rules and limitations":"Правила и ограничения","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"Война по большей части случайна и может длиться долго; некоторые заказы по картам могут повторяться. В этой версии на каждого игрока во время войны используется одна закрытая карта, включается каждый игрок, участвовавший в равной битве, и удаляется игрок, который не может составить пару «нижний-верхний». Местные игроки CPU просто переворачивают карты. Нет многопользовательской онлайн-игры, учетной записи или загруженных игровых данных.","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Играть можно бесплатно. Карты, состояние совпадения и дополнительные сохранения остаются на этом устройстве; ничего не загружается.","Play War":"Играть в войну","Related tools":"Сопутствующие инструменты","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"БЕСПЛАТНО · ЗАПУСКАЕТСЯ В ВАШЕМ БРАУЗЕРЕ","Language":"Язык","UsefulVerse":"Полезный стих","All tools":"Все инструменты","Total players":"Всего игроков","New game":"Новая игра","Resume saved game":"Возобновить сохраненную игру","Delete saved game":"Удалить сохраненную игру","Export results":"Экспорт результатов","Eliminated":"Устранено","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Запустите игру или возобновите игру, сохраненную на этом устройстве.","Flip cards":"Перекидные карты","Continue the war":"Продолжить войну","Auto-play":"Автовоспроизведение","Stop auto-play":"Остановить автовоспроизведение","Auto-play paused.":"Автовоспроизведение приостановлено.","Auto-play speed":"Скорость автоматического воспроизведения","Slow":"Медленный","Normal":"Нормальный","Fast":"Быстрый","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"Автоматическая игра остановлена, поскольку повторяется именно такое расположение карт. Победитель не был объявлен; продолжите вручную или снова запустите автоматическое воспроизведение.","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"Автовоспроизведение остановлено после действий 500, чтобы страница оставалась отзывчивой. Игра может продолжаться; воспроизведите вручную или снова запустите автоматическое воспроизведение.","Your pile":"Ваша стопка","Cards on the table":"Карты на столе","Face down":"Лицом вниз","No cards have been flipped yet.":"Карты еще не перевернуты.","Player":"Игрок","Computer {number}":"Компьютер {number}","You":"Ты","Cards":"Карты","Flips":"Сальто","Wars":"Войны","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"Игра началась. Переверните верхнюю карту из стопки каждого игрока.","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} выиграл битву и собрал карты {count}.","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"Война! Старшие карты связаны. Продолжайте открывать по одной открытой и одной открытой карте каждому игроку в битве.","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} собрал все карты и выиграл игру!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"Ни один игрок не смог завершить войну. Игра ничья.","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"Игрок без двух карт не смог завершить войну и проиграл.","Game saved on this device.":"Игра сохранена на этом устройстве.","Saved game resumed.":"Сохраненная игра возобновлена.","Saved game deleted.":"Сохраненная игра удалена.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Локальное сохранение недоступно; эта игра останется открытой, пока вы не покинете страницу.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Сохраненная игра не может быть прочитана. Начните новую игру или удалите поврежденное сохранение.","There is no saved game on this device.":"На этом устройстве нет сохраненной игры.","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"Одна колода карт 52, без джокеров. Раздайте игрокам 2–4 поровну; отложите одну карту для трех игроков. Самая высокая карта выигрывает в каждом подбрасывании; костюмы не имеют значения. Старший туз, младшая 2. При ничьей каждый игрок в битве кладет одну карту вниз и одну вверх. Старшая открытая карта забирает все. Если вы не можете завершить войну, вы проиграете. Игра может быть долгой и в основном зависит от удачи.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Норвежские правила проверены 16 Октябрь 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"Норский кортспилл · Криг"},"sv":{"War Card Game":"Krigskortspel","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"Krigskortspel online — Spela den klassiska kortstriden","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"Spela det klassiska krigskortspelet lokalt med två till fyra spelare. Vänd kort, lös band med framsidan nedåt och uppåtvända kort, och behåll alla kort på den här enheten.","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"Vänd det översta kortet från varje spelares hög. Det högsta kortet vinner striden; lika rangordnar starta ett krig.","A quick example":"Ett snabbt exempel","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"A 10 slår en 6 oavsett färg. Om de översta korten är lika, lägger varje spelare i striden ett kort med framsidan nedåt och ett med framsidan upp; det högre nya kortet tar högen.","How to play":"Hur man spelar","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"Denna version följer de norska Krig-reglerna kontrollerade mot Norske kortspill. Två till fyra spelare delar en standard 52-kortlek utan jokrar. Korten delas ut med framsidan nedåt så jämnt som möjligt; med tre spelare läggs ett kort åt sidan osedda. Alla vänder det översta kortet tillsammans. Den högsta rangen vinner alla kort på bordet; kostymer spelar ingen roll. Ess är högst och 2 är lägst. Om de högsta korten är oavgjorda lägger varje spelare som gick med i striden ett kort med framsidan nedåt och sedan ett med framsidan upp. Det högsta nya öppna kortet tar hela högen. En ytterligare slips upprepar samma steg. En spelare som inte kan leverera båda krigskorten förlorar; deras återstående kort går med i stridshögen. Den sista spelaren med kort vinner. Spelet är turdrivet, kan ta lång tid, och den här versionen gör inte anspråk på att förhindra alla möjliga upprepade sekvenser.","Frequently asked questions":"Vanliga frågor","How many players can play?":"Hur många spelare kan spela?","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"Välj två, tre eller fyra spelare. Alla använder en standard 52-kortlek.","Which card is highest?":"Vilket kort är högst?","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"Äss är högst, följt av kung, dam, knekt och 10 ner till 2. Dräkter har ingen rang.","What happens on a tie?":"Vad händer på en slips?","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"Varje spelare i striden lägger ett kort med framsidan nedåt och ett med framsidan uppåt. Det högre nya öppna kortet vinner alla kort på bordet.","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"Vad händer om jag inte har tillräckligt med kort för ett krig?","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"En spelare som inte kan slutföra paret med framsidan ned och uppåt förlorar. De återstående korten stannar i stridshögen.","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"Kräver detta spel ett konto eller ladda upp mina kort?","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"Nr. Spelet och valfri lagring stannar i den här webbläsaren på den här enheten.","Rules and limitations":"Regler och begränsningar","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"Krig är mest slump och kan pågå länge; vissa kortbeställningar kan upprepas. Den här versionen använder ett nedåtvänt kort per spelare under ett krig, inkluderar alla spelare från den oavgjorda striden och tar bort en spelare som inte kan slutföra paret nedåt och uppåt. Lokala CPU-spelare vänder helt enkelt kort. Det finns ingen online multiplayer-, konto- eller uppladdad speldata.","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Gratis att spela. Kort, matchstatus och valfri lagring stannar på den här enheten; ingenting laddas upp.","Play War":"Spela krig","Related tools":"Relaterade verktyg","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATIS · KÖR I DIN WEBBläsare","Language":"Språk","UsefulVerse":"Användbar vers","All tools":"Alla verktyg","Total players":"Totalt antal spelare","New game":"Nytt spel","Resume saved game":"Återuppta sparat spel","Delete saved game":"Ta bort sparat spel","Export results":"Exportera resultat","Eliminated":"Eliminerad","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Starta ett spel eller återuppta det som sparats på den här enheten.","Flip cards":"Vändkort","Continue the war":"Fortsätt kriget","Auto-play":"Autouppspelning","Stop auto-play":"Stoppa automatisk uppspelning","Auto-play paused.":"Automatisk uppspelning pausad.","Auto-play speed":"Automatisk uppspelningshastighet","Slow":"Långsam","Normal":"Normal","Fast":"Snabb","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"Autospelet stoppades eftersom detta exakta kortarrangemang upprepades. Ingen vinnare utsågs; fortsätt manuellt eller starta automatisk uppspelning igen.","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"Automatisk uppspelning avbröts efter 500 åtgärder för att hålla den här sidan responsiv. Spelet kan fortsätta; spela upp manuellt eller starta automatisk uppspelning igen.","Your pile":"Din hög","Cards on the table":"Kort på bordet","Face down":"Framsidan nedåt","No cards have been flipped yet.":"Inga kort har vänts ännu.","Player":"Spelare","Computer {number}":"Dator {number}","You":"Du","Cards":"Kort","Flips":"Vänder","Wars":"Krig","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"Spelet började. Vänd det översta kortet från varje spelares hög.","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} vann striden och samlade {count}-kort.","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"Krig! De högsta korten är oavgjorda. Fortsätt att avslöja ett kort ner och ett upp för varje spelare i striden.","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} samlade alla kort och vann spelet!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"Ingen spelare kunde slutföra kriget. Spelet är oavgjort.","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"En spelare utan två kort kunde inte avsluta kriget och förlorar.","Game saved on this device.":"Spelet har sparats på den här enheten.","Saved game resumed.":"Sparat spel återupptogs.","Saved game deleted.":"Sparat spel raderat.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Lokalt sparande är inte tillgängligt; detta spel kommer att förbli öppet tills du lämnar sidan.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Sparat spel kunde inte läsas. Starta ett nytt spel eller ta bort den skadade lagringen.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Det finns inget sparat spel på den här enheten.","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"En 52-kortlek, inga jokers. Dela jämnt mellan 2–4 spelare; lägg ett kort åt sidan för tre spelare. Högsta kort vinner varje flip; kostymer spelar ingen roll. Ess hög, 2 låg. Vid oavgjort, lägger varje spelare i striden ett kort ner och ett upp. Det högsta uppåtvända kortet tar allt. Om du inte kan slutföra ett krig, förlorar du. Spelet kan vara långt och är mest tur.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Norska regler kontrollerade 16 oktober 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"Norska kortspill · Krig"},"sw":{"War Card Game":"Mchezo wa Kadi ya Vita","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"Mchezo wa Kadi ya Vita Mtandaoni — Cheza Vita vya Kadi ya Kawaida","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"Cheza mchezo wa kawaida wa kadi ya Vita ndani ya nchi na wachezaji wawili hadi wanne. Geuza kadi, suluhisha uhusiano na kadi za uso chini na uso-up, na uhifadhi kila kadi kwenye kifaa hiki.","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"Geuza kadi ya juu kutoka kwenye rundo la kila mchezaji. Kadi ya juu zaidi inashinda vita; safu sawa zinaanzisha vita.","A quick example":"Mfano wa haraka","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"A 10 inashinda 6 bila kujali suti. Kadi za juu zikifungana, kila mchezaji kwenye vita huweka kadi moja uso chini na mwingine uso juu; kadi mpya ya juu inachukua rundo.","How to play":"Jinsi ya kucheza","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"Toleo hili linafuata sheria za Krig za Norway zilizoangaliwa dhidi ya Norske kortspill. Wachezaji wawili hadi wanne wanashiriki sitaha ya kawaida ya kadi ya 52 bila wacheshi. Kadi zinashughulikiwa chini kwa usawa iwezekanavyo; na wachezaji watatu, kadi moja inawekwa kando bila kuonekana. Kila mtu anageuza kadi ya juu pamoja. Kiwango cha juu kinashinda kadi zote kwenye meza; suti haijalishi. Ace iko juu zaidi na 2 iko chini zaidi. Kadi za juu zaidi zikifungana, kila mchezaji aliyejiunga na pambano hilo ataweka kadi moja kifudifudi kisha mmoja uso juu. Kadi mpya ya juu kabisa ya uso-up inachukua rundo zima. Kufunga zaidi kunarudia hatua sawa. Mchezaji ambaye hawezi kutoa kadi zote za vita hupoteza; kadi zao zilizobaki zinajiunga na rundo la vita. Mchezaji wa mwisho aliye na kadi atashinda. Mchezo unaendeshwa kwa bahati, unaweza kuchukua muda mrefu, na toleo hili halidai kuzuia kila mlolongo unaowezekana wa kurudia.","Frequently asked questions":"Maswali yanayoulizwa mara kwa mara","How many players can play?":"Je, wachezaji wangapi wanaweza kucheza?","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"Chagua wachezaji wawili, watatu au wanne. Kila mtu hutumia sitaha ya kadi ya 52 ya kawaida.","Which card is highest?":"Ni kadi gani iliyo juu zaidi?","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"Ace ni ya juu zaidi, ikifuatiwa na mfalme, malkia, jack na 10 chini hadi 2. Suti hazina cheo.","What happens on a tie?":"Nini hutokea kwenye tai?","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"Kila mchezaji kwenye vita anaweka kadi moja kifudifudi na mmoja uso juu. Kadi mpya ya uso-up ya juu zaidi itashinda kadi zote kwenye jedwali.","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"Nini ikiwa sina kadi za kutosha kwa vita?","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"Mchezaji ambaye hawezi kukamilisha jozi ya uso chini na uso-juu atapoteza. Kadi zao zilizobaki hukaa kwenye rundo la vita.","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"Je, mchezo huu unahitaji akaunti au upakie kadi zangu?","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"Na. Mchezo na hifadhi ya hiari kaa katika kivinjari hiki kwenye kifaa hiki.","Rules and limitations":"Sheria na mapungufu","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"Vita mara nyingi ni bahati nasibu na inaweza kudumu kwa muda mrefu; baadhi ya maagizo ya kadi yanaweza kurudiwa. Toleo hili hutumia kadi moja ya uso chini kwa kila mchezaji wakati wa vita, inajumuisha kila mchezaji kutoka kwa pambano la kawaida, na huondoa mchezaji ambaye hawezi kukamilisha jozi ya kushuka na juu. Wachezaji wa ndani wa CPU hugeuza tu kadi. Hakuna wachezaji wengi mtandaoni, akaunti, au data ya mchezo iliyopakiwa.","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Bila kucheza. Kadi, hali ya mechi na hifadhi ya hiari kwenye kifaa hiki; hakuna kinachopakiwa.","Play War":"Cheza Vita","Related tools":"Vyombo vinavyohusiana","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"BILA MALIPO · INAENDELEA KATIKA KIvinjari CHAKO","Language":"Lugha","UsefulVerse":"MuhimuVerse","All tools":"Vyombo vyote","Total players":"Jumla ya wachezaji","New game":"Mchezo mpya","Resume saved game":"Endelea na mchezo uliohifadhiwa","Delete saved game":"Futa mchezo uliohifadhiwa","Export results":"Hamisha matokeo","Eliminated":"Imeondolewa","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Anzisha mchezo au uendelee na ule uliohifadhiwa kwenye kifaa hiki.","Flip cards":"Geuza kadi","Continue the war":"Endelea na vita","Auto-play":"Cheza kiotomatiki","Stop auto-play":"Acha kucheza kiotomatiki","Auto-play paused.":"Uchezaji kiotomatiki umesitishwa.","Auto-play speed":"Kasi ya kucheza kiotomatiki","Slow":"Polepole","Normal":"Kawaida","Fast":"Haraka","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"Uchezaji kiotomatiki umesimamishwa kwa sababu mpangilio huu kamili wa kadi ulirudiwa. Hakuna mshindi aliyetangazwa; endelea mwenyewe au anza kucheza kiotomatiki tena.","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"Uchezaji kiotomatiki ulisimamishwa baada ya vitendo vya 500 ili kuweka ukurasa huu uitikie. Mchezo unaweza kuendelea; cheza wewe mwenyewe au anza kucheza kiotomatiki tena.","Your pile":"Rundo lako","Cards on the table":"Kadi kwenye meza","Face down":"Uso chini","No cards have been flipped yet.":"Bado hakuna kadi ambazo zimegeuzwa.","Player":"Mchezaji","Computer {number}":"Kompyuta {number}","You":"Wewe","Cards":"Kadi","Flips":"Inageuza","Wars":"Vita","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"Mchezo umeanza. Geuza kadi ya juu kutoka kwenye rundo la kila mchezaji.","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} alishinda vita na kukusanya kadi {count}.","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"Vita! Kadi za juu zaidi zimefungwa. Endelea kufichua kadi moja chini na moja juu kwa kila mchezaji kwenye vita.","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} alikusanya kadi zote na kushinda mchezo!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"Hakuna mchezaji aliyeweza kukamilisha vita. Mchezo ni sare.","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"Mchezaji asiye na kadi mbili hakuweza kumaliza vita na kushindwa.","Game saved on this device.":"Mchezo umehifadhiwa kwenye kifaa hiki.","Saved game resumed.":"Mchezo uliohifadhiwa umeanza tena.","Saved game deleted.":"Mchezo uliohifadhiwa umefutwa.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Uhifadhi wa ndani haupatikani; mchezo huu utabaki wazi hadi uondoke kwenye ukurasa.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Mchezo uliohifadhiwa haukuweza kusomeka. Anzisha mchezo mpya au ufute hifadhi iliyoharibiwa.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Hakuna mchezo uliohifadhiwa kwenye kifaa hiki.","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"Kadi moja ya 52, hakuna wacheshi. Shughulika kwa usawa kati ya wachezaji wa 2–4; weka kadi moja kwa wachezaji watatu. Kadi ya juu inashinda kila flip; suti haijalishi. Ace ya juu, 2 ya chini. Kwenye sare, kila mchezaji kwenye vita huweka kadi moja chini na moja juu. Kadi ya uso-up ya juu inachukua yote. Ikiwa huwezi kumaliza vita, utashindwa. Mchezo unaweza kuwa mrefu na mara nyingi ni bahati.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Sheria za Norway zimeangaliwa 16 Oktoba 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"Norske kortspill · Krig"},"ta":{"War Card Game":"போர் அட்டை விளையாட்டு","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"ஆன்லைனில் போர் அட்டை விளையாட்டு — கிளாசிக் கார்டு போரை விளையாடுங்கள்","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"உள்ளூரில் இரண்டு முதல் நான்கு வீரர்களுடன் கிளாசிக் போர் அட்டை விளையாட்டை விளையாடுங்கள். கார்டுகளை ஃபிலிப் செய்யவும், முகத்தை கீழே மற்றும் முகத்தை உயர்த்தும் கார்டுகளுடன் உறவுகளைத் தீர்க்கவும், மேலும் ஒவ்வொரு கார்டையும் இந்தச் சாதனத்தில் வைத்திருக்கவும்.","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"ஒவ்வொரு வீரரின் பைலில் இருந்தும் மேல் அட்டையை புரட்டவும். மிக உயர்ந்த அட்டை போரில் வெற்றி பெறுகிறது; சம அணிகள் ஒரு போரைத் தொடங்குகின்றன.","A quick example":"விரைவான உதாரணம்","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"A 10 ஒரு 6ஐப் பொருட்படுத்தாமல் துடிக்கிறது. மேல் அட்டைகள் சமமாக இருந்தால், போரில் ஒவ்வொரு வீரரும் ஒரு அட்டையை கீழேயும் ஒரு முகத்தை மேலேயும் வைக்கிறார்கள்; அதிக புதிய அட்டை குவியலை எடுக்கும்.","How to play":"எப்படி விளையாடுவது","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"இந்தப் பதிப்பு Norske kortspill இல் சரிபார்க்கப்பட்ட நார்வேஜியன் கிரிக் விதிகளைப் பின்பற்றுகிறது. இரண்டு முதல் நான்கு வீரர்கள் ஜோக்கர்கள் இல்லாமல் ஒரு நிலையான 52-கார்டு டெக்கைப் பகிர்ந்து கொள்கிறார்கள். அட்டைகள் முடிந்தவரை சமமாக கீழே கொடுக்கப்படுகின்றன; மூன்று வீரர்களுடன், ஒரு அட்டை பார்க்கப்படாமல் ஒதுக்கி வைக்கப்பட்டுள்ளது. எல்லோரும் ஒன்றாக மேல் அட்டையைப் புரட்டுகிறார்கள். மிக உயர்ந்த தரவரிசை அட்டவணையில் உள்ள அனைத்து அட்டைகளையும் வென்றது; வழக்குகள் முக்கியமில்லை. ஏஸ் அதிகமாகவும் 2 குறைவாகவும் உள்ளது. அதிக கார்டுகள் சமன் செய்யப்பட்டால், அந்த போரில் இணைந்த ஒவ்வொரு வீரரும் ஒரு அட்டையை கீழே வைத்து பின்னர் ஒரு முகத்தை மேலே வைக்க வேண்டும். மிக உயர்ந்த புதிய ஃபேஸ்-அப் கார்டு முழு பைலையும் எடுக்கும். மற்றொரு டை அதே படியை மீண்டும் செய்கிறது. இரண்டு போர் அட்டைகளையும் வழங்க முடியாத ஒரு வீரர் இழக்கிறார்; அவர்களின் மீதமுள்ள அட்டைகள் போர்க் குவியலில் இணைகின்றன. அட்டைகளைக் கொண்ட கடைசி வீரர் வெற்றி பெறுகிறார். கேம் அதிர்ஷ்டத்தால் இயக்கப்படுகிறது, நீண்ட நேரம் ஆகலாம், மேலும் இந்த பதிப்பு மீண்டும் மீண்டும் நிகழும் ஒவ்வொரு வரிசையையும் தடுப்பதாகக் கூறவில்லை.","Frequently asked questions":"அடிக்கடி கேட்கப்படும் கேள்விகள்","How many players can play?":"எத்தனை வீரர்கள் விளையாடலாம்?","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"இரண்டு, மூன்று அல்லது நான்கு வீரர்களைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும். அனைவரும் ஒரு நிலையான 52-கார்டு டெக் பயன்படுத்துகின்றனர்.","Which card is highest?":"எந்த கார்டு அதிகமாக உள்ளது?","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"ஏஸ் அதிகபட்சம், அதைத் தொடர்ந்து ராஜா, ராணி, பலா மற்றும் 10 2 வரை. உடைகளுக்கு ரேங்க் இல்லை.","What happens on a tie?":"டையில் என்ன நடக்கும்?","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"போரில் ஒவ்வொரு வீரரும் ஒரு அட்டையை கீழேயும் ஒரு முகத்தை மேலேயும் வைக்கிறார்கள். உயர்வான புதிய முகநூல் அட்டை மேசையில் உள்ள அனைத்து கார்டுகளையும் வெல்லும்.","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"போருக்கு போதுமான அட்டைகள் என்னிடம் இல்லையென்றால் என்ன செய்வது?","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"முக-கீழ் மற்றும் முக-அப் ஜோடியை முடிக்க முடியாத ஒரு வீரர் தோற்றார். அவர்களின் மீதமுள்ள அட்டைகள் போர்க் குவியலில் இருக்கும்.","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"இந்த கேமுக்கு கணக்கு தேவையா அல்லது எனது கார்டுகளை பதிவேற்ற வேண்டுமா?","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"எண். கேம் மற்றும் விருப்பமான சேமிப்பு இந்தச் சாதனத்தில் இந்த உலாவியில் இருக்கும்.","Rules and limitations":"விதிகளும் வரம்புகளும்","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"போர் என்பது பெரும்பாலும் வாய்ப்பு மற்றும் நீண்ட காலம் நீடிக்கும்; சில கார்டு ஆர்டர்கள் மீண்டும் வரலாம். இந்தப் பதிப்பானது, போரின்போது ஒரு வீரருக்கு ஒரு முகத்தை-கீழ் அட்டையைப் பயன்படுத்துகிறது, கட்டப்பட்ட போரில் உள்ள ஒவ்வொரு வீரரையும் உள்ளடக்கியது, மேலும் கீழும்-மேலும் ஜோடியை முடிக்க முடியாத ஒரு வீரரை நீக்குகிறது. உள்ளூர் CPU பிளேயர்கள் வெறுமனே கார்டுகளை புரட்டுகின்றன. ஆன்லைன் மல்டிபிளேயர், கணக்கு அல்லது பதிவேற்றிய கேம் தரவு எதுவும் இல்லை.","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"இலவசமாக விளையாடலாம். கார்டுகள், பொருத்த நிலை மற்றும் விருப்பச் சேமிப்பு ஆகியவை இந்தச் சாதனத்தில் இருக்கும்; எதுவும் பதிவேற்றப்படவில்லை.","Play War":"ப்ளே வார்","Related tools":"தொடர்புடைய கருவிகள்","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"இலவசம் · உங்கள் உலாவியில் இயங்குகிறது","Language":"மொழி","UsefulVerse":"பயனுள்ள வசனம்","All tools":"அனைத்து கருவிகளும்","Total players":"மொத்த வீரர்கள்","New game":"புதிய கேம்","Resume saved game":"சேமித்த விளையாட்டை மீண்டும் தொடங்கவும்","Delete saved game":"சேமித்த கேமை நீக்கு","Export results":"ஏற்றுமதி முடிவுகள்","Eliminated":"எலிமினேட் செய்யப்பட்டது","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"ஒரு கேமைத் தொடங்கவும் அல்லது இந்தச் சாதனத்தில் சேமித்ததை மீண்டும் தொடங்கவும்.","Flip cards":"ஃபிளிப் கார்டுகள்","Continue the war":"போரைத் தொடரவும்","Auto-play":"ஆட்டோ-பிளே","Stop auto-play":"தானாக விளையாடுவதை நிறுத்து","Auto-play paused.":"ஆட்டோ-பிளே இடைநிறுத்தப்பட்டது.","Auto-play speed":"ஆட்டோ-ப்ளே வேகம்","Slow":"மெதுவாக","Normal":"இயல்பு","Fast":"வேகமானது","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"இந்த துல்லியமான கார்டு ஏற்பாடு மீண்டும் செய்யப்பட்டதால் ஆட்டோ-பிளே நிறுத்தப்பட்டது. வெற்றியாளராக அறிவிக்கப்படவில்லை; கைமுறையாக தொடரவும் அல்லது மீண்டும் தானாக இயக்கவும்.","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"500 செயல்களுக்குப் பிறகு இந்தப் பக்கத்தைப் பதிலளிக்கும்படியாக ஆட்டோ-ப்ளே நிறுத்தப்பட்டது. விளையாட்டு தொடரலாம்; கைமுறையாக விளையாடவும் அல்லது தானாக விளையாடுவதை மீண்டும் தொடங்கவும்.","Your pile":"உங்கள் பைல்","Cards on the table":"மேசையில் அட்டைகள்","Face down":"முகம் கீழே","No cards have been flipped yet.":"இதுவரை எந்த அட்டையும் புரட்டப்படவில்லை.","Player":"வீரர்","Computer {number}":"கணினி {number}","You":"நீங்கள்","Cards":"அட்டைகள்","Flips":"புரட்டுகிறது","Wars":"போர்கள்","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"விளையாட்டு தொடங்கியது. ஒவ்வொரு வீரரின் பைலில் இருந்தும் மேல் அட்டையை புரட்டவும்.","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} போரில் வென்று {count} அட்டைகளை சேகரித்தார்.","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"போர்! மிக உயர்ந்த அட்டைகள் கட்டப்பட்டுள்ளன. போரில் ஒவ்வொரு வீரருக்கும் ஒரு அட்டையை கீழேயும் ஒரு அட்டையை மேலேயும் வெளிப்படுத்துவதைத் தொடரவும்.","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} அனைத்து அட்டைகளையும் சேகரித்து கேமை வென்றது!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"எந்த வீரரும் போரை முடிக்க முடியாது. ஆட்டம் டிரா ஆனது.","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"இரண்டு அட்டைகள் இல்லாத ஒரு வீரர் போரை முடிக்க முடியாமல் தோற்றார்.","Game saved on this device.":"இந்தச் சாதனத்தில் கேம் சேமிக்கப்பட்டது.","Saved game resumed.":"சேமித்த கேம் மீண்டும் தொடங்கப்பட்டது.","Saved game deleted.":"சேமிக்கப்பட்ட கேம் நீக்கப்பட்டது.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"உள்ளூர் சேமிப்பு கிடைக்கவில்லை; நீங்கள் பக்கத்தை விட்டு வெளியேறும் வரை இந்த விளையாட்டு திறந்தே இருக்கும்.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"சேமிக்கப்பட்ட விளையாட்டைப் படிக்க முடியவில்லை. புதிய கேமைத் தொடங்கவும் அல்லது சேதமடைந்த சேமிப்பை நீக்கவும்.","There is no saved game on this device.":"இந்தச் சாதனத்தில் சேமிக்கப்பட்ட கேம் எதுவும் இல்லை.","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"ஒரு 52-கார்டு டெக், ஜோக்கர்ஸ் இல்லை. 2–4 பிளேயர்களிடையே சமமாகச் செயல்படுங்கள்; மூன்று வீரர்களுக்கு ஒரு அட்டையை ஒதுக்கி வைக்கவும். ஒவ்வொரு ஃபிளிப்பிலும் அதிக அட்டை வெற்றி; வழக்குகள் முக்கியமில்லை. ஏஸ் உயர், 2 குறைந்த. ஒரு டையில், போரில் உள்ள ஒவ்வொரு வீரரும் ஒரு அட்டையை கீழேயும் ஒன்றை மேலேயும் வைக்கிறார்கள். மிக உயர்ந்த முகமூடி அட்டை அனைத்தையும் எடுக்கும். நீங்கள் ஒரு போரை முடிக்க முடியாவிட்டால், நீங்கள் இழக்கிறீர்கள். விளையாட்டு நீண்டதாக இருக்கலாம் மற்றும் பெரும்பாலும் அதிர்ஷ்டம்.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"நார்வேஜிய விதிகள் சரிபார்க்கப்பட்டது 16 அக்டோபர் 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"Norske kortspill · Krig"},"te":{"War Card Game":"వార్ కార్డ్ గేమ్","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"వార్ కార్డ్ గేమ్ ఆన్‌లైన్ — క్లాసిక్ కార్డ్ బ్యాటిల్ ఆడండి","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"క్లాసిక్ వార్ కార్డ్ గేమ్‌ను స్థానికంగా ఇద్దరు నుండి నలుగురు ఆటగాళ్లతో ఆడండి. కార్డ్‌లను ఫ్లిప్ చేయండి, ఫేస్-డౌన్ మరియు ఫేస్-అప్ కార్డ్‌లతో సంబంధాలను పరిష్కరించుకోండి మరియు ప్రతి కార్డ్‌ని ఈ పరికరంలో ఉంచండి.","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"ప్రతి ఆటగాడి పైల్ నుండి టాప్ కార్డ్‌ని తిప్పండి. అత్యధిక కార్డు యుద్ధంలో గెలుస్తుంది; సమాన ర్యాంక్‌లు యుద్ధాన్ని ప్రారంభిస్తాయి.","A quick example":"సత్వర ఉదాహరణ","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"A 10 సూట్‌తో సంబంధం లేకుండా 6ని ఓడించింది. అగ్ర కార్డులు టై అయితే, యుద్ధంలో ప్రతి క్రీడాకారుడు ఒక కార్డును క్రిందికి మరియు ఒక ముఖం పైకి ఉంచుతారు; అధిక కొత్త కార్డు పైల్ పడుతుంది.","How to play":"ఎలా ఆడాలి","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"ఈ వెర్షన్ నోర్స్కే కోర్ట్స్‌పిల్‌కి వ్యతిరేకంగా తనిఖీ చేయబడిన నార్వేజియన్ క్రిగ్ నియమాలను అనుసరిస్తుంది. ఇద్దరు నుండి నలుగురు ఆటగాళ్ళు జోకర్లు లేకుండా ఒక ప్రామాణిక 52-కార్డ్ డెక్‌ను పంచుకుంటారు. కార్డులు వీలైనంత సమానంగా ముఖం కిందకి డీల్ చేయబడతాయి; ముగ్గురు ఆటగాళ్లతో, ఒక కార్డు కనిపించకుండా పక్కన పెట్టబడింది. అందరూ కలిసి టాప్ కార్డ్‌ని తిప్పుతారు. అత్యధిక ర్యాంక్ పట్టికలో ఉన్న అన్ని కార్డులను గెలుచుకుంటుంది; సూట్లు పట్టింపు లేదు. ఏస్ అత్యధికం మరియు 2 అత్యల్పంగా ఉంది. అత్యధిక కార్డ్‌లు టై అయినట్లయితే, ఆ యుద్ధంలో చేరిన ప్రతి క్రీడాకారుడు ఒక కార్డును క్రిందికి ఉంచి ఆపై ఒక ముఖం పైకి ఉంచుతారు. అత్యధిక కొత్త ఫేస్-అప్ కార్డ్ మొత్తం పైల్‌ను తీసుకుంటుంది. మరొక టై అదే దశను పునరావృతం చేస్తుంది. రెండు యుద్ధ కార్డులను సరఫరా చేయలేని ఆటగాడు ఓడిపోతాడు; వారి మిగిలిన కార్డులు యుద్ధ కుప్పలో చేరాయి. కార్డులు ఉన్న చివరి ఆటగాడు గెలుస్తాడు. గేమ్ అదృష్టంతో నడిచేది, చాలా సమయం పట్టవచ్చు మరియు ఈ సంస్కరణ ప్రతి పునరావృత క్రమాన్ని నిరోధించడానికి దావా వేయదు.","Frequently asked questions":"తరచుగా అడిగే ప్రశ్నలు","How many players can play?":"ఎంత మంది ఆటగాళ్లు ఆడగలరు?","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"ఇద్దరు, ముగ్గురు లేదా నలుగురు ఆటగాళ్లను ఎంచుకోండి. ప్రతి ఒక్కరూ ఒక ప్రామాణిక 52-కార్డ్ డెక్‌ని ఉపయోగిస్తున్నారు.","Which card is highest?":"ఎక్కువగా ఉన్న కార్డ్ ఏది?","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"Ace అత్యధికంగా ఉంది, తర్వాత రాజు, రాణి, జాక్ మరియు 10 2 వరకు ఉన్నాయి. సూట్‌లకు ర్యాంక్ లేదు.","What happens on a tie?":"టైపై ఏమి జరుగుతుంది?","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"యుద్ధంలో ప్రతి ఆటగాడు ఒక కార్డును కిందకు మరియు ఒక ముఖాన్ని పైకి ఉంచాడు. అధిక కొత్త ఫేస్-అప్ కార్డ్ టేబుల్‌పై ఉన్న అన్ని కార్డ్‌లను గెలుచుకుంటుంది.","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"యుద్ధానికి సరిపడా కార్డ్‌లు నా దగ్గర లేకుంటే ఏమి చేయాలి?","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"ఫేస్-డౌన్ మరియు ఫేస్-అప్ జంటను పూర్తి చేయలేని ఆటగాడు ఓడిపోతాడు. వారి మిగిలిన కార్డులు యుద్ధ కుప్పలో ఉంటాయి.","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"ఈ గేమ్‌కి ఖాతా అవసరమా లేదా నా కార్డ్‌లను అప్‌లోడ్ చేయాలా?","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"నం. గేమ్ మరియు ఐచ్ఛిక సేవ్ ఈ పరికరంలో ఈ బ్రౌజర్‌లో ఉంటాయి.","Rules and limitations":"నియమాలు మరియు పరిమితులు","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"యుద్ధం ఎక్కువగా అవకాశం ఉంది మరియు చాలా కాలం పాటు ఉంటుంది; కొన్ని కార్డ్ ఆర్డర్‌లు పునరావృతం కావచ్చు. ఈ సంస్కరణ యుద్ధ సమయంలో ఒక్కో ఆటగాడికి ఒక ఫేస్-డౌన్ కార్డ్‌ని ఉపయోగిస్తుంది, టైడ్ బ్యాటిల్ నుండి ప్రతి ప్లేయర్‌ను చేర్చుతుంది మరియు డౌన్-అండ్-అప్ పెయిర్‌ను పూర్తి చేయలేని ప్లేయర్‌ను తొలగిస్తుంది. స్థానిక CPU ప్లేయర్‌లు కేవలం కార్డ్‌లను ఫ్లిప్ చేస్తాయి. ఆన్‌లైన్ మల్టీప్లేయర్, ఖాతా లేదా అప్‌లోడ్ చేసిన గేమ్ డేటా లేదు.","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"ప్లే చేయడానికి ఉచితం. ఈ పరికరంలో కార్డ్‌లు, మ్యాచ్ స్థితి మరియు ఐచ్ఛికంగా సేవ్ చేయడం; ఏమీ అప్‌లోడ్ చేయబడలేదు.","Play War":"యుద్ధం ఆడండి","Related tools":"సంబంధిత సాధనాలు","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ఉచితం · మీ బ్రౌజర్‌లో నడుస్తుంది","Language":"భాష","UsefulVerse":"ఉపయోగకరమైన పద్యం","All tools":"అన్ని సాధనాలు","Total players":"మొత్తం ఆటగాళ్లు","New game":"కొత్త గేమ్","Resume saved game":"సేవ్ చేసిన గేమ్‌ను పునఃప్రారంభించండి","Delete saved game":"సేవ్ చేసిన గేమ్‌ను తొలగించండి","Export results":"ఎగుమతి ఫలితాలు","Eliminated":"తొలగించబడింది","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"ఒక గేమ్‌ను ప్రారంభించండి లేదా ఈ పరికరంలో సేవ్ చేసిన దాన్ని మళ్లీ ప్రారంభించండి.","Flip cards":"ఫ్లిప్ కార్డ్‌లు","Continue the war":"యుద్ధాన్ని కొనసాగించండి","Auto-play":"ఆటో-ప్లే","Stop auto-play":"ఆటో-ప్లే ఆపివేయండి","Auto-play paused.":"ఆటో-ప్లే పాజ్ చేయబడింది.","Auto-play speed":"ఆటో-ప్లే వేగం","Slow":"నెమ్మదిగా","Normal":"సాధారణం","Fast":"వేగంగా","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"ఈ ఖచ్చితమైన కార్డ్ అమరిక పునరావృతం అయినందున ఆటో-ప్లే ఆగిపోయింది. విజేతగా ప్రకటించబడలేదు; మాన్యువల్‌గా కొనసాగించండి లేదా మళ్లీ ఆటో-ప్లే ప్రారంభించండి.","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"ఈ పేజీని ప్రతిస్పందనాత్మకంగా ఉంచడానికి 500 చర్యల తర్వాత ఆటో-ప్లే నిలిపివేయబడింది. ఆట కొనసాగవచ్చు; మాన్యువల్‌గా ప్లే చేయండి లేదా మళ్లీ ఆటో-ప్లే ప్రారంభించండి.","Your pile":"మీ పైల్","Cards on the table":"టేబుల్‌పై కార్డ్‌లు","Face down":"ముఖం క్రిందికి దింపి","No cards have been flipped yet.":"ఇంకా ఏ కార్డులు తిప్పబడలేదు.","Player":"ఆటగాడు","Computer {number}":"కంప్యూటర్ {number}","You":"మీరు","Cards":"కార్డులు","Flips":"ఎగరవేస్తుంది","Wars":"యుద్ధాలు","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"ఆట మొదలైంది. ప్రతి ఆటగాడి పైల్ నుండి టాప్ కార్డ్‌ని తిప్పండి.","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} యుద్ధంలో గెలిచింది మరియు {count} కార్డ్‌లను సేకరించింది.","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"యుద్ధం! అత్యధిక కార్డులు ముడిపడి ఉన్నాయి. యుద్ధంలో ప్రతి ఆటగాడికి ఒక కార్డ్ డౌన్ మరియు ఒక అప్‌ను బహిర్గతం చేయడం కొనసాగించండి.","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} అన్ని కార్డ్‌లను సేకరించి గేమ్‌ను గెలుచుకుంది!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"ఏ ఆటగాడు యుద్ధాన్ని పూర్తి చేయలేకపోయాడు. గేమ్ డ్రాగా ఉంది.","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"రెండు కార్డులు లేని ఆటగాడు యుద్ధాన్ని ముగించలేకపోయాడు మరియు ఓడిపోతాడు.","Game saved on this device.":"గేమ్ ఈ పరికరంలో సేవ్ చేయబడింది.","Saved game resumed.":"సేవ్ చేసిన గేమ్ మళ్లీ ప్రారంభించబడింది.","Saved game deleted.":"సేవ్ చేయబడిన గేమ్ తొలగించబడింది.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"స్థానిక పొదుపు అందుబాటులో లేదు; మీరు పేజీ నుండి నిష్క్రమించే వరకు ఈ గేమ్ తెరిచి ఉంటుంది.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"సేవ్ చేసిన గేమ్ చదవడం సాధ్యపడలేదు. కొత్త గేమ్‌ను ప్రారంభించండి లేదా దెబ్బతిన్న సేవ్‌ను తొలగించండి.","There is no saved game on this device.":"ఈ పరికరంలో సేవ్ చేయబడిన గేమ్ ఏదీ లేదు.","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"ఒక 52-కార్డ్ డెక్, జోకర్లు లేరు. 2–4 ఆటగాళ్ల మధ్య సమానంగా వ్యవహరించండి; ముగ్గురు ఆటగాళ్ల కోసం ఒక కార్డును పక్కన పెట్టండి. ప్రతి ఫ్లిప్‌లో అత్యధిక కార్డ్ గెలుస్తుంది; సూట్లు పట్టింపు లేదు. ఏస్ ఎక్కువ, 2 తక్కువ. టై అయినప్పుడు, యుద్ధంలో ప్రతి ఆటగాడు ఒక కార్డును క్రిందికి మరియు ఒకదానిని పైకి ఉంచాడు. అత్యధిక ఫేస్-అప్ కార్డ్ అన్నింటినీ తీసుకుంటుంది. మీరు యుద్ధాన్ని పూర్తి చేయలేకపోతే, మీరు ఓడిపోతారు. ఆట చాలా పొడవుగా ఉంటుంది మరియు ఎక్కువగా అదృష్టం ఉంటుంది.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"నార్వేజియన్ నియమాలు 16 అక్టోబర్ 2026 తనిఖీ చేయబడ్డాయి","Norske kortspill · Krig":"నార్స్కే కోర్ట్స్‌పిల్ · క్రిగ్"},"th":{"War Card Game":"เกมการ์ดสงคราม","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"เกมการ์ดสงครามออนไลน์ — เล่น Classic Card Battle","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"เล่นเกมการ์ดสงครามคลาสสิกในพื้นที่กับผู้เล่นสองถึงสี่คน พลิกการ์ด แก้ไขความสัมพันธ์ด้วยการ์ดคว่ำหน้าและหงายหน้า และเก็บการ์ดทุกใบไว้ในอุปกรณ์นี้","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"พลิกไพ่ใบบนสุดจากกองผู้เล่นแต่ละคน ไพ่ใบที่สูงที่สุดจะชนะการต่อสู้ อันดับเท่ากันเริ่มสงคราม","A quick example":"ตัวอย่างสั้นๆ","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"A 10 เหนือกว่า 6 โดยไม่คำนึงถึงความเหมาะสม หากไพ่บนสุดเสมอกัน ผู้เล่นแต่ละคนในการต่อสู้จะคว่ำไพ่หนึ่งใบและหงายหนึ่งใบ การ์ดใหม่ที่สูงกว่าจะเข้ากอง","How to play":"วิธีการเล่น","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"เวอร์ชันนี้เป็นไปตามกฎ Krig ของนอร์เวย์ที่ตรวจสอบกับ Norske kortspill ผู้เล่นสองถึงสี่คนแบ่งปันสำรับไพ่ 52 มาตรฐานหนึ่งสำรับโดยไม่มีโจ๊กเกอร์ ไพ่จะถูกแจกคว่ำหน้าให้เท่าๆ กันที่สุดเท่าที่จะเป็นไปได้ มีผู้เล่นสามคน ไพ่หนึ่งใบถูกกันไว้โดยมองไม่เห็น ทุกคนพลิกไพ่ใบบนสุดพร้อมกัน อันดับสูงสุดจะชนะไพ่ทั้งหมดบนโต๊ะ ชุดสูทไม่สำคัญ เอซสูงที่สุดและ 2 ต่ำที่สุด หากไพ่ที่มีแต้มสูงสุดเสมอกัน ผู้เล่นทุกคนที่เข้าร่วมการต่อสู้นั้นจะคว่ำไพ่หนึ่งใบและหงายหนึ่งใบ การ์ดหงายหน้าใหม่สูงสุดจะใช้เวลาทั้งกอง การผูกเพิ่มเติมจะทำซ้ำขั้นตอนเดียวกัน ผู้เล่นที่ไม่สามารถจัดหาการ์ดสงครามทั้งสองใบได้จะแพ้ ไพ่ที่เหลือของพวกเขาเข้าร่วมกองการต่อสู้ ผู้เล่นคนสุดท้ายที่มีไพ่ชนะ เกมดังกล่าวเป็นเกมที่ขับเคลื่อนด้วยโชค อาจใช้เวลานาน และเวอร์ชันนี้ไม่ได้อ้างว่าจะป้องกันลำดับการทำซ้ำที่เป็นไปได้ทั้งหมด","Frequently asked questions":"คำถามที่พบบ่อย","How many players can play?":"เล่นได้กี่คน?","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"เลือกผู้เล่นสองสามหรือสี่คน ทุกคนใช้สำรับไพ่ 52 มาตรฐานหนึ่งสำรับ","Which card is highest?":"การ์ดใบไหนสูงที่สุด?","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"Ace สูงที่สุด รองลงมาคือ king, queen, jack และ 10 ลงไปที่ 2 ชุดไม่มียศ","What happens on a tie?":"จะเกิดอะไรขึ้นกับการเสมอกัน?","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"ผู้เล่นแต่ละคนในการต่อสู้จะคว่ำการ์ดหนึ่งใบและหงายการ์ดหนึ่งใบ ไพ่หงายหน้าใหม่ที่สูงกว่าจะชนะไพ่ทั้งหมดบนโต๊ะ","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"จะเกิดอะไรขึ้นถ้าฉันมีการ์ดไม่เพียงพอสำหรับการทำสงคราม?","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"ผู้เล่นที่ไม่สามารถเข้าคู่คว่ำหน้าและหงายหน้าได้จะแพ้ ไพ่ที่เหลือจะยังคงอยู่ในกองการต่อสู้","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"เกมนี้ต้องมีบัญชีหรืออัพโหลดการ์ดของฉันหรือไม่?","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"No. เกมและการบันทึกเสริมจะยังคงอยู่ในเบราว์เซอร์นี้บนอุปกรณ์นี้","Rules and limitations":"กฎและข้อจำกัด","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"สงครามส่วนใหญ่เป็นโอกาสและสามารถคงอยู่ได้นาน คำสั่งซื้อบัตรบางรายการอาจเกิดขึ้นซ้ำ เวอร์ชันนี้ใช้การ์ดคว่ำหน้าหนึ่งใบต่อผู้เล่นหนึ่งคนในระหว่างสงคราม รวมผู้เล่นทุกคนจากการรบที่เสมอกัน และลบผู้เล่นที่ไม่สามารถทำคู่คว่ำหน้าได้ ผู้เล่น CPU ในพื้นที่เพียงแค่พลิกการ์ด ไม่มีผู้เล่นหลายคนออนไลน์ บัญชี หรือข้อมูลเกมที่อัปโหลด","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"เล่นฟรี การ์ด สถานะการจับคู่ และการบันทึกเพิ่มเติมจะยังคงอยู่ในอุปกรณ์นี้ ไม่มีอะไรถูกอัพโหลด","Play War":"เล่นสงคราม","Related tools":"เครื่องมือที่เกี่ยวข้อง","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ฟรี · รันในเบราว์เซอร์ของคุณ","Language":"ภาษา","UsefulVerse":"UsefulVerse","All tools":"เครื่องมือทั้งหมด","Total players":"จำนวนผู้เล่นทั้งหมด","New game":"เกมใหม่","Resume saved game":"เล่นเกมที่บันทึกไว้ต่อ","Delete saved game":"ลบเกมที่บันทึกไว้","Export results":"ผลการส่งออก","Eliminated":"ตกรอบแล้ว","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"เริ่มเกมหรือเล่นต่อจากเกมที่บันทึกไว้ในอุปกรณ์นี้","Flip cards":"ฟลิปการ์ด","Continue the war":"ทำสงครามต่อไป","Auto-play":"เล่นอัตโนมัติ","Stop auto-play":"หยุดเล่นอัตโนมัติ","Auto-play paused.":"หยุดเล่นอัตโนมัติชั่วคราว","Auto-play speed":"ความเร็วในการเล่นอัตโนมัติ","Slow":"ช้า","Normal":"ปกติ","Fast":"รวดเร็ว","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"การเล่นอัตโนมัติหยุดลงเนื่องจากการจัดเรียงการ์ดนี้ซ้ำกัน ไม่มีการประกาศผู้ชนะ ดำเนินการต่อด้วยตนเองหรือเริ่มเล่นอัตโนมัติอีกครั้ง","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"การเล่นอัตโนมัติหยุดลงหลังจากการกระทำของ 500 เพื่อให้หน้านี้ตอบสนอง เกมอาจดำเนินต่อไป เล่นด้วยตนเองหรือเริ่มเล่นอัตโนมัติอีกครั้ง","Your pile":"กองของคุณ","Cards on the table":"การ์ดบนโต๊ะ","Face down":"ก้มหน้าลง","No cards have been flipped yet.":"ยังไม่มีการพลิกไพ่","Player":"ผู้เล่น","Computer {number}":"คอมพิวเตอร์ {number}","You":"คุณ","Cards":"การ์ด","Flips":"พลิก","Wars":"สงคราม","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"เกมเริ่มแล้ว พลิกไพ่ใบบนสุดจากกองของผู้เล่นทุกคน","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} ชนะการต่อสู้และรวบรวมการ์ด {count}","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"สงคราม! ไพ่สูงสุดเสมอกัน เปิดเผยการ์ดหนึ่งใบต่อไปและอีกใบหนึ่งสำหรับผู้เล่นทุกคนในการต่อสู้","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} รวบรวมไพ่ทั้งหมดและชนะเกม!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"ไม่มีผู้เล่นคนใดสามารถทำสงครามให้เสร็จสิ้นได้ เกมดังกล่าวเสมอกัน","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"ผู้เล่นที่ไม่มีไพ่สองใบไม่สามารถจบสงครามและแพ้ได้","Game saved on this device.":"เกมที่บันทึกไว้ในอุปกรณ์นี้","Saved game resumed.":"เกมที่บันทึกไว้กลับมาเล่นต่อ","Saved game deleted.":"เกมที่บันทึกไว้ถูกลบแล้ว","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"การบันทึกในเครื่องไม่พร้อมใช้งาน เกมนี้จะยังคงเปิดอยู่จนกว่าคุณจะออกจากหน้า","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"ไม่สามารถอ่านเกมที่บันทึกไว้ได้ เริ่มเกมใหม่หรือลบบันทึกที่เสียหาย","There is no saved game on this device.":"ไม่มีเกมที่บันทึกไว้ในอุปกรณ์นี้","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"สำรับไพ่ 52 หนึ่งสำรับ ไม่มีโจ๊กเกอร์ จัดการอย่างเท่าเทียมกันระหว่างผู้เล่น 2–4; วางไพ่ไว้หนึ่งใบสำหรับผู้เล่นสามคน ไพ่สูงสุดจะชนะการพลิกแต่ละครั้ง ชุดสูทไม่สำคัญ เอซสูง 2 ต่ำ เมื่อเสมอกัน ผู้เล่นทุกคนในการต่อสู้จะวางไพ่หนึ่งใบและไพ่หนึ่งใบ การ์ดหงายหน้าสูงสุดใช้เวลาทั้งหมด หากคุณไม่สามารถทำสงครามได้สำเร็จ คุณจะแพ้ เกมดังกล่าวอาจยาวนานและส่วนใหญ่เป็นโชค","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"ตรวจสอบกฎของนอร์เวย์แล้ว 16 ตุลาคม 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"สนามนอร์สเก · Krig"},"tl":{"War Card Game":"War Card Game","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"War Card Game Online — Maglaro ng Classic Card Battle","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"Maglaro ng classic na War card game nang lokal na may dalawa hanggang apat na manlalaro. I-flip ang mga card, lutasin ang mga ugnayan gamit ang nakaharap at nakaharap na mga card, at panatilihin ang bawat card sa device na ito.","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"I-flip ang nangungunang card mula sa pile ng bawat manlalaro. Ang pinakamataas na card ay nanalo sa labanan; pantay na ranggo ang nagsisimula ng digmaan.","A quick example":"Isang mabilis na halimbawa","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"Natatalo ng 10 ang 6 anuman ang suit. Kung magtali ang mga nangungunang card, ilalagay ng bawat manlalaro sa labanan ang isang card na nakaharap at ang isa ay nakaharap; ang mas mataas na bagong card ay tumatagal ng pile.","How to play":"Paano laruin","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"Ang bersyon na ito ay sumusunod sa Norwegian Krig na mga panuntunan na sinuri laban sa Norske kortspill. Dalawa hanggang apat na manlalaro ang nagbabahagi ng isang karaniwang 52-card deck na walang mga joker. Ang mga card ay hinarap nang nakaharap nang pantay-pantay hangga't maaari; na may tatlong manlalaro, isang card ang nakatabi nang hindi nakikita. Sabay-sabay na binabalikan ng lahat ang tuktok na card. Ang pinakamataas na ranggo ang mananalo sa lahat ng card sa mesa; hindi mahalaga ang mga suit. Pinakamataas ang Ace at pinakamababa ang 2. Kung magtali ang pinakamataas na card, bawat manlalaro na sumali sa labanang iyon ay nakaharap ang isang card at pagkatapos ay nakaharap ang isa. Ang pinakamataas na bagong face-up card ay tumatagal ng buong pile. Ang isang karagdagang kurbatang ay umuulit sa parehong hakbang. Ang isang manlalaro na hindi makapagbigay ng parehong war card ay matatalo; ang kanilang mga natitirang card ay sumali sa labanan. Ang huling manlalaro na may mga baraha ang mananalo. Ang laro ay swerte-driven, maaaring tumagal ng mahabang panahon, at ang bersyon na ito ay hindi inaangkin na pigilan ang bawat posibleng paulit-ulit na pagkakasunod-sunod.","Frequently asked questions":"Mga madalas itanong","How many players can play?":"Ilang manlalaro ang maaaring maglaro?","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"Pumili ng dalawa, tatlo o apat na manlalaro. Gumagamit ang lahat ng isang karaniwang 52-card deck.","Which card is highest?":"Aling card ang pinakamataas?","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"Ang Ace ang pinakamataas, na sinusundan ng king, queen, jack at 10 pababa sa 2. Ang mga suit ay walang ranggo.","What happens on a tie?":"Ano ang mangyayari sa isang kurbatang?","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"Ang bawat manlalaro sa labanan ay naglalagay ng isang card na nakaharap at isang nakaharap. Ang mas mataas na bagong face-up card ang mananalo sa lahat ng card sa mesa.","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"Paano kung wala akong sapat na card para sa isang digmaan?","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"Matatalo ang isang player na hindi makumpleto ang face-down at face-up pair. Ang kanilang mga natitirang card ay nananatili sa pile ng labanan.","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"Nangangailangan ba ang larong ito ng account o i-upload ang aking mga card?","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"Hindi. Ang laro at opsyonal na save ay manatili sa browser na ito sa device na ito.","Rules and limitations":"Mga panuntunan at limitasyon","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"Ang digmaan ay kadalasang pagkakataon at maaaring tumagal ng mahabang panahon; maaaring umulit ang ilang order sa card. Gumagamit ang bersyon na ito ng isang nakaharap na card sa bawat manlalaro sa panahon ng digmaan, kasama ang bawat manlalaro mula sa nakatali na labanan, at nag-aalis ng manlalaro na hindi makumpleto ang down-and-up na pares. Ang mga lokal na manlalaro ng CPU ay nag-flip card lang. Walang online na multiplayer, account, o na-upload na data ng laro.","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Libreng laruin. Ang mga card, estado ng tugma at opsyonal na pag-save ay manatili sa device na ito; walang na-upload.","Play War":"Maglaro ng Digmaan","Related tools":"Mga kaugnay na tool","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"LIBRE · TATAKBO SA IYONG BROWSER","Language":"Wika","UsefulVerse":"Kapaki-pakinabang na Verse","All tools":"Lahat ng tool","Total players":"Kabuuang mga manlalaro","New game":"Bagong laro","Resume saved game":"Ipagpatuloy ang naka-save na laro","Delete saved game":"Tanggalin ang naka-save na laro","Export results":"I-export ang mga resulta","Eliminated":"Inalis","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Magsimula ng laro o ipagpatuloy ang naka-save sa device na ito.","Flip cards":"Mga flip card","Continue the war":"Ipagpatuloy ang digmaan","Auto-play":"Auto-play","Stop auto-play":"Ihinto ang auto-play","Auto-play paused.":"Naka-pause ang auto-play.","Auto-play speed":"Bilis ng auto-play","Slow":"Mabagal","Normal":"Normal","Fast":"Mabilis","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"Nahinto ang auto-play dahil naulit ang eksaktong pagkakaayos ng card na ito. Walang idineklara na nagwagi; magpatuloy nang manu-mano o simulan muli ang auto-play.","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"Nahinto ang auto-play pagkatapos ng mga pagkilos na 500 upang panatilihing tumutugon ang page na ito. Maaaring magpatuloy ang laro; manu-manong maglaro o simulan muli ang auto-play.","Your pile":"Iyong pile","Cards on the table":"Mga card sa mesa","Face down":"Nakaharap sa ibaba","No cards have been flipped yet.":"Wala pang card na na-flip.","Player":"Manlalaro","Computer {number}":"Computer {number}","You":"Ikaw","Cards":"Mga kard","Flips":"Naka-flip","Wars":"Mga digmaan","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"Nagsimula na ang laro. I-flip ang nangungunang card mula sa bawat tumpok ng manlalaro.","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"Nanalo ang {player} sa labanan at nakolekta ang mga {count} card.","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"Digmaan! Ang pinakamataas na card ay nakatali. Magpatuloy upang ipakita ang isang card pababa at isa pataas para sa bawat manlalaro sa labanan.","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} nakolekta lahat ng card at nanalo sa laro!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"Walang manlalaro ang makakakumpleto ng digmaan. Ang laro ay isang draw.","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"Ang isang manlalaro na walang dalawang baraha ay hindi makatapos ng digmaan at matatalo.","Game saved on this device.":"Na-save ang laro sa device na ito.","Saved game resumed.":"Ipinagpatuloy ang naka-save na laro.","Saved game deleted.":"Na-delete na ang naka-save na laro.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Hindi available ang lokal na pag-save; mananatiling bukas ang larong ito hanggang sa umalis ka sa page.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Hindi mabasa ang naka-save na laro. Magsimula ng bagong laro o tanggalin ang nasirang save.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Walang naka-save na laro sa device na ito.","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"Isang 52-card deck, walang joker. Pantay-pantay ang pakikitungo sa mga manlalaro ng 2–4; magtabi ng isang card para sa tatlong manlalaro. Ang pinakamataas na card ay nanalo sa bawat pitik; hindi mahalaga ang mga suit. Ace high, 2 mababa. Sa isang tie, ang bawat manlalaro sa labanan ay naglalagay ng isang card pababa at isa pataas. Ang pinakamataas na face-up card ay tumatagal ng lahat. Kung hindi mo makumpleto ang isang digmaan, matatalo ka. Maaaring mahaba ang laro at kadalasan ay swerte.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Nasuri ang mga panuntunan sa Norway 16 Oktubre 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"Norske kortspill · Krig"},"tr":{"War Card Game":"Savaş Kart Oyunu","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"Çevrimiçi Savaş Kart Oyunu — Klasik Kart Savaşını Oynayın","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"Klasik Savaş kart oyununu iki ila dört oyuncuyla yerel olarak oynayın. Kartları çevirin, kapalı ve açık kartlarla bağları çözün ve tüm kartları bu cihazda tutun.","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"Her oyuncunun destesindeki en üstteki kartı çevirin. En yüksek kart savaşı kazanır; Eşit saflar savaş başlatır.","A quick example":"Hızlı bir örnek","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"A 10, rengi ne olursa olsun 6'i yener. En üstteki kartlar eşitse, savaştaki her oyuncu bir kartı kapalı ve bir açık kartı yerleştirir; daha yüksek olan yeni kart desteyi alır.","How to play":"Nasıl oynanır","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"Bu sürüm, Norske kortspill'e göre kontrol edilen Norveç Krig kurallarına uygundur. İki ila dört oyuncu, joker olmadan standart bir 52 kart destesini paylaşır. Kartlar mümkün olduğunca eşit şekilde kapalı olarak dağıtılır; üç oyuncuyla bir kart görülmeden bir kenara bırakılır. Herkes üstteki kartı birlikte açar. En yüksek sıradaki kişi masadaki tüm kartları kazanır; takım elbise önemli değil. As en yüksek, 2 ise en düşük değerdir. En yüksek kartlar eşitse, o savaşa katılan her oyuncu bir kartı kapalı olarak, sonra da bir açık olarak yerleştirir. En yüksek yeni açık kart destenin tamamını alır. Başka bir beraberlik aynı adımı tekrarlar. Her iki savaş kartını da sağlayamayan oyuncu kaybeder; kalan kartları savaş destesine katılır. Kartları olan son oyuncu kazanır. Oyun şansa dayalıdır, uzun sürebilir ve bu sürüm olası her tekrarlanan diziyi önleme iddiasında değildir.","Frequently asked questions":"Sıkça sorulan sorular","How many players can play?":"Kaç oyuncu oynayabilir?","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"İki, üç veya dört oyuncuyu seçin. Herkes bir standart 52 kart destesi kullanır.","Which card is highest?":"Hangi kart en yüksek?","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"As en yüksek seviyededir, onu papaz, kız, vale ve 10 takip ederek 2'e kadar düşürür. Takım elbiselerin rütbesi yoktur.","What happens on a tie?":"Beraberlikte ne olur?","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"Savaştaki her oyuncu bir kartı kapalı, diğerini açık olarak koyar. Daha yüksek olan yeni açık kart, masadaki tüm kartları kazanır.","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"Ya savaş için yeterli kartım yoksa?","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"Yüz aşağı ve yüz yukarı çiftini tamamlayamayan oyuncu kaybeder. Kalan kartları savaş destesinde kalır.","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"Bu oyun bir hesap gerektiriyor mu yoksa kartlarımı mı yüklüyor?","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"Hayır. Oyun ve isteğe bağlı kaydetme, bu cihazdaki bu tarayıcıda kalır.","Rules and limitations":"Kurallar ve sınırlamalar","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"Savaş çoğunlukla şans eseridir ve uzun sürebilir; bazı kart siparişleri tekrarlanabilir. Bu sürüm, savaş sırasında oyuncu başına bir kapalı kart kullanır, berabere kalan savaştaki her oyuncuyu dahil eder ve aşağı-yukarı çiftini tamamlayamayan bir oyuncuyu çıkarır. Yerel CPU oyuncuları basitçe kartları çevirir. Çevrimiçi çok oyunculu oyun, hesap veya yüklenmiş oyun verileri yok.","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Oynaması ücretsiz. Kartlar, maç durumu ve isteğe bağlı kaydetme bu cihazda kalır; hiçbir şey yüklenmedi.","Play War":"Savaş Oyna","Related tools":"İlgili araçlar","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ÜCRETSİZ · TARAYICINIZDA ÇALIŞIR","Language":"Dil","UsefulVerse":"Kullanışlı Ayet","All tools":"Tüm araçlar","Total players":"Toplam oyuncu","New game":"Yeni oyun","Resume saved game":"Kayıtlı oyuna devam et","Delete saved game":"Kayıtlı oyunu sil","Export results":"Sonuçları dışa aktar","Eliminated":"Elendi","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Bir oyunu başlatın veya bu cihazda kayıtlı oyuna devam edin.","Flip cards":"Flip kartları","Continue the war":"Savaşa devam edin","Auto-play":"Otomatik oynat","Stop auto-play":"Otomatik oynatmayı durdur","Auto-play paused.":"Otomatik oynatma duraklatıldı.","Auto-play speed":"Otomatik oynatma hızı","Slow":"Yavaş","Normal":"Normal","Fast":"Hızlı","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"Otomatik oynatma durduruldu çünkü bu kart düzenlemesi tekrarlandı. Kazanan ilan edilmedi; manuel olarak devam edin veya otomatik oynatmayı yeniden başlatın.","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"Bu sayfanın duyarlı kalması için 500 işlemden sonra otomatik oynatma durduruldu. Oyun devam edebilir; manuel olarak oynatın veya otomatik oynatmayı yeniden başlatın.","Your pile":"Yığınınız","Cards on the table":"Masadaki kartlar","Face down":"Yüz aşağı","No cards have been flipped yet.":"Henüz hiçbir kart çevrilmedi.","Player":"Oyuncu","Computer {number}":"Bilgisayar {number}","You":"Sen","Cards":"Kartlar","Flips":"Çevirmeler","Wars":"Savaşlar","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"Oyun başladı. Her oyuncunun destesindeki en üstteki kartı çevirin.","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} savaşı kazandı ve {count} kartlarını topladı.","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"Savaş! En yüksek kartlar berabere kalır. Savaştaki her oyuncu için bir kapalı ve bir açık kart göstermeye devam edin.","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} tüm kartları topladı ve oyunu kazandı!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"Hiçbir oyuncu savaşı tamamlayamadı. Oyun berabere.","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"İki kartı olmayan oyuncu savaşı bitiremez ve kaybeder.","Game saved on this device.":"Oyun bu cihaza kaydedildi.","Saved game resumed.":"Kaydedilen oyun devam ettirildi.","Saved game deleted.":"Kayıtlı oyun silindi.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Yerel kaydetme kullanılamıyor; Bu oyun siz sayfadan ayrılana kadar açık kalacaktır.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Kaydedilen oyun okunamadı. Yeni bir oyun başlatın veya hasarlı kaydı silin.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Bu cihazda kayıtlı oyun yok.","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"Bir 52 kart destesi, joker yok. 2–4 oyuncuları arasında eşit şekilde dağıtın; üç oyuncu için bir kart ayırın. Her atışta en yüksek kart kazanır; takım elbise önemli değil. As yüksek, 2 düşük. Beraberlik durumunda, savaştaki her oyuncu bir kart aşağıya ve bir yukarıya koyar. En yüksek açık kart hepsini alır. Eğer savaşı tamamlayamazsan kaybedersin. Oyun uzun olabilir ve çoğunlukla şansa bağlıdır.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Norveç kuralları kontrol edildi 16 Ekim 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"Norske kısa saç dökülmesi · Krig"},"uk":{"War Card Game":"Військова карткова гра","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"Військова карткова гра онлайн — грайте в класичну карткову битву","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"Грайте в класичну карткову гру War локально з двома-чотирма гравцями. Перевертайте карти, розв’язуйте зв’язки за допомогою відкритих і відкритих карт і зберігайте кожну картку на цьому пристрої.","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"Переверніть верхню картку зі стопки кожного гравця. Старша карта виграє битву; рівні шеренги починають війну.","A quick example":"Швидкий приклад","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"10 перемагає 6 незалежно від масті. Якщо верхні карти однакові, кожен гравець у бою кладе одну карту сорочкою вниз і одну сорочкою вгору; вища нова карта займає стопку.","How to play":"Як грати","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"Ця версія дотримується правил норвезького кригу, перевірених на Norske kortspill. Два-чотири гравці ділять одну стандартну колоду карт 52 без джокерів. Карти роздаються зображенням вниз настільки рівно, наскільки це можливо; з трьома гравцями одна карта відкладається невидимою. Усі разом перевертають верхню картку. Найвищий ранг виграє всі карти на столі; костюми не мають значення. Туз — найвищий, а 2 — найнижчий. Якщо старші карти нічиї, кожен гравець, який приєднався до цього бою, кладе одну карту закритою донизу, а потім одну відкритою догори. Найвища нова закрита карта займає всю стопку. Наступна краватка повторює той самий крок. Гравець, який не може надати обидві карти війни, програє; їхні карти, що залишилися, приєднуються до бойової стопки. Перемагає останній гравець з картками. Гра заснована на удачі, може зайняти багато часу, і ця версія не претендує на запобігання кожній можливій повторюваній послідовності.","Frequently asked questions":"Часті запитання","How many players can play?":"Скільки гравців можуть грати?","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"Виберіть двох, трьох або чотирьох гравців. Кожен використовує одну стандартну колоду карт 52.","Which card is highest?":"Яка карта старша?","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"Туз є найвищим, за ним йдуть король, дама, валет і 10 аж до 2. Костюми не мають рангу.","What happens on a tie?":"Що відбувається на краватці?","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"Кожен гравець у битві кладе одну картку обличчям донизу та одну обличчям догори. Нова відкрита карта, яка вища, виграє всі карти на столі.","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"Що робити, якщо мені не вистачить карток для війни?","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"Гравець, який не може завершити пару обличчям вниз і обличчям вгору, програє. Карти, що залишилися, залишаються в бойовій стопці.","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"Чи потрібна ця гра обліковий запис або завантаження моїх карт?","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"№ Гра та необов’язкове збереження залишаються в цьому браузері на цьому пристрої.","Rules and limitations":"Правила та обмеження","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"Війна здебільшого випадкова і може тривати довго; деякі замовлення карток можуть повторюватися. Ця версія використовує одну закриту карту на гравця під час війни, включає всіх гравців із нічийного бою та вилучає гравця, який не може завершити пару вниз і вгору. Гравці на локальному процесорі просто перевертають карти. Немає багатокористувацької онлайн-ігри, облікових записів або завантажених даних гри.","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Безкоштовна гра. Картки, стан відповідності та необов’язкове збереження залишаються на цьому пристрої; нічого не завантажено.","Play War":"Грати у війну","Related tools":"Пов’язані інструменти","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"БЕЗКОШТОВНО · ЗАПУСКАЄТЬСЯ У ВАШОМУ БРАУЗЕРІ","Language":"Мова","UsefulVerse":"Корисний вірш","All tools":"Всі інструменти","Total players":"Усього гравців","New game":"Нова гра","Resume saved game":"Відновити збережену гру","Delete saved game":"Видалити збережену гру","Export results":"Експорт результатів","Eliminated":"Ліквідовано","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Почніть гру або відновіть гру, збережену на цьому пристрої.","Flip cards":"Перевертайте картки","Continue the war":"Продовжувати війну","Auto-play":"Автовідтворення","Stop auto-play":"Зупинити автоматичне відтворення","Auto-play paused.":"Автоматичне відтворення призупинено.","Auto-play speed":"Швидкість автоматичного відтворення","Slow":"Повільний","Normal":"Нормальний","Fast":"Швидко","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"Автоматичне відтворення зупинено, оскільки повторилося саме таке розташування карт. Переможця не оголошено; продовжити вручну або знову запустити автоматичне відтворення.","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"Автоматичне відтворення зупинено після дій 500, щоб ця сторінка не реагувала. Гра може продовжуватися; відтворити вручну або знову запустити автоматичне відтворення.","Your pile":"Ваша купа","Cards on the table":"Картки на столі","Face down":"Лицьовою стороною вниз","No cards have been flipped yet.":"Жодна карта ще не була перевернута.","Player":"гравець","Computer {number}":"Комп'ютер {number}","You":"Ви","Cards":"картки","Flips":"Перевертає","Wars":"війни","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"Гра почалася. Переверніть верхню картку зі стопки кожного гравця.","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} виграв битву та зібрав {count} карток.","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"Війна! Старші карти нічиї. Продовжуйте відкривати одну картку вниз і одну картку для кожного гравця в битві.","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} зібрав усі картки та виграв гру!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"Жоден гравець не міг завершити війну. Гра нічия.","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"Гравець без двох карт не міг закінчити війну і програв.","Game saved on this device.":"Гра збережена на цьому пристрої.","Saved game resumed.":"Збережену гру відновлено.","Saved game deleted.":"Збережену гру видалено.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Локальне збереження недоступне; ця гра залишатиметься відкритою, доки ви не залишите сторінку.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Не вдалося прочитати збережену гру. Почніть нову гру або видаліть пошкоджене збереження.","There is no saved game on this device.":"На цьому пристрої немає збереженої гри.","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"Одна колода карт 52, без джокерів. Дійте рівномірно між гравцями 2–4; відкладіть одну картку для трьох гравців. Найстарша карта виграє кожен фліп; костюми не мають значення. Туз високий, 2 низький. У разі нічиєї кожен гравець кладе одну картку вниз і одну вгору. Найстарша відкрита карта бере все. Якщо ви не можете завершити війну, ви програєте. Гра може бути довгою і здебільшого на удачу.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Правила Норвегії перевірено 16 Жовтень 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"Norske kortspill · Krig"},"ur":{"War Card Game":"وار کارڈ گیم","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"وار کارڈ گیم آن لائن — کلاسک کارڈ بیٹل کھیلیں","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"کلاسک وار کارڈ گیم مقامی طور پر دو سے چار کھلاڑیوں کے ساتھ کھیلیں۔ کارڈز پلٹائیں، فیس ڈاون اور فیس اپ کارڈز کے ساتھ تعلقات کو حل کریں، اور ہر کارڈ کو اس ڈیوائس پر رکھیں۔","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"ہر کھلاڑی کے ڈھیر سے اوپر والے کارڈ کو پلٹائیں۔ سب سے زیادہ کارڈ جنگ جیتتا ہے؛ برابر صفوں نے جنگ شروع کردی۔","A quick example":"ایک فوری مثال","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"A 10 سوٹ سے قطع نظر 6 کو ہرا دیتا ہے۔ اگر سب سے اوپر والے کارڈز ٹائی ہوتے ہیں، تو جنگ میں ہر کھلاڑی ایک کارڈ کو نیچے اور ایک کو اوپر رکھتا ہے۔ اعلی نیا کارڈ ڈھیر لیتا ہے.","How to play":"کیسے کھیلنا ہے۔","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"یہ ورژن نارویجن کریگ کے قواعد کی پیروی کرتا ہے جو Norske kortspill کے خلاف چیک کیے گئے ہیں۔ دو سے چار کھلاڑی بغیر جوکر کے ایک معیاری 52 کارڈ ڈیک کا اشتراک کرتے ہیں۔ کارڈز کو ہر ممکن حد تک یکساں طور پر پیش کیا جاتا ہے۔ تین کھلاڑیوں کے ساتھ، ایک کارڈ کو نظر انداز کر دیا گیا ہے۔ سب ایک ساتھ اوپر والے کارڈ کو پلٹتے ہیں۔ سب سے زیادہ رینک ٹیبل پر تمام کارڈ جیت لیتا ہے۔ سوٹ کوئی فرق نہیں پڑتا. Ace سب سے زیادہ ہے اور 2 سب سے کم ہے۔ اگر سب سے زیادہ کارڈز ٹائی ہوتے ہیں، تو اس جنگ میں شامل ہونے والا ہر کھلاڑی ایک کارڈ کو نیچے کی طرف رکھتا ہے اور پھر ایک چہرہ اوپر کرتا ہے۔ سب سے زیادہ نیا چہرہ اپ کارڈ پورا ڈھیر لیتا ہے۔ ایک اور ٹائی اسی قدم کو دہراتی ہے۔ ایک کھلاڑی جو دونوں جنگی کارڈ فراہم نہیں کر سکتا وہ ہار جاتا ہے۔ ان کے بقیہ کارڈ جنگ کے ڈھیر میں شامل ہوتے ہیں۔ کارڈز کے ساتھ آخری کھلاڑی جیت جاتا ہے۔ کھیل قسمت سے چلنے والا ہے، اس میں کافی وقت لگ سکتا ہے، اور یہ ورژن ہر ممکنہ دہرائے جانے والے تسلسل کو روکنے کا دعوی نہیں کرتا ہے۔","Frequently asked questions":"اکثر پوچھے گئے سوالات","How many players can play?":"کتنے کھلاڑی کھیل سکتے ہیں؟","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"دو، تین یا چار کھلاڑیوں کا انتخاب کریں۔ ہر کوئی ایک معیاری 52 کارڈ ڈیک استعمال کرتا ہے۔","Which card is highest?":"کون سا کارڈ سب سے زیادہ ہے؟","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"Ace سب سے زیادہ ہے، اس کے بعد بادشاہ، ملکہ، جیک اور 10 نیچے 2 تک ہے۔ سوٹ کا کوئی درجہ نہیں ہوتا۔","What happens on a tie?":"ٹائی پر کیا ہوتا ہے؟","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"جنگ میں ہر کھلاڑی ایک کارڈ کو نیچے اور ایک چہرہ اوپر رکھتا ہے۔ اعلیٰ نیا فیس اپ کارڈ میز پر موجود تمام کارڈ جیتتا ہے۔","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"اگر میرے پاس جنگ کے لیے کافی کارڈ نہیں ہیں تو کیا ہوگا؟","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"ان کے باقی کارڈ جنگ کے ڈھیر میں رہتے ہیں۔","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"کیا اس گیم کے لیے اکاؤنٹ درکار ہے یا میرے کارڈز اپ لوڈ کریں؟","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"No گیم اور اختیاری بچت اس ڈیوائس پر اس براؤزر میں رہتی ہے۔","Rules and limitations":"قواعد اور حدود","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"جنگ زیادہ تر موقع ہے اور طویل عرصے تک چل سکتی ہے۔ کارڈ کے کچھ آرڈر دہرا سکتے ہیں۔ یہ ورژن جنگ کے دوران فی کھلاڑی ایک فیس ڈاون کارڈ استعمال کرتا ہے، اس میں بندھے ہوئے جنگ سے ہر کھلاڑی شامل ہوتا ہے، اور ایسے کھلاڑی کو ہٹاتا ہے جو نیچے اور اوپر کی جوڑی کو مکمل نہیں کر سکتا۔ مقامی سی پی یو پلیئرز آسانی سے کارڈ پلٹتے ہیں۔ کوئی آن لائن ملٹی پلیئر، اکاؤنٹ، یا اپ لوڈ کردہ گیم ڈیٹا نہیں ہے۔","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"کھیلنے کے لیے مفت۔ کارڈز، میچ حالت اور اختیاری بچت اس ڈیوائس پر رہنا؛ کچھ بھی اپ لوڈ نہیں ہے.","Play War":"پلے وار","Related tools":"متعلقہ ٹولز","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"مفت · آپ کے براؤزر میں چلتا ہے۔","Language":"زبان","UsefulVerse":"مفید آیت","All tools":"تمام ٹولز","Total players":"کل کھلاڑی","New game":"نیا گیم","Resume saved game":"محفوظ کردہ گیم دوبارہ شروع کریں۔","Delete saved game":"محفوظ کردہ گیم کو حذف کریں۔","Export results":"نتائج برآمد کریں۔","Eliminated":"ختم کر دیا گیا۔","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"ایک گیم شروع کریں یا اس ڈیوائس پر محفوظ کردہ گیم کو دوبارہ شروع کریں۔","Flip cards":"فلپ کارڈز","Continue the war":"جنگ جاری رکھیں","Auto-play":"آٹو پلے","Stop auto-play":"آٹو پلے بند کریں۔","Auto-play paused.":"آٹو پلے روک دیا گیا۔","Auto-play speed":"آٹو پلے کی رفتار","Slow":"آہستہ","Normal":"نارمل","Fast":"تیز","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"آٹو پلے بند ہو گیا کیونکہ کارڈ کے اس درست انتظام کو دہرایا گیا۔ کوئی فاتح قرار نہیں دیا گیا؛ دستی طور پر جاری رکھیں یا دوبارہ آٹو پلے شروع کریں۔","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"اس صفحہ کو ریسپانسیو رکھنے کے لیے 500 ایکشنز کے بعد آٹو پلے رک گیا۔ کھیل جاری رہ سکتا ہے؛ دستی طور پر چلائیں یا دوبارہ آٹو پلے شروع کریں۔","Your pile":"آپ کا ڈھیر","Cards on the table":"ٹیبل پر کارڈز","Face down":"منہ نیچے","No cards have been flipped yet.":"ابھی تک کوئی کارڈ نہیں پلٹا گیا ہے۔","Player":"کھلاڑی","Computer {number}":"کمپیوٹر {number}","You":"آپ","Cards":"کارڈز","Flips":"پلٹتا ہے۔","Wars":"جنگیں","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"کھیل شروع ہوا۔ ہر کھلاڑی کے ڈھیر سے اوپر والے کارڈ کو پلٹائیں۔","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} نے جنگ جیت لی اور {count} کارڈز جمع کر لیے۔","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"جنگ! سب سے زیادہ کارڈز بندھے ہوئے ہیں۔ جنگ میں ہر کھلاڑی کے لیے ایک کارڈ نیچے اور ایک اوپر ظاہر کرنا جاری رکھیں۔","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} نے تمام کارڈز جمع کیے اور گیم جیت لی!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"کوئی کھلاڑی جنگ مکمل نہ کر سکا۔ کھیل ڈرا ہے۔","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"دو کارڈ کے بغیر ایک کھلاڑی جنگ ختم نہیں کر سکا اور ہار گیا۔","Game saved on this device.":"گیم اس ڈیوائس پر محفوظ ہو گئی۔","Saved game resumed.":"محفوظ کردہ گیم دوبارہ شروع ہو گئی۔","Saved game deleted.":"محفوظ کردہ گیم حذف کر دی گئی۔","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"مقامی بچت دستیاب نہیں ہے۔ یہ گیم اس وقت تک کھلا رہے گا جب تک آپ صفحہ چھوڑ نہیں دیتے۔","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"محفوظ کردہ گیم پڑھا نہیں جا سکا۔ ایک نیا گیم شروع کریں یا تباہ شدہ محفوظ کو حذف کریں۔","There is no saved game on this device.":"اس ڈیوائس پر کوئی محفوظ کردہ گیم نہیں ہے۔","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"ایک 52-کارڈ ڈیک، کوئی جوکر نہیں۔ 2–4 کھلاڑیوں کے درمیان یکساں طور پر ڈیل کریں۔ تین کھلاڑیوں کے لیے ایک کارڈ الگ رکھیں۔ سب سے زیادہ کارڈ ہر پلٹ جیتتا ہے؛ سوٹ کوئی فرق نہیں پڑتا. Ace اعلی، 2 کم۔ ٹائی پر، جنگ میں ہر کھلاڑی ایک کارڈ نیچے اور ایک اوپر رکھتا ہے۔ سب سے زیادہ چہرہ اپ کارڈ لیتا ہے. اگر آپ جنگ مکمل نہیں کر سکتے تو آپ ہار جاتے ہیں۔ کھیل طویل ہوسکتا ہے اور زیادہ تر قسمت کا ہوتا ہے۔","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"نارویجن قوانین 16 اکتوبر 2026 چیک کیے گئے","Norske kortspill · Krig":"Norske kortspill · Krig"},"vi":{"War Card Game":"Game Thẻ Chiến Tranh","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"Trò chơi thẻ bài chiến tranh trực tuyến — Chơi trận chiến thẻ bài cổ điển","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"Chơi trò chơi bài Chiến tranh cổ điển tại địa phương với hai đến bốn người chơi. Lật thẻ, giải quyết các ràng buộc bằng thẻ úp và ngửa và giữ mọi thẻ trên thiết bị này.","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"Lật lá bài trên cùng từ cọc của mỗi người chơi. Lá bài cao nhất sẽ thắng trận; cấp bậc ngang nhau bắt đầu một cuộc chiến tranh.","A quick example":"Ví dụ nhanh","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"A 10 đánh bại 6 bất kể bộ đồ. Nếu các lá bài trên cùng hòa nhau, mỗi người chơi trong trận chiến sẽ đặt một lá bài úp xuống và một lá bài ngửa lên; quân bài mới cao hơn sẽ chiếm được cọc.","How to play":"Cách chơi","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"Phiên bản này tuân theo các quy tắc Krig của Na Uy được kiểm tra đối với Norske kortspill. Hai đến bốn người chơi chia sẻ một bộ bài 52 tiêu chuẩn không có người pha trò. Các quân bài được chia úp xuống càng đều càng tốt; với ba người chơi, một lá bài được đặt sang một bên mà không thể nhìn thấy. Mọi người cùng nhau lật lá bài trên cùng. Thứ hạng cao nhất sẽ thắng tất cả các quân bài trên bàn; bộ đồ không quan trọng. Át cao nhất và 2 thấp nhất. Nếu lá bài cao nhất hòa, mỗi người chơi tham gia trận chiến đó sẽ đặt một lá bài úp xuống và sau đó một lá bài ngửa. Lá bài ngửa mới cao nhất sẽ chiếm toàn bộ cọc. Một chiếc cà vạt tiếp theo lặp lại bước tương tự. Người chơi không thể cung cấp cả hai quân bài chiến tranh sẽ thua; các lá bài còn lại của họ tham gia vào đống chiến đấu. Người chơi cuối cùng có thẻ sẽ thắng. Trò chơi thiên về may mắn, có thể mất nhiều thời gian và phiên bản này không yêu cầu ngăn chặn mọi trình tự lặp lại có thể xảy ra.","Frequently asked questions":"Câu hỏi thường gặp","How many players can play?":"Có bao nhiêu người chơi có thể chơi?","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"Chọn hai, ba hoặc bốn người chơi. Mọi người đều sử dụng một bộ bài 52 tiêu chuẩn.","Which card is highest?":"Thẻ nào cao nhất?","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"Át cao nhất, tiếp theo là vua, hậu, jack và 10 xuống còn 2. Bộ đồ không có cấp bậc.","What happens on a tie?":"Điều gì xảy ra với cà vạt?","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"Mỗi người chơi trong trận chiến đặt một lá bài úp và một lá bài ngửa. Lá bài ngửa mới cao hơn sẽ thắng tất cả các lá bài trên bàn.","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"Nếu tôi không có đủ quân bài cho một cuộc chiến thì sao?","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"Người chơi không thể hoàn thành cặp úp và ngửa sẽ thua. Những lá bài còn lại của họ vẫn ở trong đống chiến đấu.","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"Trò chơi này có yêu cầu tài khoản hoặc tải thẻ của tôi lên không?","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"Không. Trò chơi và tùy chọn lưu vẫn ở trong trình duyệt này trên thiết bị này.","Rules and limitations":"Quy tắc và giới hạn","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"Chiến tranh phần lớn là ngẫu nhiên và có thể kéo dài; một số đơn đặt hàng thẻ có thể lặp lại. Phiên bản này sử dụng một lá bài úp cho mỗi người chơi trong một cuộc chiến, bao gồm mọi người chơi trong trận chiến hòa và loại bỏ một người chơi không thể hoàn thành cặp xuống và lên. Người chơi CPU cục bộ chỉ cần lật bài. Không có dữ liệu trò chơi, tài khoản hoặc nhiều người chơi trực tuyến được tải lên.","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Chơi miễn phí. Thẻ, trạng thái khớp và tùy chọn lưu vẫn còn trên thiết bị này; không có gì được tải lên.","Play War":"Chơi chiến","Related tools":"Các công cụ liên quan","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"MIỄN PHÍ · CHẠY TRÊN TRÌNH DUYỆT CỦA BẠN","Language":"Ngôn ngữ","UsefulVerse":"Verse hữu ích","All tools":"Tất cả công cụ","Total players":"Tổng số người chơi","New game":"Trò chơi mới","Resume saved game":"Tiếp tục trò chơi đã lưu","Delete saved game":"Xóa trò chơi đã lưu","Export results":"Xuất kết quả","Eliminated":"Đã loại bỏ","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Bắt đầu trò chơi hoặc tiếp tục trò chơi đã lưu trên thiết bị này.","Flip cards":"Thẻ lật","Continue the war":"Tiếp tục cuộc chiến","Auto-play":"Tự động phát","Stop auto-play":"Dừng tự động phát","Auto-play paused.":"Tự động phát đã tạm dừng.","Auto-play speed":"Tốc độ tự động phát","Slow":"Chậm","Normal":"Bình thường","Fast":"Nhanh","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"Tự động chơi đã dừng do việc sắp xếp quân bài chính xác này lặp lại. Không có người chiến thắng nào được công bố; tiếp tục theo cách thủ công hoặc bắt đầu tự động phát lại.","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"Tự động phát đã dừng sau các hành động của 500 để giữ cho trang này phản hồi nhanh. Trò chơi có thể tiếp tục; chơi thủ công hoặc bắt đầu tự động chơi lại.","Your pile":"Cọc của bạn","Cards on the table":"Các quân bài trên bàn","Face down":"úp mặt xuống","No cards have been flipped yet.":"Chưa có lá bài nào được lật.","Player":"Người chơi","Computer {number}":"Máy tính {number}","You":"Bạn","Cards":"Thẻ","Flips":"Lật","Wars":"chiến tranh","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"Trò chơi bắt đầu. Lật lá bài trên cùng từ cọc của mỗi người chơi.","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} đã thắng trận và thu thập được các thẻ {count}.","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"Chiến tranh! Các thẻ cao nhất được gắn. Tiếp tục lật một lá bài xuống và một lá bài lên cho mỗi người chơi trong trận chiến.","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} đã thu thập tất cả các thẻ và giành chiến thắng trong trò chơi!","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"Không có người chơi nào có thể hoàn thành cuộc chiến. Trò chơi là một trận hòa.","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"Người chơi không có hai lá bài sẽ không thể kết thúc cuộc chiến và thua cuộc.","Game saved on this device.":"Trò chơi đã được lưu trên thiết bị này.","Saved game resumed.":"Trò chơi đã lưu được tiếp tục.","Saved game deleted.":"Đã xóa trò chơi đã lưu.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Tính năng lưu cục bộ không khả dụng; trò chơi này sẽ vẫn mở cho đến khi bạn rời khỏi trang.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Không thể đọc được trò chơi đã lưu. Bắt đầu một trò chơi mới hoặc xóa bản lưu bị hỏng.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Không có trò chơi nào được lưu trên thiết bị này.","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"Một bộ bài 52, không có trò đùa. Chia đều giữa những người chơi 2–4; dành một thẻ cho ba người chơi. Lá bài cao nhất sẽ thắng mỗi lần lật; bộ đồ không quan trọng. Át cao, 2 thấp. Khi hòa, mỗi người chơi trong trận chiến đặt một lá bài xuống và một lá bài lên. Thẻ ngửa cao nhất sẽ mất tất cả. Nếu bạn không thể hoàn thành một cuộc chiến, bạn sẽ thua. Trò chơi có thể kéo dài và chủ yếu là may mắn.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Quy tắc Na Uy đã kiểm tra 16 Tháng 10 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"Norske kortspill · Krig"},"zh":{"War Card Game":"战争卡牌游戏","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"战争卡牌游戏在线——玩经典卡牌对战","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"在本地与两到四名玩家一起玩经典的战争卡牌游戏。翻转卡片，通过面朝下和面朝上的卡片解决平局，并将每张卡片保留在此设备上。","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"翻转每个玩家牌堆中的顶牌。最大的牌赢得战斗；平等的队伍开始战争。","A quick example":"一个简单示例","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"无论花色如何，10 都会击败 6。如果顶牌平局，则战斗中的每位玩家将一张牌面朝下放置，一张牌面朝上；较高的新卡占据该堆。","How to play":"怎么玩","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"此版本遵循根据 Norske kortspill 检查的挪威克里格规则。两到四名玩家共用一副标准 52 牌，不带小丑。牌面朝下尽可能均匀地发牌；三名玩家中，一张牌会被搁置不可见。大家一起翻转最上面的牌。排名最高的玩家赢得桌上的所有牌；西装并不重要。 Ace 最高，2 最低。如果最大的牌平局，则参加该战斗的每位玩家将一张牌面朝下放置，然后将一张牌面朝上放置。最高的面朝上的新牌占据整堆牌。进一步的平局重复相同的步骤。无法提供两张战争卡的玩家失败；他们剩余的牌加入战斗堆。最后有牌的玩家获胜。该游戏是运气驱动的，可能需要很长时间，并且该版本并不声称可以防止所有可能的重复序列。","Frequently asked questions":"常见问题解答","How many players can play?":"有多少玩家可以玩？","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"选择两个、三个或四个玩家。每个人都使用一副标准的 52 卡牌。","Which card is highest?":"哪张卡最高？","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"A 最高，其次是 K、Q、J 和 10，直至 2。西装没有等级之分。","What happens on a tie?":"领带上会发生什么？","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"战斗中的每位玩家将一张牌面朝下，一张牌面朝上。较高的面朝上的新牌将赢得桌上的所有牌。","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"如果我没有足够的卡牌进行战争怎么办？","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"无法完成面朝下和面朝上对的玩家失败。他们剩余的牌留在战斗堆中。","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"这个游戏需要帐户或上传我的卡片吗？","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"编号游戏和可选的保存内容保留在此设备上的浏览器中。","Rules and limitations":"规则和限制","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"战争大多是偶然的，并且可以持续很长时间；某些卡订单可能会重复。此版本在战争期间每个玩家使用一张面朝下的牌，包括平局战斗中的每个玩家，并删除无法完成上下对的玩家。本地CPU 玩家只需翻牌即可。没有在线多人游戏、帐户或上传的游戏数据。","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"免费玩。卡牌、比赛状态和可选保存均保留在此设备上；没有上传任何内容。","Play War":"玩战争","Related tools":"相关工具","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"免费 · 在您的浏览器中运行","Language":"语言","UsefulVerse":"有用的诗句","All tools":"所有工具","Total players":"玩家总数","New game":"新游戏","Resume saved game":"恢复保存的游戏","Delete saved game":"删除已保存的游戏","Export results":"导出结果","Eliminated":"已消除","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"开始游戏或恢复此设备上保存的游戏。","Flip cards":"翻转卡","Continue the war":"继续战争","Auto-play":"自动播放","Stop auto-play":"停止自动播放","Auto-play paused.":"自动播放已暂停。","Auto-play speed":"自动播放速度","Slow":"慢","Normal":"普通","Fast":"快速","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"自动播放停止，因为重复了这种精确的卡片排列。没有宣布获胜者；手动继续或再次开始自动播放。","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"在执行 500 操作以保持此页面响应后自动播放停止。比赛可以继续；手动播放或重新开始自动播放。","Your pile":"你的一堆","Cards on the table":"桌上的卡片","Face down":"脸朝下","No cards have been flipped yet.":"尚未翻转任何卡片。","Player":"玩家","Computer {number}":"计算机 {number}","You":"你","Cards":"牌","Flips":"翻转","Wars":"战争","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"比赛开始了。翻转每个玩家牌堆中的顶牌。","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} 赢得了战斗并收集了 {count} 卡。","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"战争！最高的牌是平局。继续向战斗中的每位玩家展示一张朝下的牌和一张朝上的牌。","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} 收集所有牌并赢得游戏！","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"没有玩家能够完成战争。比赛结果是平局。","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"没有两张牌的玩家无法结束战争并失败。","Game saved on this device.":"游戏保存在此设备上。","Saved game resumed.":"已保存的游戏已恢复。","Saved game deleted.":"已保存的游戏已删除。","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"本地保存不可用；该游戏将保持打开状态，直到您离开页面。","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"无法读取已保存的游戏。开始新游戏或删除损坏的保存。","There is no saved game on this device.":"此设备上没有保存的游戏。","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"一副 52 牌，无小丑。在 2–4 玩家之间均匀分配；为三名玩家留出一张牌。每次翻牌时，最大的牌获胜；西装并不重要。 A 高，2 低。在平局时，战斗中的每个玩家都会放下一张牌，然后放下一张牌。最高的面朝上牌通吃。如果你不能完成一场战争，你就输了。这场比赛可能会很长，而且主要是运气。","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"挪威规则已检查 16 10 月 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"挪威科茨皮尔·克里格"},"zh_tw":{"War Card Game":"戰爭卡牌遊戲","War Card Game Online — Play the Classic Card Battle":"戰爭卡牌遊戲在線－玩經典卡對戰","Play the classic War card game locally with two to four players. Flip cards, resolve ties with face-down and face-up cards, and keep every card on this device.":"在本地與兩到四名玩家一起玩經典的戰爭卡牌遊戲。翻轉卡片，透過面朝下和麵朝上的卡片解決平局，並將每張卡片保留在此設備上。","Flip the top card from each player’s pile. The highest card wins the battle; equal ranks start a war.":"翻轉每位玩家牌堆中的頂牌。最大的牌贏得戰鬥；平等的隊伍開始戰爭。","A quick example":"一個簡單範例","A 10 beats a 6 regardless of suit. If the top cards tie, each player in the battle places one card face down and one face up; the higher new card takes the pile.":"無論花色如何，10 都會擊敗 6。如果頂牌平局，則戰鬥中的每位玩家將一張牌面朝下放置，一張牌面朝上；較高的新牌佔據該堆。","How to play":"怎麼玩","This version follows the Norwegian Krig rules checked against Norske kortspill. Two to four players share one standard 52-card deck without jokers. Cards are dealt face down as evenly as possible; with three players, one card is set aside unseen. Everyone flips the top card together. The highest rank wins all cards on the table; suits do not matter. Ace is highest and 2 is lowest. If the highest cards tie, every player who joined that battle places one card face down and then one face up. The highest new face-up card takes the entire pile. A further tie repeats the same step. A player who cannot supply both war cards loses; their remaining cards join the battle pile. The last player with cards wins. The game is luck-driven, may take a long time, and this version does not claim to prevent every possible repeating sequence.":"此版本遵循根據 Norske kortspill 檢查的挪威克里格規則。兩到四名玩家共用一副標準 52 牌，不帶小丑。牌面朝下盡可能均勻地發牌；三名玩家中，一張牌會被擱置不可見。大家一起翻轉最上面的牌。排名最高的玩家贏得桌上的所有牌；西裝並不重要。 Ace 最高，2 最低。如果最大的牌平局，則參加該戰鬥的每位玩家將一張牌面朝下放置，然後將一張牌面朝上放置。最高的面朝上的新牌佔據整堆牌。進一步的平局重複相同的步驟。無法提供兩張戰爭卡的玩家失敗；他們剩餘的牌加入戰鬥堆。最後有牌的玩家獲勝。該遊戲是運氣驅動的，可能需要很長時間，而且該版本並不聲稱可以防止所有可能的重複序列。","Frequently asked questions":"常見問題解答","How many players can play?":"有多少玩家可以玩？","Choose two, three or four players. Everyone uses one standard 52-card deck.":"選擇兩個、三個或四個玩家。每個人都使用一副標準的 52 卡牌。","Which card is highest?":"哪張卡片最高？","Ace is highest, followed by king, queen, jack and 10 down to 2. Suits have no rank.":"A 最高，其次是 K、Q、J 和 10，直至 2。西裝沒有等級之分。","What happens on a tie?":"領帶上會發生什麼事？","Each player in the battle puts one card face down and one face up. The higher new face-up card wins all cards on the table.":"戰鬥中的每位玩家將一張牌面朝下，一張牌面朝上。較高的面朝上的新牌將贏得桌上的所有牌。","What if I do not have enough cards for a war?":"如果我沒有足夠的卡片進行戰爭怎麼辦？","A player who cannot complete the face-down and face-up pair loses. Their remaining cards stay in the battle pile.":"無法完成面朝下和麵朝上對的玩家失敗。他們剩餘的牌留在戰鬥堆中。","Does this game require an account or upload my cards?":"這個遊戲需要帳號或上傳我的卡片嗎？","No. The game and optional save stay in this browser on this device.":"編號遊戲和選購的保存內容保留在此裝置上的瀏覽器中。","Rules and limitations":"規則與限制","War is mostly chance and can last a long time; some card orders may repeat. This version uses one face-down card per player during a war, includes every player from the tied battle, and removes a player who cannot complete the down-and-up pair. Local CPU players simply flip cards. There is no online multiplayer, account, or uploaded game data.":"戰爭大多是偶然的，並且可以持續很長時間；某些卡片訂單可能會重複。此版本在戰爭期間每個玩家使用一張面朝下的牌，包括平局戰鬥中的每個玩家，並刪除無法完成上下對的玩家。本地CPU 玩家只需翻牌即可。沒有線上多人遊戲、帳戶或上傳的遊戲數據。","Free to play. Cards, match state and optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"免費玩。卡牌、比賽狀態和可選保存均保留在此設備上；沒有上傳任何內容。","Play War":"玩戰爭","Related tools":"相關工具","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"免費 · 在您的瀏覽器中執行","Language":"語言","UsefulVerse":"有用的詩句","All tools":"所有工具","Total players":"玩家總數","New game":"新遊戲","Resume saved game":"恢復保存的遊戲","Delete saved game":"刪除已儲存的遊戲","Export results":"匯出結果","Eliminated":"已消除","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"開始遊戲或恢復此裝置上已儲存的遊戲。","Flip cards":"翻轉卡","Continue the war":"繼續戰爭","Auto-play":"自動播放","Stop auto-play":"停止自動播放","Auto-play paused.":"自動播放已暫停。","Auto-play speed":"自動播放速度","Slow":"慢","Normal":"普通","Fast":"快速","Auto-play stopped because this exact card arrangement repeated. No winner was declared; continue manually or start auto-play again.":"自動播放停止，因為重複了這種精確的卡片排列。沒有宣布獲勝者；手動繼續或再次開始自動播放。","Auto-play stopped after 500 actions to keep this page responsive. The game may continue; play manually or start auto-play again.":"在執行 500 操作以保持此頁面回應後自動播放停止。比賽可以繼續；手動播放或重新開始自動播放。","Your pile":"你的一堆","Cards on the table":"桌上的卡片","Face down":"臉朝下","No cards have been flipped yet.":"尚未翻轉任何卡片。","Player":"玩家","Computer {number}":"計算機 {number}","You":"你","Cards":"牌","Flips":"翻轉","Wars":"戰爭","Game started. Flip the top card from every player’s pile.":"比賽開始了。翻轉每個玩家牌堆中的頂牌。","{player} won the battle and collected {count} cards.":"{player} 贏得了戰鬥並收集了 {count} 卡。","War! The highest cards are tied. Continue to reveal one card down and one up for every player in the battle.":"戰爭！最高的牌是平手。繼續向戰鬥中的每位玩家展示一張朝下的牌和一張朝上的牌。","{player} collected all cards and won the game!":"{player} 收集所有牌並贏得遊戲！","No player could complete the war. The game is a draw.":"沒有玩家能夠完成戰爭。比賽結果是平手。","A player without two cards could not finish the war and loses.":"沒有兩張牌的玩家無法結束戰爭並失敗。","Game saved on this device.":"遊戲保存在此裝置上。","Saved game resumed.":"已儲存的遊戲已恢復。","Saved game deleted.":"已儲存的遊戲已刪除。","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"本地儲存不可用；遊戲將保持開啟狀態，直到您離開頁面。","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"無法讀取已儲存的遊戲。開始新遊戲或刪除損壞的保存。","There is no saved game on this device.":"此裝置上沒有儲存的遊戲。","One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.":"一副 52 牌，無小丑。在 2–4 玩家之間均勻分配；為三位玩家留出一張牌。每次翻牌時，最大的牌獲勝；西裝並不重要。 A 高，2 低。在平局時，戰鬥中的每個玩家都會放下一張牌，然後放下一張牌。最高的面朝上牌通吃。如果你不能完成一場戰爭，你就輸了。這場比賽可能會很長，而且主要是運氣。","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"挪威規則已檢查 16 10 月 2026","Norske kortspill · Krig":"挪威科茨皮爾·克里格"}});
